{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"5dc48e7c-1dd6-41dd-b04a-83eaee2d2e32","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the full problem space. Let me focus on Q4.2:\n\n**Q4.2**: 在单 GPU/NPU/加速器上，多算子/微算子并发的指令编排（instruction scheduling）和软件流水线（software pipelining）设计如何进行？具体包括：\n1. 指令级并行（ILP）——如何在单 warp/wavefront 内编排多条独立指令\n2. warp/wavefront 级调度——GPU warp scheduler 如何在 stalls 时切换到其他 warp\n3. software pipelining——如何通过异步拷贝（async copy / TMA / memcpy_async）将数据搬运与计算流水线化\n4. 指令混合——如何将 GEMM/attention 的 MMA 指令与 element-wise activation/normalization 的 ALU 指令混合调度\n\n预关键词: 指令编排, instruction scheduling, 指令级并行, instruction-level parallelism, ILP, 软件流水线, software pipelining, warp调度, warp scheduling, wavefront调度, wavefront scheduling, latency hiding, 延迟隐藏, occupancy, dual-issue, async copy, asynchronous copy, TMA, Tensor Memory Accelerator, memcpy_async, producer-consumer pipeline, producer-consumer流水线, MMA指令, MMA instruction, Tensor Core instruction, ALU指令混合, instruction mix, NPU VLIW, 超长指令字, TPU XLA指令, VLIW instruction bundle, register pressure, 寄存器压力, scoreboarding, dispatch unit, warp stall, computation unit utilization, 计算单元利用率, NVIDIA CUDA instruction pipeline, AMD ROCm wavefront, Ascend TBE/TIK\n\nNow I need to do the semantic segmentation. Let me break Q4.2 into logical chain nodes:\n\nS1: ILP - 单warp/wavefront内编排多条独立指令（global memory load 与 compute 重叠、Tensor Core MMA 与 shared memory store 并行）\n- 逻辑角色：核心机制（ILP）\n- 核心概念: ILP, dual-issue, instruction-level parallelism, warp, wavefront, load-compute overlap, MMA shared memory parallel\n\nS2: warp/wavefront 级调度 - GPU warp scheduler 在 stalls 时切换到其他 warp，warp 调度的 fairness 与并发粒度\n- 逻辑角色：核心机制（warp调度）\n- 核心概念: warp scheduler, warp scheduling, wavefront scheduling, latency hiding, stall, occupancy, fairness\n\nS3: software pipelining - async copy / TMA / memcpy_async 将 global→shared memory 数据搬运与计算流水线化，producer-consumer 流水线\n- 逻辑角色：核心机制（软件流水线）\n- 核心概念: software pipelining, async copy, TMA, memcpy_async, producer-consumer pipeline, global to shared memory\n\nS4: 指令混合 - GEMM/attention 的 MMA 指令与 element-wise activation/normalization 的 ALU 指令混合调度\n- 逻辑角色：核心机制（指令混合）\n- 核心概念: MMA instruction, Tensor Core, ALU instruction mix, GEMM, attention, element-wise\n\nS5: 硬件平台差异 - GPU SIMT dual-issue vs NPU VLIW vs TPU VLIW/XLA 在指令并行度、寄存器压力、流水线深度方面的差异\n- 逻辑角色：后端/硬件平台对比\n- 核心概念: dual-issue, VLIW, XLA, instruction parallelism, register pressure, pipeline depth, GPU SIMT, NPU VLIW, TPU\n\nNow let me start the search process. I'll search across all four directories for each chain node with the Level A/B/C approach.\n\nLet me begin with all Level A searches across the four directories. I'll do them in parallel for efficiency.\n\nActually, let me think about what queues to build. The key concepts are:\n\nFor S1 (ILP):\n- \"instruction-level parallelism\" warp\n- ILP dual-issue GPU\n- \"load compute overlap\" \"shared memory\"\n- \"Tensor Core MMA\" \"shared memory store\" parallel\n\nFor S2 (warp scheduling):\n- \"warp scheduler\" stall\n- \"warp scheduling\" fairness\n- \"latency hiding\" warp occupancy\n- \"wavefront scheduling\"\n\nFor S3 (software pipelining):\n- \"software pipelining\" async copy\n- TMA \"Tensor Memory Accelerator\" memcpy_async\n- \"producer-consumer pipeline\" shared memory\n- \"global to shared memory\" pipelining\n\nFor S4 (instruction mix):\n- \"MMA instruction\" \"ALU instruction\" mix\n- \"Tensor Core\" \"element-wise\" interleaving\n- \"instruction mix\" GPU compute utilization\n\nFor S5 (hardware platform differences):\n- \"dual-issue\" VLIW GPU NPU TPU\n- \"register pressure\" pipeline depth\n- \"instruction parallelism\" hardware comparison\n- NPU VLIW \"超长指令字\"\n\nLet me start with Level A searches. I'll need to be strategic about which queries to run - there are many. Let me start with the most promising queries first, using parallel searches.","signature":"5dc48e7c-1dd6-41dd-b04a-83eaee2d2e32"}],"stop_reason":null,"sto