on-intrusive\",\"offset\":2185},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":2227},{\"match\":\"GPUs\",\"offset\":2299}],\"excerpt\":\"## GPU Hardware Dispatch Unit (GPU硬件调度单元)\\n术语是什么？\\nGPU Hardware Dispatch Unit（GPU硬件调度单元）是NVIDIA GPU中负责block-to-SM调度的专用硬件模块，实现在GPU的GigaThread Engine或equivalent硬件中。它接收来自CUDA streams的kernel block队列，根据每个SM的可用资源（thread capacity、shared memory、registers）和block的资源需求，将block分配到合适的SM执行。Dispatch unit采用left-over sc…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/UWMMA (Unified Warp-level Matrix Multiply-Accumulate).md\",\"basename\":\"UWMMA (Unified Warp-level Matrix Multiply-Accumulate)\",\"score\":1435.6336899257187,\"foundWords\":[\"warp\",\"warp:\",\"warp-level\",\"scheduler\",\"gpu\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Warp-level\",\"offset\":18},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":90},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":115},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":456},{\"match\":\"warp:\",\"offset\":558},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":2046},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":2307},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":2351},{\"match\":\"scheduler\",\"offset\":2356}],\"excerpt\":\"## UWMMA (Unified Warp-level Matrix Multiply-Accumulate)\\n术语是什么？\\nUWMMA 是 Uni-STC 论文提出的统一 warp 级矩阵乘累加指令序列接口，用于替代传统 GPU dense tensor core 的 MMA 指令。UWMMA 由三类指令组成——stc.load（同步收集 BBC 格式的 metadata 和数值）、stc.task（异步触发 TMS/DPG 硬件生成 task queue）、stc.numeric（检查 READY/BUSY 状态驱动 SDPU 执行）——将稀疏计算的控制流从\\\"gather data\\\"转为\\\"gather tasks\\\"模式…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Actor-Based Warp Specialization for In-Kernel Scheduling.md\",\"basename\":\"Actor-Based Warp Specialization for In-Kernel Scheduling\",\"score\":1329.166179354357,\"foundWords\":[\"warp\",\"warpinclusivesum\",\"warpid\",\"warp,\",\"warp-group\",\"warps,\",\"warps\",\"scheduler\",\"scheduler。scheduler\",\"schedule\",\"gpu\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Warp\",\"offset\":15},{\"match\":\"Warp\",\"offset\":118},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":153},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":190},{\"match\":\"warp-group\",\"offset\":337},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset