":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/SM Partitioning（SM分区）_ GPU Spatial Multiplexing（GPU空间多路复用）.md\",\"basename\":\"SM Partitioning（SM分区）_ GPU Spatial Multiplexing（GPU空间多路复用）\",\"score\":1219.0786903087164,\"foundWords\":[\"warp\",\"scheduler和tensor\",\"scheduler将各分区的block映射到对应sm执行。\",\"scheduler将各分区的block映射到对应sm执行\",\"gpu\",\"gpu空间多路复用\",\"gpu的thread\",\"gpu的sm组织结构\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":26},{\"match\":\"GPU空间多路复用\",\"offset\":51},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":89},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":118},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":248},{\"match\":\"GPU的SM组织结构\",\"offset\":266},{\"match\":\"Warp\",\"offset\":367},{\"match\":\"Scheduler和Tensor\",\"offset\":372},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":494},{\"match\":\"GPU的Thread\",\"offset\":594},{\"match\":\"Scheduler将各分区的block映射到对应SM执行。\",\"offset\":611},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":963},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":1005}],\"excerpt\":\"## SM Partitioning（SM分区）/ GPU Spatial Multiplexing（GPU空间多路复用）\\n术语是什么？\\nSM Partitioning（也称GPU Spatial Multiplexing）是一种将GPU的流式多处理器(SM)按空间划分为多个独立子集的技术，每个子集可同时执行不同的计算任务。与时间多路复用(Time Multiplexing)不同，空间多路复用允许多个kernel或计算阶段在同一时刻真正并行执行。\\n从硬件架构角度拆解术语：\\nSM分区在GPU硬件层面的运转：\\n1. **GPU的SM组织结构**：以H200 (Arch 9.0)为例，共有132个SM，通过GPC (Graphics Pro…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/In-Kernel Work-Conserving Task Scheduler.md\",\"basename\":\"In-Kernel Work-Conserving Task Scheduler\",\"score\":1176.2843889683957,\"foundWords\":[\"warp\",\"warpbroadcast\",\"warpinclusivesum\",\"warp（32\",\"scheduler\",\"scheduled\",\"gpu\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Scheduler\",\"offset\":34},{\"match\":\"warp（32\",\"offset\":135},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":256},{\"match\":\"scheduled\",\"offset\":458},{\"match\":\"Warp\",\"offset\":584},{\"match\":\"WarpInclusiveSum\",\"offset\":638},{\"match\":\"WarpBroadcast\",\"offset\":866},{\"match\":\"Warp\",\"offset\":941},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":1017},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":1098},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":1102}],\"excerpt\":\"## In-Kernel Work-Conserving Task Scheduler\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nFlashMoE megakernel 的核心管理组件，由 OS block 中 1 个 warp（32 threads）实现。属性：(1) work-conserving——有 task 就分配；(2) multithreaded——32 threads 并行 sweep doorbells；(3) in-kernel——运行 GPU 上，无需 CPU 干预。Doorbell 是 monotonic counter（非 binary flag），避免丢失 concurrent 更新…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/GPU Scoreboard and Throttle Stalls.md\",\"basename\":\"GPU Scoreboard and Throttle Stalls\",\"score\":1003.2680768369255,\"foundWords\":[\"warp\",\"warp.pc\",\"warp发出ldg\",\"warp:\",\"scheduler\",\"scheduler每cycle为每个warp尝试issue指令（a100:\",\"scheduler每cycle为每个warp尝试issue指令\",\"scheduler的两种主要stall类型。scoreboard\",\"scheduler的两种主要stall类型\",\"scheduler，每cycle最多issue\",\"gpu\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":61},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":104},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":108},{\"match\":\"scheduler的两种主要stall类型。Scoreboard\",\"offset\":113},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":154},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":259},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":309},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":341},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":439},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":443},{\"match\":\"scheduler每cycle为每个warp尝试issue指令（A100:\",\"offset\":448},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":493},{\"match\":\"scheduler，每cycle最多issue\",\"offset\":498},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":536},{\"match\":\"Warp\",\"offset\":547},{\"match\":\"Scheduler\",\"offset\":552},{\"match\":\"warp:\",\"offset\":593},{\"match\":\"warp.PC\",\"offset\":627},{\"match\":\"Warp发出LDG\",\"offset\":888},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":1114},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":1196},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":1729}],\"excerpt\":\"## GPU Scoreboard and Throttle Stalls\\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nGPU Scoreboard Stall和Throttle Stall是NVIDIA GPU warp scheduler的两种主要stall类型。Scoreboard stall发生在warp需要等待data dependency（如global memory load未完成，register file data未就绪），指令无法issue因为操作数不可用。Throttle stall发生在warp需要的执行单元（如FP32 unit、Tensor Core、LD/ST uni…\"},{\"fil