active warp数量（主要受register和shared memory per-thread使用量约束），Arithmetic Intensity = #arithmetic_ops / #bytes_accessed，控制计算与访存的比值（通过tile size调节数据复用度）。三者竞争有限的register file和shared memory资源：更高ILP…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Priority Streams (CUDA Stream Priority Scheduling).md\",\"basename\":\"Priority Streams (CUDA Stream Priority Scheduling)\",\"score\":192.66307972723334,\"foundWords\":[\"warp\",\"warp）；\",\"scheduler\",\"scheduler:\",\"schedule\",\"gpu\",\"gpu-internal\",\"gpus\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":247},{\"match\":\"scheduler\",\"offset\":264},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":1047},{\"match\":\"Scheduler:\",\"offset\":1064},{\"match\":\"schedule\",\"offset\":1162},{\"match\":\"schedule\",\"offset\":1188},{\"match\":\"schedule\",\"offset\":1300},{\"match\":\"schedule\",\"offset\":1326},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":2201},{\"match\":\"scheduler\",\"offset\":2227},{\"match\":\"GPU-internal\",\"offset\":2340},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":2441},{\"match\":\"scheduler\",\"offset\":2446},{\"match\":\"warp）；\",\"offset\":2515},{\"match\":\"GPUs\",\"offset\":2645}],\"excerpt\":\"…s 并发机制，允许同一 OS 进程内的不同 CUDA stream 被赋予三级优先级（-2 最低 / -1 / 0 最高）。当多个 stream 都有 pending thread blocks 时，GPU thread block scheduler 会优先从高优先级 stream 取 block 进行调度。但关键限制是：**priority streams 不抢占已在 SM 上执行的 block**——高优先级 kernel 到达后必须等待低优先级 kernel 的已执行 blocks 自然完成（SM draining），仅能插队调度后续 blocks。因此 priority streams 适用于短 kernel 之间的调度优化，对 long-running kernel（>1ms）的效果受限于 compounded delay。\\n从kernel调度角度拆解术语，比如术语所在ker…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Load-as-Compressed, Compute-as-Dense Pipeline (压缩加载-稠密计算流水线).md\",\"basename\":\"Load-as-Compressed, Compute-as-Dense Pipeline (压缩加载-稠密计算流水线)\",\"score\":182.7884953213124,\"foundWords\":[\"warp\",\"warp-tile。mustafar\",\"warp-tile\",\"warp-1\",\"warps\",\"scheduler\",\"gpu\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":136},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":206},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":229},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":871},{\"match\":\"WARP\",\"offset\":1379},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":1450},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":1545},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":1584},{\"match\":\"WARP-1\",\"offset\":1653},{\"match\":\"WARP\",\"offset\":1710},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":2090},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":2456},{\"match\":\"warps\",\"offset\":2751},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":2952},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":2956},{\"match\":\"scheduler\",\"offset\":2961},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":3256},{\"match\":\"warp-tile。Mustafar\",\"offset\":3269},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":3328},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":3718}],\"excerpt\":\"Load-as-Compressed, Compute-as-Dense 是一种 GPU kernel 设计范式，由 FlashLLM [Xia et al., VLDB 2023] 首次提出，用于加速非结构化稀疏矩阵的 GPU 计算。核心思想：稀疏矩阵以压缩格式从 GPU global memory (HBM) 加载到 SM 的 registers（减少 HBM 带宽消耗），在 shared memory 中解压为稠密 tile，再送入 Tensor Core 执行标准 dense GEMM（利用 Tensor Core 的高 FP16 throughput）。Mustafar 将该范式从 LLM weight projection 层适配到 KV cache atten…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Megakernel _ Fused Persistent Kernel for Distributed MoE.md\",\"basename\":\"Megakernel _ Fused Persistent Kernel for Distributed MoE\",\"score\":162.12199488538084,\"foundWords\":[\"warp\",\"warpinclusivesum\",\"scheduler\",\"scheduler。scheduler\",\"scheduler,\",\"gpu\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":323},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":439},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":450},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":563},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":673},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":860},{\"match\":\"Scheduler\",\"offset\":1009},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":1056},{\"match\":\"Scheduler,\",\"offset\":1065},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":1076},{\"match\":\"Scheduler。Scheduler\",\"offset\":1293},{\"match\":\"WarpInclusiveSum\",\"offset\":1331},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":1574}],\"excerpt\":\"…kernel 以 persistent 方式运行——一次 launch 后持续执行，在 kernel 内完成全部计算和通信，直到所有工作完成才返回。与传统的 \\\"CPU launch kernel → GPU execute → return → CPU launch next kernel → ...\\\" 模式相比，mega