ntion Kernels (GPU注意力Kernel的软件流水线)","score":1289.0501508047669,"foundWords":["warp","warp**：对已加载的","warp**：使用","scheduler","gpu","gpu注意力kernel的软件流水线"],"matches":[{"match":"GPU","offset":27},{"match":"GPU注意力Kernel的软件流水线","offset":50},{"match":"GPU","offset":154},{"match":"Warp","offset":332},{"match":"warp**：使用","offset":372},{"match":"warp**：对已加载的","offset":485},{"match":"GPU","offset":568},{"match":"warp","offset":572},{"match":"scheduler","offset":577},{"match":"Warp","offset":719},{"match":"Warp","offset":804},{"match":"GPU","offset":1455},{"match":"warp","offset":1535}],"excerpt":"## Software Pipelining for GPU Attention Kernels (GPU注意力Kernel的软件流水线)\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。\nSoftware Pipelining（软件流水线）是一种经典的编译器优化技术（Lam, 1988），在 GPU attention kernel 中指将内存加载（HBM→SRAM）与 Tensor Core 计算（MMA）组织为流水线阶段，使第 i+1 个 KV block 的内存加载与第 i 个 block 的 Tensor Core 计算在时间上重叠。核心目标是隐藏 HBM 访存延迟，保持 Tensor Core 持续运行。\n该论文中的软件…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/SM Partitioning（SM分区）_ GPU Spatial Multiplexing（GPU空间多路复用）.md","basename":"SM Partitioning（SM分区）_ GPU Spatial Multiplexing（GPU空间多路复用）","score":1219.0786903087164,"foundWords":["warp","scheduler和tensor","scheduler将各分区的block映射到对应sm执行。","scheduler将各分区的block映射到对应sm执行","gpu","gpu空间多路复用","gpu的thread","gpu的sm组织结构"],"matches":[{"match":"GPU","offset":26},{"match":"GPU空间多路复用","offset":51},{"match":"GPU","offset":89},{"match":"GPU","offset":118},{"match":"GPU","offset":248},{"match":"GPU的SM组织结构","offset":266},{"match":"Warp","offset":367},{"match":"Scheduler和Tensor","offset":372},{"match":"GPU","offset":494},{"match":"GPU的Thread","offset":594},{"match":"Scheduler将各分区的block映射到对应SM执行。","offset":611},{"match":"GPU","offset":963},{"match":"GPU","offset":1005}],"excerpt":"## SM Partitioning（SM分区）/ GPU Spatial Multiplexing（GPU空间多路复用）\n术语是什么？\nSM Partitioning（也称GPU Spatial Multiplexing）是一种将GPU的流式多处理器(SM)按空间划分为多个独立子集的技术，每个子集可同时执行不同的计算任务。与时间多路复用(Time Multiplexing)不同，空间多路复用允许多个kernel或计算阶段在同一时刻真正并行执行。\n从硬件架构角度拆解术语：\nSM分区在GPU硬件层面的运转：\n1. **GPU的SM组织结构**：以H200 (Arch 9.0)为例，共有132个SM，通过GPC (Graphics Pro…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/In-Kernel Work-Conserving Task Scheduler.md","basename":"In-Kernel Work-Conserving Task Scheduler","score":1176.2843889683957,"foundWords":["warp","warpbroadcast","warpinclusivesum","warp（32","scheduler","scheduled","gpu"],"matches":[{"match":"Scheduler","offset":34},{"match":"warp（32","offset":135},{"match":"GPU","offset":256},{"match":"scheduled","offset":458},{"match":"Warp","offset":584},{"match":"WarpInclusiveSum","offset":638},{"match":"WarpBroadcast","offset":866},{"match":"Warp","offset":941},{"match":"GPU","offset":1017},{"match":"GPU","offset":1098},{"match":"warp","offset":1102}],"excerpt":"## In-Kernel Work-Conserving Task Scheduler\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nFlashMoE megakernel 的核心管理组件，由 OS block 中 1 个 warp（32 threads）实现。属性：(1) work-conserving——有 task 就分配；(2) multithreaded——32 threads 并行 sweep doorbells；(3) in-kernel——运行 GPU 上，无需 CPU 干预。Doorbell 是 monotonic counter（非 binary flag），避免丢失 concurrent 更新…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/GPU Scoreboard and Throttle Stalls.md","basename":"GPU Scoreboard and Throttle Stalls","score":1003.2680768369255,"foundWords":["warp","warp.pc","warp发出ldg","warp:","scheduler","scheduler每cycle为每个warp尝试issue指令（a100:","scheduler每cycle为每个warp尝试issue指令","scheduler的两种主要stall类型。scoreboard","scheduler的两种主要stall类型","scheduler，每cycle最多issue","gpu"],"matches":[{"match":"GPU","offset":3},{"match":"GPU","offset":61},{"match":"GPU","offset":104},{"match":"warp","offset":108},{"match":"scheduler的两种主要stall类型。Scoreboard","offset":113},{"match":"warp","offset":154},{"match":"warp","offset":259},{"match":"warp","offset":309},{"match":"GPU","offset":341},{"match":"GPU","offset":439},{"match":"warp","offset":443},{"match":"scheduler每cycle为每个warp尝试issue指令（A100:","offset":448},{"match":"warp","offset":493},{"match":"scheduler，每cycle最多issue","offset":498},{"match":"warp","offset":536},{"match":"Warp","offset":547},{"match":"Sche