":"WARPS","offset":2516}],"excerpt":"LCSF (Load-Compute-Store-Finish) Template 是 ThunderKittens 提出的统一异步 GPU kernel 编程模型，基于经典生产者-消费者范式。它将 thread block 内的 warp 划分为两种角色——load/store worker（负责 HBM ↔ shared memory 数据搬运）和 compute worker（负责 register/shared memory 内计算）——并将 kernel 分解为四个阶段函数：Load（指定从 HBM 异步加载哪些 tile 到 shared memory pipeline buffer，通过 arrive barrier 通知 compute worker）、Compute（用 tile 操作原语执行 mma/so…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/CUDA CUTLASS.md","basename":"CUDA CUTLASS","score":212.3559455226046,"foundWords":["warp","warps而非split","warps而非split-k）。cutlass","warps而非split-k","warpshape","scheduler","scheduler（含","gpu"],"matches":[{"match":"warp","offset":197},{"match":"warp","offset":374},{"match":"WarpShape","offset":1486},{"match":"GPU","offset":1824},{"match":"warp","offset":2111},{"match":"warps而非split-K）。CUTLASS","offset":2155},{"match":"GPU","offset":2862},{"match":"scheduler（含","offset":3448}],"excerpt":"…A 开发的开源 header-only CUDA C++ 模板库，用于实现高性能矩阵乘法（GeMM）及相关线性代数计算。它将 GeMM 计算分解为层次化的 tile-based 计算结构，从线程级到 warp 级（32 线程）到 thread block 级（CTA）到 kernel 级再到 device 级。CUTLASS 3.x 引入 CuTe 库用于定义和操作多维线程与数据布局，支持 Tensor Core（Volta 到 Blackwell）、混合精度（FP64/FP32/TF32/FP16/BF16/FP8/INT8/INT4 等）以及 warp specialization 等高级特性。本论文使用 CUTLASS 3.1 的 GeMM 和 Conv2D kernel 作为实验基础。\n从kernel调度角度拆解术语：\nCUTLASS GeMM kernel 的 tile-bas…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/CuTe-DSL (CUTLASS CuTe DSL).md","basename":"CuTe-DSL (CUTLASS CuTe DSL)","score":205.36152133997385,"foundWords":["warp","warpgroup_commit","warpgroup_arrive","warpgroup","warp:","warp-specialized","scheduler","gpu"],"matches":[{"match":"GPU","offset":204},{"match":"warp","offset":271},{"match":"warp-specialized","offset":465},{"match":"scheduler","offset":545},{"match":"warp","offset":841},{"match":"warp","offset":1141},{"match":"warp:","offset":1236},{"match":"warp","offset":1380},{"match":"warpgroup_arrive","offset":1470},{"match":"warpgroup_commit","offset":1532},{"match":"warp-specialized","offset":1824},{"match":"GPU","offset":2448}],"excerpt":"…CUDA Templates for Linear Algebra Subroutines）的 C++ template-based domain-specific language，用于编写高性能 GPU GEMM kernel。CuTe 的核心抽象是将矩阵运算分解为 tile、atom 和 copy 操作，通过模板参数静态调度 warp specialization、TMA load/store、WGMMA/UMMA 指令和 pipeline synchronization。不同于 Triton（Python DSL → MLIR → PTX），CuTe 直接生成 PTX 和 SASS，给开发者对异步硬件操作的完全控制。SonicMoE 完全基于 CuTe-DSL 编写 8 个 MoE kernel，利用其 warp-specialized pipeline、TMA descripto…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/ILP_TLP_Arithmetic Intensity Trade-off in DNN Kernels.md","basename":"ILP_TLP_Arithmetic Intensity Trade-off in DNN Kernels","score":196.86508458268918,"foundWords":["warp数量（主要受register和shared","warp数量","warps固定分配，gpu","warps固定分配","warps但每warp内指令串行依赖多","scheduler将每组4连续warp","gpu"],"matches":[{"match":"GPU","offset":171},{"match":"warp数量（主要受register和shared","offset":291},{"match":"warps但每warp内指令串行依赖多","offset":1193},{"match":"GPU","offset":1955},{"match":"warps固定分配，GPU","offset":2100},{"match":"scheduler将每组4连续warp","offset":2114}],"excerpt":"ILP (Instruction-Level Parallelism)、TLP (Thread-Level Parallelism) 和 Arithmetic Intensity 是GPU DNN kernel优化的三维trade-off空间。ILP控制单warp内独立指令的并行度（通过register file中tile size和instruction scheduling控制），TLP控制SM内并发active warp数量（主要受register和shared memory per-thread使用量约束），Arithmetic Intensity = #arithmetic_ops / #bytes_accessed，控制计算与访存的比值（通过tile size调节数据复用度）。三者竞争有限的register file和shared memory资源：更高ILP…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Priority Streams (CUDA Stream Priority Scheduling).md","basename":"Priority Streams (CUDA Stream Priority Scheduling)","score":192.66307972723334,"foundWords":["warp","warp）；","scheduler","scheduler:","schedule","gpu","gpu-internal","gpus"],"matches":[{"match":"GPU","offset":247},{"match":"scheduler","offset":264},{"match":"GPU","offset":1047},{"match":"Scheduler:","offset":1064},{"match":"schedule","offset":1162},{"match":"schedule","offset":1188},{"match":"schedule","offset":1300},{"match":"schedule","offset":1326},{"match":"GPU"