{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_00_s1O5p9xR9lcOEgD38EAq5639","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/mma.sp PTX Instruction (Sparse Matrix Multiply-Accumulate PTX 指令).md\",\"basename\":\"mma.sp PTX Instruction (Sparse Matrix Multiply-Accumulate PTX 指令)\",\"score\":4217.352103629092,\"foundWords\":[\"mma\",\"mma.sp）通过\",\"mma.sp\",\"tensor\",\"core\",\"core（sptc）的\",\"cores\",\"instruction\",\"pipeline\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"mma.sp\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Instruction\",\"offset\":14},{\"match\":\"mma.sp\",\"offset\":78},{\"match\":\"Tensor\",\"offset\":116},{\"match\":\"Core（SpTC）的\",\"offset\":123},{\"match\":\"mma\",\"offset\":286},{\"match\":\"mma.sp\",\"offset\":458},{\"match\":\"mma.sp\",\"offset\":521},{\"match\":\"mma.sp\",\"offset\":1065},{\"match\":\"MMA\",\"offset\":1077},{\"match\":\"mma.sp\",\"offset\":1177},{\"match\":\"mma.sp\",\"offset\":1987},{\"match\":\"mma.sp\",\"offset\":2058},{\"match\":\"Pipeline\",\"offset\":2134},{\"match\":\"mma.sp）通过\",\"offset\":2211},{\"match\":\"pipeline\",\"offset\":2226},{\"match\":\"mma\",\"offset\":2587},{\"match\":\"mma\",\"offset\":2591},{\"match\":\"mma.sp\",\"offset\":2724},{\"match\":\"mma.sp\",\"offset\":2824},{\"match\":\"Tensor\",\"offset\":3187},{\"match\":\"Cores\",\"offset\":3194}],\"excerpt\":\"## mma.sp PTX Instruction (Sparse Matrix Multiply-Accumulate PTX 指令)\\n术语是什么？\\n`mma.sp` 是 NVIDIA PTX ISA 中用于调用 Sparse Tensor Core（SpTC）的 warp-level matrix multiply-accumulate 指令，从 PTX ISA 7.0（CUDA 11.0+，SM80 Ampere）开始可用。它允许程序员在 CUDA inline PTX assembly 中直接触发 SpTC 硬件执行 2:4 结构化稀疏矩阵乘法。与标准 `mma.sync` 指令的关键区别…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Multi-stage Register Pipeline (for SpMV on Tensor Cores).md\",\"basename\":\"Multi-stage Register Pipeline (for SpMV on Tensor Cores)\",\"score\":3576.377926535717,\"foundWords\":[\"mma\",\"mma:\",\"tensor\",\"cores\",\"instruction\",\"pipeline\",\"pipeline参数\",\"pipeline_wait_prior\",\"pipeline_commit\",\"pipelined\",\"pipeline（delaysmem=1,\",\"pipeline）相比\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Pipeline\",\"offset\":24},{\"match\":\"Tensor\",\"offset\":46},{\"match\":\"Cores\",\"offset\":53},{\"match\":\"Pipeline\",\"offset\":90},{\"match\":\"MMA\",\"offset\":396},{\"match\":\"Pipeline\",\"offset\":629},{\"match\":\"Pipeline参数\",\"offset\":656},{\"match\":\"pipeline_commit\",\"offset\":978},{\"match\":\"pipeline_wait_prior\",\"offset\":1091},{\"match\":\"instruction\",\"offset\":1266},{\"match\":\"pipeline_wait_prior\",\"offset\":1381},{\"match\":\"instruction\",\"offset\":1543},{\"match\":\"MMA:\",\"offset\":1584},{\"match\":\"MMA\",\"offset\":1609},{\"match\":\"pipeline_wait_prior\",\"offset\":1799},{\"match\":\"MMA\",\"offset\":1831},{\"match\":\"pipeline（delaySMEM=1,\",\"offset\":1874},{\"match\":\"pipeline\",\"offset\":2056},{\"match\":\"pipeline_wait_prior\",\"offset\":2084},{\"match\":\"Pipeline）相比\",\"offset\":2268},{\"match\":\"Pipeline\",\"offset\":2403},{\"match\":\"pipeline\",\"offset\":2492},{\"match\":\"Pipelined\",\"offset\":2609},{\"match\":\"Tensor\",\"offset\":2654},{\"match\":\"Cores\",\"offset\":2661}],\"excerpt\":\"## Multi-stage Register Pipeline (for SpMV on Tensor Cores)\\n术语是什么？\\nMulti-stage Register Pipeline 是 Drawloom 为解决 SpMV 中 memory-compute 串行化导致的 warp stall 而提出的 GPU kernel 流水线设计。将 SpMV 的四大操作步骤——Fetch Sparse A (FS)、Fetch Column ID (FCid)、Load Vector X (LX)、TC Computation (Comp)——重构为五个流水线阶段：FillSMEM（async-copy 将 sparse A + CID…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Tensor-Vector Parallelism Scheduling (ILP_TLP for Softmax).md\",\"basename\":\"Tensor-Vector Parallelism Scheduling (ILP_TLP for Softmax)\",\"score\":2455.378763766028,\"foundWords\":[\"mma\",\"mma的issue\",\"mma指令和vector指令，使vector指令在tensor\",\"mma指令和vector指令\",\"mma）和vectorized部分（executed\",\"tensor\",\"tensor+vector\",\"tensorized:\",\"tensorized\",\"tensor-vector\",\"如tensor\",\"core\",\"core），并通过架构特定的调度技术使两