ht到SMEM并切分为fine-grained tasks，多个Compute WG竞争获取这些tasks并各自完成dequantization+MMA。关键…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/CUTLASS（CUDA Templates for Linear Algebra Subroutines）.md","basename":"CUTLASS（CUDA Templates for Linear Algebra Subroutines）","score":553.1760037574788,"foundWords":["mma","mma）和persistent","tensor","core","core的所有精度模式（包括int4的mma.sync.aligned.m16n8k32等），并提供software","core的所有精度模式","instruction","instructionshape:","instructionshape","pipeline","pipeline、epilogue","pipeline。"],"matches":[{"match":"pipeline","offset":321},{"match":"Tensor","offset":370},{"match":"Core的所有精度模式（包括INT4的mma.sync.aligned.m16n8k32等），并提供software","offset":377},{"match":"pipeline、epilogue","offset":436},{"match":"InstructionShape:","offset":1113},{"match":"MMA","offset":1144},{"match":"instruction","offset":1148},{"match":"pipeline","offset":1185},{"match":"pipeline","offset":1875},{"match":"Tensor","offset":1935},{"match":"MMA","offset":1964},{"match":"MMA）和persistent","offset":1979},{"match":"MMA","offset":2068},{"match":"pipeline。","offset":2072},{"match":"instruction","offset":2200},{"match":"Core","offset":2507}],"excerpt":"…k tile、warp tile和thread-level fragment的层次化tiling结构，通过模板参数配置数据精度（FP16/BF16/INT8/INT4/FP8等）、tile size、pipeline stages等，自动生成针对特定GPU架构优化的kernel。CUTLASS支持Tensor Core的所有精度模式（包括INT4的mma.sync.aligned.m16n8k32等），并提供software pipeline、epilogue fusion（如dequantization+scaling）等高级特性。\n从编译框架角度拆解术语：\nCUTLASS的层次化GEMM抽象（以INT4 GEMM为例）：\n```\n// CUTLASS INT4 GEMM template结构\nusing Gemm = cutlass::gemm::device::Gemm<\n  i…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/CUTLASS.md","basename":"CUTLASS","score":400.2238048005575,"foundWords":["mma","tensor","core","core或cuda","core）。cutlass提供data-movement和multiply-accumulation类，允许用户在gpu线程层次的所有级别组合自定义gemm-like计算。","instruction","instructionshape","pipeline","pipelined"],"matches":[{"match":"instruction","offset":313},{"match":"MMA","offset":325},{"match":"Tensor","offset":331},{"match":"Core或CUDA","offset":338},{"match":"Core）。CUTLAS