a","tensor","core","instruction","pipeline","pipeline:"],"matches":[{"match":"pipeline:","offset":2650},{"match":"Tensor","offset":2861},{"match":"Core","offset":2868},{"match":"MMA","offset":2873},{"match":"instruction","offset":3953}],"excerpt":"// Multi-stage pipeline: overlap global→shared load with compute\n    for k in range(0, K, BLOCK_K):\n        a = tl.load(A_ptr, ...)  // global→shared (async)\n        b = tl.load(B_ptr, ...)\n        acc += tl.dot(a, b)      // Tensor Core MMA\n    \n    // Add bias (element-wise, fused in same kernel)\n    acc += bias…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/DeviceConfig.md","basename":"DeviceConfig","score":230.39237773314915,"foundWords":["mma","tensor","core","instruction","pipeline"],"matches":[{"match":"Tensor","offset":118},{"match":"mma","offset":262},{"match":"MMA","offset":266},{"match":"instruction","offset":270},{"match":"Core","offset":329},{"match":"Tensor","offset":799},{"match":"Core","offset":1094},{"match":"pipeline","offset":1225},{"match":"MMA","offset":1587},{"match":"Core","offset":1611}],"excerpt":"DeviceConfig 是 MetaAttention 中用于抽象硬件配置的组件，与 IntermediateTensor 共同定义 attention kernel 的 scheduling space。DeviceConfig 封装两类硬件约束：(1) **BaseTileShape（basetile）**——目标硬件上矩阵乘法指令的 optimal tile shape，如 H100 wgmma MMA instruction 要求 tile 对齐到 {64,128}×{128,64}，AMD MI250 Matrix Core 要求对齐到 {64,64}；同时约束 memory transaction 的 alignment 要求（如 128B cacheline）；(2) **MemoryI…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/UWMMA (Unified Warp-level Matrix Multiply-Accumulate).md","basename":"UWMMA (Unified Warp-level Matrix Multiply-Accumulate)","score":226.96111024368705,"foundWords":["mma","tensor","core","instruction","pipeline"],"matches":[{"match":"MMA","offset":5},{"match":"MMA","offset":68},{"match":"tensor","offset":125},{"match":"core","offset":132},{"match":"MMA","offset":139},{"match":"MMA","offset":148},{"match":"MMA","offset":323},{"match":"MMA","offset":351},{"match":"MMA","offset":421},{"match":"pipeline","offset"