{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_00_BzvNWeOM2wedsrRtzkqw9505","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Warp Specialization (Warp 专业化).md\",\"basename\":\"Warp Specialization (Warp 专业化)\",\"score\":4004.4699846906005,\"foundWords\":[\"warp\",\"warps。\",\"warps\",\"specialization\",\"specialization：通过分析\",\"specialization；\",\"specialization）是\",\"specialization:\",\"specialization（也称\",\"producer\",\"producer_threads\",\"producer/consumer\",\"consumer\",\"warp specialization\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"warp specialization\",\"offset\":683},{\"match\":\"Warp Specialization\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Warp\",\"offset\":24},{\"match\":\"Warp Specialization\",\"offset\":80},{\"match\":\"Specialization）是\",\"offset\":113},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":166},{\"match\":\"producer/consumer\",\"offset\":178},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":202},{\"match\":\"producer\",\"offset\":247},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":256},{\"match\":\"consumer\",\"offset\":330},{\"match\":\"warps\",\"offset\":339},{\"match\":\"producer\",\"offset\":445},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":454},{\"match\":\"consumer\",\"offset\":478},{\"match\":\"warps\",\"offset\":487},{\"match\":\"Warp Specialization\",\"offset\":534},{\"match\":\"producer/consumer\",\"offset\":575},{\"match\":\"warp specialization\",\"offset\":683},{\"match\":\"Warp Specialization\",\"offset\":843},{\"match\":\"warps\",\"offset\":1008},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":1026},{\"match\":\"warp specialization\",\"offset\":1039},{\"match\":\"Producer\",\"offset\":1064},{\"match\":\"warps\",\"offset\":1073},{\"match\":\"Consumer\",\"offset\":1120},{\"match\":\"warps\",\"offset\":1129},{\"match\":\"Producer\",\"offset\":1278},{\"match\":\"Warp\",\"offset\":1287},{\"match\":\"Consumer\",\"offset\":1307},{\"match\":\"Warp\",\"offset\":1316},{\"match\":\"Producer\",\"offset\":2064},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":2073},{\"match\":\"consumer\",\"offset\":2087},{\"match\":\"warps\",\"offset\":2096},{\"match\":\"Warp Specialization\",\"offset\":2150},{\"match\":\"PRODUCER_THREADS\",\"offset\":2215},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":2256},{\"match\":\"specialization；\",\"offset\":2267},{\"match\":\"warp specialization\",\"offset\":2366},{\"match\":\"Warp Specialization\",\"offset\":2411},{\"match\":\"warp specialization\",\"offset\":2489},{\"match\":\"producer/consumer\",\"offset\":2516},{\"match\":\"warps。\",\"offset\":2534}],\"excerpt\":\"…/consumer 角色 → 按 threadIdx 分离执行路径 → 使用 Live Variable Analysis 确定同步点 → 插入 mbarrier 同步原语。TileLang 的自动 warp specialization 使得其 FlashAttention 实现（~70 行 Python）能达到 FlashAttention-3（手写 CUDA）98% 的性能。\\n从硬件架构角度拆解术语，比如术语如何在硬件架构中发挥作用，给出术语在硬件架构中运转流程的具体例子。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nWarp Specialization 在 Hopper SM 内的执行流程（以 TileLang FlashAttention kernel 为例）：\\n```\\nSM 配置（T.Kernel(batch, heads//min(B_H, kv_group), threads=25…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Actor-Based Warp Specialization for In-Kernel Scheduling.md\",\"basename\":\"Actor-Based Warp Specialization for In-Kernel Scheduling\",\"score\":3179.706897668778,\"foundWords\":[\"warp\",\"warpinclusivesum\",\"warpid\",\"warp,\",\"warp-group\",\"warps,\",\"warps\",\"specialization\",\"producer\",\"producer/consumer\",\"consumer\",\"warp specialization\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Warp Specialization\",\"offset\":15},{\"match\":\"Warp Specialization\",\"offset\":118},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":190},{\"match\":\"warp-group\",\"offset\":337},{\"match\":\"specialization\",\"offset\":348},{\"match\":\"producer/consumer\",\"offset\":364},{\"match\":\"warps,\",\"offset\":524},{\"match\":\"warp,\",\"offset\":602},{\"match\":\"WarpInclusiveSum\",\"offset\":921},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":1032},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":1347},{\"match\":\"warpId\",\"offset\":1365},{\"match\":\"warp-group\",\"offset\":1571},{\"match\":\"producer/consumer\",\"offset\":1588}],\"excerpt\":\"## Actor-Based Warp Specialization for In-Kernel Scheduling\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nActor-Based Warp Specialization 是 FlashMoE 提出的 GPU kernel 内并发编程模型：将 thread block 内的 warp 按功能角色 (actor) 特化——每个 actor 独立异步执行特定职责，通过 shared memory/global memory signal (doorbell/flag) 进行 loose coupling 的 event-dr…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Wavefront Specialization（波前专业化）.md\",\"basename\":\"Wavefront Specialization（波前专业化）\",\"score\":2782.3872724896664,\"foundWords\":[\"warp\",\"warpsize）\",\"warpsize\",\"warps\",\"specialization\",\"specialization实现方式：\",\"specialization实现方式\",\"specialization最初由bauer等人（ppopp'14,\",\"specialization最初由bauer等人\",\"specialization的痛点：同一kernel在不同gpu上的最优配置不同（r9\",\"specialization的痛点\",\"specialization）是gpu\",\"specialization（4\",\"specialization（波前专业化）\",\"specialization（也称warp\",\"producer\",\"producer,\",\"consumer\",\"consumer分工\",\"consumers\",\"warp specialization\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Specialization（波前专业化）\",\"offset\":13},{\"match\":\"Specialization（也称warp\",\"offset\":69},{\"match\":\"specialization）是GPU\",\"offset\":91},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":154},{\"match\":\"producer\",\"offset\":198},{\"match\":\"consumer分工\",\"offset\":207},{\"match\":\"producer\",\"offset\":233},{\"match\":\"consumer\",\"offset\":308},{\"match\":\"producer\",\"offset\":433},{\"match\":\"consumer\",\"offset\":462},{\"match\":\"specialization最初由Bauer等人\",\"offset\":547},{\"match\":\"specialization\",\"offset\":752},{\"match\":\"Producer,\",\"offset\":886},{\"match\":\"Consumers\",\"offset\":908},{\"match\":\"Producer\",\"offset\":928},{\"match\":\"producer\",\"offset\":1220},{\"match\":\"Consumer\",\"offset\":1241},{\"match\":\"producer\",\"offset\":1349},{\"match\":\"consumer\",\"offset\":1773},{\"match\":\"consumer\",\"offset\":1820},{\"match\":\"specialization的痛点：同一kernel在不同GPU上的最优配置不同（R9\",\"offset\":1874},{\"match\":\"specialization实现方式：\",\"offset\":2078},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":2211},{\"match\":\"specialization（4\",\"offset\":2222},{\"match\":\"warps\",\"offset\":2239},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":2249},{\"match\":\"producer\",\"offset\":2261},{\"match\":\"consumer\",\"offset\":2273},{\"match\":\"producer\",\"offset\":2382},{\"match\":\"consumer\",\"offset\":2391},{\"match\":\"warps\",\"offset\":2400},{\"match\":\"warpSize）\",\"offset\":2486},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":2586}],\"excerpt\":\"## Wavefront Specialization（波前专业化）\\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nWavefront Specialization（也称warp specialization）是GPU kernel编程优化技术，将workgroup内的wavefront（NVIDIA术语warp）分配不同角色，而非所有wavefront执行相同指令（传统SIMT模式）。典型producer-consumer分工：一个或多个dedicated producer wavefront专门执行memory transfer（如ATT load从global memory搬运tile到LDS），其余consu…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Named Barriers (Hopper).md\",\"basename\":\"Named Barriers (Hopper)\",\"score\":895.4131056329346,\"foundWords\":[\"warp\",\"warp发出iteration\",\"warpgroup）：\",\"warpgroup通过命名的prod/cons\",\"warpgroup通过命名的prod\",\"warpgroup:\",\"warpgroup_wait\",\"warpgroup_sync\",\"warpgroup\",\"warp可安全复用s\",\"warp可安全复用sa/sb\",\"warp可安全复用sa\",\"warp:\",\"warp和compute\",\"warps\",\"specialization的关键基础设施——dma\",\"specialization的关键基础设施\",\"producer\",\"producer-consumer通信\",\"producer设置barrier的期望值\",\"consumer通信\",\"consumer同步\",\"warp specialization\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"warp specialization\",\"offset\":103},{\"match\":\"warp specialization\",\"offset\":103},{\"match\":\"warp和compute\",\"offset\":135},{\"match\":\"warpgroup通过命名的prod/cons\",\"offset\":148},{\"match\":\"producer\",\"offset\":182},{\"match\":\"consumer同步\",\"offset\":191},{\"match\":\"producer设置barrier的期望值\",\"offset\":602},{\"match\":\"warp:\",\"offset\":717},{\"match\":\"warpgroup:\",\"offset\":740},{\"match\":\"warpgroup_sync\",\"offset\":812},{\"match\":\"warpgroup_wait\",\"offset\":882},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":1110},{\"match\":\"warpgroup）：\",\"offset\":1125},{\"match\":\"warp发出iteration\",\"offset\":1147},{\"match\":\"warps\",\"offset\":1270},{\"match\":\"warpgroup_sync\",\"offset\":1300},{\"match\":\"warpgroup_wait\",\"offset\":1335},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":1392},{\"match\":\"warp可安全复用sA/sB\",\"offset\":1445},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":1926},{\"match\":\"producer-consumer通信\",\"offset\":1968}],\"excerpt\":\"NVIDIA Hopper架构引入的同步原语，允许线程通过名称（ID）而非隐式barrier对象进行同步。Named barriers是实现warp specialization的关键基础设施——DMA warp和compute warpgroup通过命名的prod/cons barriers实现producer-consumer同步。\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nNamed Barriers是Hopper SM内置的硬件同步机制（替代/增强Ampere的隐式barrier）。核心设计：(1) 每个SM提供固定数量的可编程barrier对象（Hopper上通常12-16个），每个由名称/ID索引；(2) 线程通过`arrive`操作将barrier计数器加1，通过`wa…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/CuTe-DSL (CUTLASS CuTe DSL).md\",\"basename\":\"CuTe-DSL (CUTLASS CuTe DSL)\",\"score\":558.3350473830316,\"foundWords\":[\"warp\",\"warpgroup_commit\",\"warpgroup_arrive\",\"warpgroup\",\"warp:\",\"warp-specialized\",\"specialization\",\"specialization）\",\"specialization、tma\",\"producer\",\"producer-consumer\",\"consumer\",\"consumer_0\",\"warp specialization\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"warp specialization\",\"offset\":271},{\"match\":\"warp specialization\",\"offset\":271},{\"match\":\"warp-specialized\",\"offset\":465},{\"match\":\"warp specialization\",\"offset\":841},{\"match\":\"warp specialization\",\"offset\":1141},{\"match\":\"Producer\",\"offset\":1227},{\"match\":\"warp:\",\"offset\":1236},{\"match\":\"producer\",\"offset\":1273},{\"match\":\"Consumer\",\"offset\":1371},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":1380},{\"match\":\"consumer_0\",\"offset\":1427},{\"match\":\"warpgroup_arrive\",\"offset\":1470},{\"match\":\"warpgroup_commit\",\"offset\":1532},{\"match\":\"warp-specialized\",\"offset\":1824},{\"match\":\"producer-consumer\",\"offset\":2298}],\"excerpt\":\"…domain-specific language，用于编写高性能 GPU GEMM kernel。CuTe 的核心抽象是将矩阵运算分解为 tile、atom 和 copy 操作，通过模板参数静态调度 warp specialization、TMA load/store、WGMMA/UMMA 指令和 pipeline synchronization。不同于 Triton（Python DSL → MLIR → PTX），CuTe 直接生成 PTX 和 SASS，给开发者对异步硬件操作的完全控制。SonicMoE 完全基于 CuTe-DS