249},{\"match\":\"producer\",\"offset\":2261},{\"match\":\"consumer\",\"offset\":2273},{\"match\":\"producer\",\"offset\":2382},{\"match\":\"consumer\",\"offset\":2391},{\"match\":\"warps\",\"offset\":2400},{\"match\":\"warpSize）\",\"offset\":2486},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":2586}],\"excerpt\":\"## Wavefront Specialization（波前专业化）\\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nWavefront Specialization（也称warp specialization）是GPU kernel编程优化技术，将workgroup内的wavefront（NVIDIA术语warp）分配不同角色，而非所有wavefront执行相同指令（传统SIMT模式）。典型producer-consumer分工：一个或多个dedicated producer wavefront专门执行memory transfer（如ATT load从global memory搬运tile到LDS），其余consu…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Named Barriers (Hopper).md\",\"basename\":\"Named Barriers (Hopper)\",\"score\":895.4131056329346,\"foundWords\":[\"warp\",\"warp发出iteration\",\"warpgroup）：\",\"warpgroup通过命名的prod/cons\",\"warpgroup通过命名的prod\",\"warpgroup:\",\"warpgroup_wait\",\"warpgroup_sync\",\"warpgroup\",\"warp可安全复用s\",\"warp可安全复用sa/sb\",\"warp可安全复用sa\",\"warp:\",\"warp和compute\",\"warps\",\"specialization的关键基础设施——dma\",\"specialization的关键基础设施\",\"producer\",\"producer-consumer通信\",\"producer设置barrier的期望值\",\"consumer通信\",\"consumer同步\",\"warp specialization\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"warp specialization\",\"offset\":103},{\"match\":\"warp specialization\",\"offset\":103},{\"match\":\"warp和compute\",\"offset\":135},{\"match\":\"warpgroup通过命名的prod/cons\",\"offset\":148},{\"match\":\"producer\",\"offset\":182},{\"match\":\"consumer同步\",\"offset\":191},{\"match\":\"producer设置barrier的期望值\",\"offset\":602},{\"match\":\"warp:\",\"offset\":717},{\"match\":\"warpgroup:\",\"offset\":740},{\"match\":\"warpgroup_sync\",\"offset\":812},{\"match\":\"warpgroup_wait\",\"offset\":882},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":1110},{\"match\":\"warpgroup）：\",\"offset\":1125},{\"match\":\"warp发出iteration\",\"offset\":1147},{\"match\":\"warps\",\"offset\":1270},{\"match\":\"warpgroup_sync\",\"offset\":1300},{\"match\":\"warpgroup_wait\",\"offset\":1335},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":1392},{\"match\":\"warp可安全复用sA/sB\",\"offset\":1445},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":1926},{\"match\":\"producer-consumer通信\",\"offset\":1968}],\"excerpt\":\"NVIDIA Hopper架构引入的同步原语，允许线程通过名称（ID）而非隐式barrier对象进行同步。Named barriers是实现warp specialization的关键基础设施——DMA warp和compute warpgroup通过命名的prod/cons barriers实现producer-consumer同步。\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nNamed Barriers是Hopper SM内置的硬件同步机制（替代/增强Ampere的隐式barrier）。核心设计：(1) 每个SM提供固定数量的可编程barrier对象（Hopper上通常12-16个），每个由名称/ID索引；(2) 线程通过`arrive`操作将barrier计数器加1，通过`wa…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/CuTe-DSL (CUTLASS CuTe DSL).md\",\"basename\":\"CuTe-DSL (CUTLASS CuTe DSL)\",\"score\":558.3350473830316,\"foundWords\":[\"warp\",\"warpgroup_commit\",\"warpgroup_arrive\",\"warpgroup\",\"warp:\",\"warp-specialized\",\"specialization\",\"specialization）\",\"specialization、tma\",\"producer\",\"producer-consumer\",\"consumer\",\"consumer_0\",\"warp specialization\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"warp specialization\",\"offset\":271},{\"match\":\"warp specialization\",\"offset\":271},{\"match\":\"warp-specialized\",\"offset\":465},{\"match\":\"warp specialization\",\"offset\":841},{\"match\":\"warp specialization\",\"offset\":1141},{\"match\":\"Producer\",\"offset\":1227},{\"match\":\"warp:\",\"offset\":1236},{\"match\":\"producer\",\"offset\":1273},{\"match\":\"Consumer\",\"offset\":1371},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":1380},{\"match\":\"consumer_0\",\"offset\":1427},{\"match\":\"warpgroup_arrive\",\"offset\":1470},{\"match\":\"warpgroup_commit\",\"offset\":1532},{\"match\":\"warp-specialized\",\"offset\":1824},{\"match\":\"producer-consumer\",\"offset\":2298}],\"excerpt\":\"…domain-specific language，用于编写高性能 GPU GEMM kernel。CuTe 的核心抽象是将矩阵运算分解为 tile、atom 和 copy 操作，通过模板参数静态调度 warp specialization、TMA load/store、WGMMA/UMMA 指令和 pipeline synchronization。不同于 Triton（Python DSL → MLIR → PTX），CuTe 直接生成 PTX 和 SASS，给开发者对异步硬件操作的完全控制。SonicMoE 完全基于 CuTe-DSL 编写 8 个 MoE kernel，利用其 warp-specialized pipeline、TMA descriptor、Ping-Pong scheduling 和 persistent tile scheduler 等特性。\\n从编译框架角度拆解术…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/CUTLASS.md\",\"basename\":\"CUTLASS\",\"score\":494.9850651085097,\"foundWords\":[\"warp\",\"warp内的矩阵乘\",\"warp,\",\"warp级别:\",\"warp级别\",\"warpshape\",\"specialization\",\"specialization：producer\",\"producer\",\"producer/consumer\",\"consumer\",\"warp specialization\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":169},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":287},{\"match\":\"warp内的矩阵乘\",\"offset\":299},{\"match\":\"WarpShape\",\"offset\":628},{\"match\":\"warp,\",\"offset\":673},{\"match\":\"Warp级别:\",\"offset\":942},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":952},{\"match\":\"producer/consumer\",\"offset\":972},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":990},{\"match\":\"Warp specialization\",\"offset\":1571},{\"match\":\"Producer\",\"offset\":1591},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":1600},{\"match\":\"Consumer\",\"offset\":1624},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":1633}],\"excerpt\":\"…nes and Solvers）是NVIDIA开发的开源CUDA C++模板库，用于编写高性能GEMM（通用矩阵乘法）及GEMM-like计算。它通过多层模板抽象将GPU的线程层次结构（thread→warp→threadblock/CTA→grid）映射到矩阵计算的分块层次结构。CUTLASS将GEMM表示为一个tiled triple-loop nest：最外层CTA级tile循环（计算output tile，沿k轴迭代）、中间warp级tile循环（warp内的矩阵乘）、最内层instruction级MMA操作（Tensor Core或CUDA Core）。CUTLASS提供data-movement和multiply-accumulation类，允许用户在GPU线程层次的所有级别组合自定义GEMM-like计算。\\n从编译框架角度拆解术语：\\nCUTLASS的工作流程（以GEMM k…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Tensor Memory Accelerator (TMA) in FlashAttention-3.md\",\"basename\":\"Tensor Memory Accelerator (TMA) in FlashAttention-3\",\"score\":464.51851359366117,\"foundWords\":[\"warp\",\"warpgroup：在整个\",\"warpgroups：通过\",\"warpgroups\",\"warpgroup\",\"warp，register-deallocated\",\"warp（1\",\"specialization\",\"producer\",\"producer-consumer\",\"consumer\",\"warp specialization\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"warp specialization\",\"offset\":2259},{\"match\":\"warp\",\"offset\":230},{\"match\":\"Producer\",\"offset\":731},{\"match\":\"warpgroup：在整个\",\"offset\":740},{\"match\":