specialization（也称warp","producer","producer,","consumer","consumer分工","consumers","warp specialization"],"matches":[{"match":"Specialization（波前专业化）","offset":13},{"match":"Specialization（也称warp","offset":69},{"match":"specialization）是GPU","offset":91},{"match":"warp","offset":154},{"match":"producer","offset":198},{"match":"consumer分工","offset":207},{"match":"producer","offset":233},{"match":"consumer","offset":308},{"match":"producer","offset":433},{"match":"consumer","offset":462},{"match":"specialization最初由Bauer等人","offset":547},{"match":"specialization","offset":752},{"match":"Producer,","offset":886},{"match":"Consumers","offset":908},{"match":"Producer","offset":928},{"match":"producer","offset":1220},{"match":"Consumer","offset":1241},{"match":"producer","offset":1349},{"match":"consumer","offset":1773},{"match":"consumer","offset":1820},{"match":"specialization的痛点：同一kernel在不同GPU上的最优配置不同（R9","offset":1874},{"match":"specialization实现方式：","offset":2078},{"match":"warp","offset":2211},{"match":"specialization（4","offset":2222},{"match":"warps","offset":2239},{"match":"warp","offset":2249},{"match":"producer","offset":2261},{"match":"consumer","offset":2273},{"match":"producer","offset":2382},{"match":"consumer","offset":2391},{"match":"warps","offset":2400},{"match":"warpSize）","offset":2486},{"match":"warp","offset":2586}],"excerpt":"## Wavefront Specialization（波前专业化）\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nWavefront Specialization（也称warp specialization）是GPU kernel编程优化技术，将workgroup内的wavefront（NVIDIA术语warp）分配不同角色，而非所有wavefront执行相同指令（传统SIMT模式）。典型producer-consumer分工：一个或多个dedicated producer wavefront专门执行memory transfer（如ATT load从global memory搬运tile到LDS），其余consu…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Named Barriers (Hopper).md","basename":"Named Barriers (Hopper)","score":895.4131056329346,"foundWords":["warp","warp发出iteration","warpgroup）：","warpgroup通过命名的prod/cons","warpgroup通过命名的prod","warpgroup:","warpgroup_wait","warpgroup_sync","warpgroup","warp可安全复用s","warp可安全复用sa/sb","warp可