fset":1141},{"match":"Producer","offset":1227},{"match":"warp:","offset":1236},{"match":"producer","offset":1273},{"match":"Consumer","offset":1371},{"match":"warp","offset":1380},{"match":"consumer_0","offset":1427},{"match":"warpgroup_arrive","offset":1470},{"match":"warpgroup_commit","offset":1532},{"match":"warp-specialized","offset":1824},{"match":"producer-consumer","offset":2298}],"excerpt":"…domain-specific language，用于编写高性能 GPU GEMM kernel。CuTe 的核心抽象是将矩阵运算分解为 tile、atom 和 copy 操作，通过模板参数静态调度 warp specialization、TMA load/store、WGMMA/UMMA 指令和 pipeline synchronization。不同于 Triton（Python DSL → MLIR → PTX），CuTe 直接生成 PTX 和 SASS，给开发者对异步硬件操作的完全控制。SonicMoE 完全基于 CuTe-DSL 编写 8 个 MoE kernel，利用其 warp-specialized pipeline、TMA descriptor、Ping-Pong scheduling 和 persistent tile scheduler 等特性。\n从编译框架角度拆解术…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/CUTLASS.md","basename":"CUTLASS","score":494.9850651085097,"foundWords":["warp","warp内的矩阵乘","warp,","warp级别:","warp级别","warpshape","specialization","specialization：producer","producer","producer/consumer","consumer","warp specialization"],"matches":[{"match":"warp","offset":169},{"match":"warp","offset":287},{"match":"warp内的矩阵乘","offset":299},{"match":"WarpShape","offset":628},{"match":"warp,","offset":673},{"match":"Warp级别:","offset":942},{"match":"warp","offset":952},{"match":"producer/consumer","offset":972},{"match":"warp","offset":990},{"match":"Warp specialization","offset":1571},{"match":"Producer","offset":1591},{"match":"warp","offset":1600},{"match":"Consumer","offset":1624},{"match":"warp","offset":1633}],"excerpt":"…nes and Solvers）是NVIDIA开发的开源CUDA C++模板库，用于编写高性能GEMM（通用矩阵乘法）及GEMM-like计算。它通过多层模板抽象将GPU的线程层次结构（thread→warp→threadblock/CTA→grid）映射到矩阵计算的分块层次结构。CUTLASS将GEMM表示为一个tiled triple-loop nest：最外层CTA级tile循环（计算output tile，沿k轴迭代）、中间warp级tile循环（warp内的矩阵乘）、最内层instruction级MMA操作（Tensor Core或CUDA Core）。CUTLASS提供data-movement和multiply-accumulation类，允许用户在GPU线程层次的所有级别组合自定义GEMM-like计算。\n从编译框架角度拆解术语：\nCUTLASS的工作流程（以GEMM k…"},{"filename":"k