es (Compute Unit Heterogeneity on GPU).md","basename":"CUDA Cores vs Tensor Cores (Compute Unit Heterogeneity on GPU)","score":333.38612576100047,"foundWords":["warp","warp用tensor","warp用cuda","specialization","specialization（cutlass,","producer","consumer","warp specialization"],"matches":[{"match":"核心约束。Warp specializ","offset":1447},{"match":"分配到不","offset":1510},{"match":"warp：pro","offset":1515},{"match":"ucer warp","offset":1524},{"match":"ment，con","offset":1558},{"match":"umer warp用T","offset":1567},{"match":"进一步利","offset":1609}],"excerpt":"CUDA Cores和Tensor Cores的异构性是现代GPU编程的核心约束。Warp specialization（CUTLASS, FlashAttention-3）利用这种异构性将不同任务分配到不同warp：producer warp用CUDA Cores+TMA做data movement，consumer warp用Tensor Cores做MMA。LiquidGEMM的ImFP进一步利用warp group级别的异构：Load WG(TMA)、Compute WG(CUDA+Tensor)并发。关键设计原则：最小化CUDA Cores上的工作负载（LiquidQuant的α=0.875 vs QServe的α≥10），使CUDA Cores不成为p…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Block Sparse Flash Decoding Kernel.md","basename":"Block Sparse Flash Decoding Kernel","score":324.2121658522731,"foundWords":["warp","specialization","specialization/pipelining）和","producer","producer（tma","consumer","consumer（tensor","warp specialization"],"matches":[{"match":"warp specialization","offset":667},{"match":"warp","offset":616},{"match":"warp specialization","offset":667},{"match":"Warp specialization","offset":3567},{"match":"Producer（TMA","offset":3595},{"match":"Consumer（Tensor","offset":3615}],"excerpt":"4. **双重实现**：TileLang（自动应用 tiling/warp specialization/pipelining）和 Triton（相同调度策略的手动实现）两个版本\n从kernel调度角度拆解术语，比如术语所在kernel调度的伪代码或具体计算过程，给出具体例子。\n```\n// Block Sparse Flash Decoding Kernel (TileLang 伪代码)\n// Grid: (batch, heads_kv, num_splits)，其中 num_splits = ceil(max_selected_blocks / BLOCKS_PER_SPLIT)\n__global__ void block_sparse_flas…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/TileLang JIT Compiler Pipeline.md","basename":"TileLang JIT Compiler Pipeline","score":296.38306269541306,"foundWords":["warp","specialization","specialization: