lism Scheduling (ILP_TLP for Softmax).md | 2455.4 | FlashAttention-T ILP/TLP：tensor MMA 与 vector ALU 指令交错调度 |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Implicit Fine-Grained Pipeline (ImFP).md | 1737.9 | LiquidGEMM ImFP：single-producer multiple-consumer、跨 WG dequant+MMA 重叠 |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Software Pipeline (T.Pipelined).md | 359.6 | TileLang T.Pipelined：Ampere/Hopper/AMD CDNA 三架构 pipeline 伪代码 |\n| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Named Barriers (Hopper).md | 895.4 | Hopper Named Barriers：TMA 硬件写入、单周期原子操作 |\n| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/CUDA Cores vs Tensor Cores.md | 333.4 | GPU 异构计算单元：CUDA Core vs Tensor Core 吞吐差距 16.5× |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Fine-grained Pipelined Dataflow.md | 283.4 | HLX 4 级细粒度流水线：DPE#0→RVPE→DPE#1→UpE |\n| paper_secs/secs_2026/37-RoMeo.../3-Algorithm...md | 975.4 | RoMeo software pipeline + separate-kernels 实现 cross-precision GEMM |\n| paper_secs/secs_effAttn/Hardware-Efficient_Attention...md | 266.9 | GLA kernel：asynchronous software pipelining + warp specialization |\n| experiment_notes/.../MetaAttention...md | 433.9 | MetaAttention scheduling：two-layer policy (tile config + tile resource) |\n\n---\n\n## 检索上下文映射\n\n### S1: ILP — 单 warp/wavefront 内编排多条独立指令\n- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Tensor-Vector Parallelism Scheduling (ILP_TLP for Softmax).md` (score: 2455.4): FlashAttention-T Ampere ILP Scheduling —— warp 内均匀交叉 repurposed tensor MMA 和 vector 指令\n- `paper_secs/secs_2026/37-RoMeo.../3-Algorithm...md` (score: 975.4): 通过控制 shared memory 消耗→释放寄存器用于 instruction-level parallelism\n- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Multi-stage Register Pipeline (for SpMV on Tensor Cores).md` (score: 3576.4): delaySMEM/delayREG 控制多级寄存器流水线重叠\n\n### S2: warp/wavefront 级调度 — stalls 时切换到其他 warp\n- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Warp Scheduler (NVIDIA GPU).md` (score: 3339.9): Warp Scheduler greedy-then-oldest 策略、零成本 warp 切换\n- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Wavefront Specialization（波前专业化）.md` (score: 2782.4): Producer wavefront 异步 ATT load → Consumer wavefronts 计算\n- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Actor-Based Warp Specialization for In-Kernel Scheduling.md` (score: 3179.7): FlashMoE 纯软件 event-driven actor 模型\n\n### S3: software pipelining — async copy/TMA/memcpy_async\n- `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Tensor Memory Accelerator (TMA).md` (score: 5104.2): TMA 硬件端到端完成、mbarrier 自动同步\n- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Software Pipelining for GPU Attention Kernels.md` (score: 3306.4): Producer warp TMA load || Consumer warp MMA\n- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Software Pipeline (T.Pipelined).md` (score: 359.6): Ampere cp.async / Hopper TMA / AMD CDNA 三架构 pipeline 伪代码\n- `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Asynchronous Memory Copy (async-copy).md` (score: 2924.1): cp.async PTX → LDGSTS 硬件实现\n- `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Named Barriers (Hopper).md` (score: 895.4): Named Barrier 硬件计数 → producer-consumer 零延迟同步\n- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Implicit Fine-Grained Pipeline (ImFP).md` (score: 1737.9): Load WG TMA → Compute WG 竞争 task → 跨 WG dequant+MMA 重叠\n- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Fine-grained Pipelined Dataflow.md` (score: 283.4): HLX 4 级流水线 DPE#0→RVPE→DPE#1→UpE\n\n### S4: 指令混合 — MMA 与 element-wise ALU 指令混合调度\n- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Tensor-Vector Parallelism Scheduling (ILP_TLP for Softmax).md` (score: 2455.4): ILP interleaving → tensor MMA 的 issue bubble 中执行 vector 指令\n- `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/CUDA Cores vs Tensor Cores (Compute Unit Heterogeneity on GPU).md` (score: 333.4): CUDA Core vs Tensor Core 吞吐差距模型\n- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Implicit Fine-Grained Pipeline (ImFP).md` (score: 1737.9): 跨 Compute WG 的 dequant(CUDA Core) + MMA(Tensor Core) 自然重叠\n\n### S5: 平台差异 — GPU SIMT / NPU VLIW / TPU XLA\n- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Software Pipeline (T.Pipelined).md` (score: 359.6): Ampere cp.async vs Hopper TMA vs AMD CDNA s_waitcnt\n- 笔记未明确覆盖 NPU 昇腾达芬奇 VLIW 指令编排细节和 TPU XLA VLIW 指令编排细节\n\n---\n\n## 一、方法细节：指令编排与软件流水线（主内容）\n\n### 方法1：Warp Scheduler 驱动的延迟隐藏 (Latency Hiding via Warp Scheduling)\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Warp Scheduler (NVIDIA GPU).md` (score: 3339.9)\n\n**方法细节**:\n\nNVIDIA GPU 的 Warp Scheduler 通过零成本 warp 切换实现延迟隐藏。每个 SM 内 4 个 warp scheduler units 独立管理 warp pool 中的 ready warps，当某 warp 因 global memory load 或 execution dependency 产生 stall 时，scheduler 立即切换到另一 ready warp 发射指令。\n\n```\n// Per-SM, per-cycle warp scheduling（推测模型）\nfunction warp_scheduler_cycle(sm):\n    for each of 4 warp_scheduler_units in sm:\n        eligible_warps = []\n        for warp in scheduler.warp_pool:\n            if warp.is_ready():  // 无 data hazard, 无 memory stall\n                eligible_warps.append(warp)\n\n        if eligible_warps is empty:\n            issue NOP  // idle cycle\n            continue\n\n        // 调度策略（逆向工程推测，未文档化）:\n        if policy == \"greedy-then-oldest\":  // 多数文献认为\n            if prev_warp in eligible_warps:\n                issue prev_warp       // 优先：保持 I-cache warm\n            else:\n                issue oldest_ready_warp(eligible_warps)\n        elif policy == \"loose round-robin\":\n            next_warp = round_robin_next(scheduler.warp_pool)\n            while not next_warp.is_ready():\n                next_warp = round_robin_next(scheduler.warp_pool)\n            issue next_warp\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **零成本 warp 切换**: SM 有独立 per-warp register file 和 program counter，无需 context switch。每个 warp 独占 64-256 寄存器（取决于 setmaxnreg 和 occupancy）。\n- **Occupancy 与延迟隐藏的关系**: 更高 occupancy → scheduler 有更多 warp 可选 → 更有效隐藏 memory latency。但 register per warp 减少可能降低 ILP（trade-off）。\n- **调度粒度**: 每 warp scheduler 每 2 周期发射 1 条 warp 指令（Ampere）。峰值: 4 × 0.5 × 1.7GHz ≈ 3.4 warp instructions/clock/SM。\n- **Stream priority 盲区**: 笔记指出 warp scheduler 可能不感知 CUDA stream priority，两个应用的 warps 在 SM 内被同等对待。\n\n**指令 Pipeline 时序图（Warp 交错隐藏延迟）**:\n\n```\n时钟周期:    T0  T1  T2  T3  T4  T5  T6  T7  T8  T9  T10 T11\nWarp 0:     [LD][LD][--][--][--][--][MM][MM][--][--][--][--]\nWarp 1:     [--][--][LD][LD][--][--][--][--][MM][MM][--][--]\nWarp 2:     [MM][MM][--][--][LD][LD][--][--][--][--][MM][MM]\nWarp 3:     [--][--][MM][MM][--][--][LD][LD][--][--][--][--]\nScheduler:   W0  W0  W1  W1  W2  W2  W0  W0  W1  W1  W2  W2\n             ^--- warp 间交错执行，隐藏 global memory latency ---^\nLD = global memory load (长延迟, ~200-800 cycles)\nMM = Tensor Core MMA (计算密集)\n-- = stall 等待数据就绪（被其他 warp 执行覆盖）\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- 当 Warp 0 在 T2-T5 等待 global memory load 返回时，scheduler 切换到 Warp 1 和 Warp 2，Warp 0 的 latency 被完全隐藏。\n- 这要求 SM 上至少有 4 个 active warp（occupancy ≥ 4 warps/SM），否则部分 stall 周期无法被填充。\n- Ampere SM Warp Scheduler 资源参数: 4 warp schedulers / SM，每 scheduler 管理 subset of warps。\n\n---\n\n### 方法2：Software Pipelining —— Producer-Consumer 流水线\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Software Pipelining for GPU Attention Kernels.md` (score: 3306.4), `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Software Pipeline (T.Pipelined).md` (score: 359.6), `paper_secs/secs_effAttn/Hardware-Efficient_Attention...md` (score: 266.9)\n\n**方法细节**:\n\nSoftware Pipelining 将内存加载 (HBM→SRAM) 与 Tensor Core 计算 (MMA) 组织为流水线阶段，使第 i+1 个 tile 的内存加载与第 i 个 tile 的计算在时间上重叠：\n\n```\n// === Ampere (A100) Pipeline: cp.async + double buffering ===\n// num_stages=2, 使用 2 组 shared memory buffer (ping-pong)\n\n// Prologue: 预取前 2 个 stage\ncp.async(A_tile[0], sA[0])       // async load tile 0 → SMEM buffer 0\ncp.async(B_tile[0], sB[0])\ncp.async.commit_group()\ncp.async(A_tile[1], sA[1])       // async load tile 1 → SMEM buffer 1\ncp.async(B_tile[1], sB[1])\ncp.async.commit_group()\n\n// Main Loop: steady state 重叠执行\nfor k in [2, K//block_K):\n    cp.async.wait_group<0>()      // 等待 stage (k-2) 的 copy 完成\n    __syncthreads()               // 确保所有线程看到完整 tile\n    mma(sA[(k-2)%2], sB[(k-2)%2], C_acc)  // compute stage (k-2)\n    cp.async(A_tile[k], sA[k%2])  // async load stage k（与 mma 重叠）\n    cp.async(B_tile[k], sB[k%2])\n    cp.async.commit_group()\n\n// Epilogue: 排空流水线\ncp.async.wait_group<0>(); __syncthreads()\nmma(sA[(K-2)%2], sB[(K-2)%2], C_acc)\ncp.async.wait_group<0>(); __syncthreads()\nmma(sA[(K-1)%2], sB[(K-1)%2], C_acc)\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **双缓冲**: 2 组 SMEM buffer 交替使用——一组被 cp.async 填充时另一组被 mma 消费，实现 compute 与 data movement 的完全重叠。\n- **阶段数选择**: num_stages 越大，延迟隐藏越深，但 SMEM 占用翻倍（每增加 1 stage 需额外 tile_size 的 SMEM）。H100 上 256KB SMEM/SM 可支持 num_stages=2-3（取决于 tile size）。\n- **cp.async 特性**: 16 字节粒度，绕过 L1 cache（L1 BYPASS），硬件自动完成而线程继续执行。\n- **与 RoMeo 论文对比**: RoMeo 采用 separate-kernels + software pipelining 策略。不同精度组合（INT4-INT4、INT4-INT8 等）使用独立 kernel 以最大化 per-kernel 的 register/occupancy 调优灵活性。\n\n---\n\n### 方法3：Hopper TMA + Warp Specialization 流水线\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Tensor Memory Accelerator (TMA).md` (score: 5104.2), `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Warp Specialization (Warp 专业化).md` (score: 4004.5), `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Named Barriers (Hopper).md` (score: 895.4)\n\n**方法细节**:\n\nHopper 架构将 software pipelining 升级为硬件辅助的 warp-specialized pipeline。关键组件：TMA（硬件异步拷贝引擎）+ wgmma.mma_async（异步 Tensor Core 指令）+ Named Barriers（硬件同步原语）+ Warp Specialization（角色分工）。\n\n```\n// === Hopper (H100) Pipeline: TMA + Warp Specialization + mbarrier ===\n// SM 配置: 256 threads = 8 warps, 自动 warp specialization:\n//   Producer warps (1-2 warps): TMA load\n//   Consumer warps (6-7 warps, 1 warpgroup): wgmma compute\n\n// Producer Threads (by threadIdx.x, 仅 thread 0 操作 TMA):\nfor k in range(K // block_K):\n    cp.async.bulk.tensor.2d.shared::cluster.global.mbarrier(\n        sA[k % PIPE],            // dst: SMEM pipeline slot\n        &desc_A,                 // TMA descriptor (2D tensor map)\n        [by*block_M, k*block_K], // src coordinates in HBM\n        mbar_prod                // completion barrier\n    )\n    cp.async.bulk.tensor.2d.shared::cluster.global.mbarrier(\n        sB[k % PIPE], &desc_B,\n        [k*block_K, bx*block_N], mbar_prod\n    )\n    mbarrier.arrive(mbar_prod)   // 标记数据就绪\n\n// Consumer Warpgroup (128 threads):\nfor k in range(K // block_K):\n    mbarrier.try_wait(mbar_prod)  // 等待 producer 完成（硬件阻塞）\n    wgmma.fence()                 // 保证 SMEM 可见性\n    wgmma.commit_group()\n    wgmma.mma_async(sA[k%PIPE], sB[k%PIPE], C_acc)\n    wgmma.wait_group<0>()\n    // Producer 已在后台加载下一 tile（完全重叠）\n```\n\n**指令 Pipeline 时序图（Hopper WGMMA + TMA 异步流水线）**:\n\n```\n时间 →\n\nProducer Warp (TMA):\n  T0-T3:  [TMA_load tile_0 → sA[0]]──┐\n  T4-T7:  [TMA_load tile_1 → sA[1]]  │ (overlapped)\n  T8-T11: [TMA_load tile_2 → sA[0]]  │\n                                      │\nConsumer Warpgroup (WGMMA):           │\n  T0-T2:  [mbarrier.wait prod[0]] ◄──┘\n  T3-T6:  [wgmma.mma_async(tile_0, C_acc)]──┐ Tensor Cores 后台执行\n  T7-T9:  [mbarrier.wait prod[1]] ◄──────────┘\n  T10-T13:[wgmma.mma_async(tile_1, C_acc)]\n  T14:    ...\n\nTMA (硬件):                   Tensor Cores (硬件):\n  ████████████████████          ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░\n  tile_0 copy ──────────►       tile_0 compute\n  tile_1 copy ──────────►       tile_1 compute\n  tile_2 copy ──────────►       tile_2 compute\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **TMA 硬件独立执行**: TMA 从发出请求到数据到达 SMEM 全由硬件管理，不占用 CUDA Core。Producer warp 只需 1 个线程发出 TMA 指令，其余 31 线程可释放寄存器用于其他用途。\n- **无寄存器中转**: 数据直接在 HBM ↔ SMEM 之间移动，不经寄存器文件（vs A100 的 cp.async 需 register staging）。这一特性在 attention kernel 中尤为关键——减少 register pressure 允许更大的 tile size。\n- **mbarrier 硬件加速**: TMA completion 自动 arrive(mbar_prod)，consumer 的 wait 是单周期硬件操作。Pipeline 深度 PIPE=2-3，每组 barrier 复用。\n- **Multicast 能力**: TMA 可单次操作将相同 tile 广播到 cluster 内多个 SM 的 shared memory，用于 flash attention 中 Q 被多个 KV tile 消费的场景。\n- **带宽效率**: Hopper TMA 在仅 2KB 消息大小时就能达到 74% 峰值 NVLink 带宽（vs Copy Engine 需 256MB），这对 attention decode kernel 的小 tile 场景至关重要。\n\n---\n\n### 方法4：ILP 指令级并行 —— Tensor MMA + Vector ALU 交错调度\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Tensor-Vector Parallelism Scheduling (ILP_TLP for Softmax).md` (score: 2455.4), `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/CUDA Cores vs Tensor Cores (Compute Unit Heterogeneity on GPU).md` (score: 333.4)\n\n**方法细节**:\n\nFlashAttention-T 提出 Tensor-Vector Parallelism：在 fused attention kernel 中将 softmax 拆分为 tensorized 部分（repurposed MMA on Tensor Core）和 vectorized 部分（CUDA Core），通过 ILP interleaving 使两部分在同一 warp 内并行。\n\n**Ampere ILP Scheduling 伪代码**:\n\n```\n// FlashAttention-T: Ampere ILP interleaving\n// 在单个 warp 内，通过 PTX inline assembly 手工编排指令交错\n\nvoid softmax_ilp_warp(reg QK[BLOCK_M], reg PV[BLOCK_M], reg O[BLOCK_M]):\n    // Split: horizontal split（同 tile 内按行分割，ratio ≈ 1:1）\n    // tensorized 部分：scaling, FMA, rowsum (repurposed MMA)\n    // vectorized 部分：max (REDUX), exp (MUFU.EX2)\n\n    // --- ILP interleaved instruction sequence ---\n    // iteration i, per warp:\n\n    // Step 1: QK^T MMA (Tensor Core)\n    mma.sync(Q_frag, K_frag, S_frag)     // S = QK^T\n\n    // Step 2: ILP-interleaved softmax\n    //   tensor MMA:  scaling + FMA + rowsum\n    //   vector ALU:   max (REDUX) + exp (MUFU.EX2)\n    //   交错编排，使 vector 指令在 tensor MMA 的 issue bubble 中执行\n\n    // Pseudo instruction sequence (手写 PTX):\n    mma.sync.aligned.m16n8k16.row.col.f32.f16.f16.f32  // tensor: scaling\n    redux.op.max.f32  R_max, S_row                       // vector: max (并行)\n    mma.sync.aligned.m16n8k16.row.col.f32.f16.f16.f32  // tensor: FMA\n    fma.rn.f32         S_sub, -R_max, 1.0               // vector: subtract max\n    mma.sync.aligned.m16n8k16.row.col.f32.f16.f16.f32  // tensor: rowsum\n    ex2.approx.f32     P_row, S_sub                      // vector: exp (并行)\n\n    // 效果: t'_softmax < t_vec (baseline 全 vector softmax 时间)\n    //       t'_vec = t'_softmax - (t_vec - t'_softmax)\n\n    // Step 3: PV MMA (Tensor Core)\n    mma.sync(P_frag, V_frag, O_frag)     // O += PV\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **ILP interleaving 原理**: GPU dual-issue 能力允许同时发射一条 Tensor Core 指令和一条 CUDA Core 指令（或相邻周期交错发射）。Tensor MMA 指令有 issue bubble——Tensor Core 后台执行时 CUDA Core 空闲，vector 指令填充这些 bubble。\n- **Split 策略**: Horizontal split（同 tile 按行分割 tensorized/vectorized，ratio≈1:1）平衡两种计算资源；Vertical split（跨 tile 分割，ratio 固定 1:1）受 warp register capacity 限制（最多 2 tiles）。\n- **Hopper TLP 对比**: Hopper 上使用 Thread-Level Parallelism 替代 ILP——将 repurposed WGMMA row-sum 加入下一 iteration 的 QK^T+PV WGMMA batch，与另一 warpgroup 的 vector S/O rescaling 并行。Vector interval ratio 降至 2.7%（远优于 ILP），因 WGMMA 支持更灵活的 dynamic tensor-vector overlap。\n- **CUDA Core vs Tensor Core 吞吐差距**: H100 上 CUDA Core FP32 ≈ 60 TFLOPS，Tensor Core INT8 ≈ 990 TFLOPS（16.5× 差距）。这是 dequantization 成为瓶颈的根本原因——LiquidGEMM 的 LiquidQuant 将 dequant 指令降至 0.875 条/element（vs QServe 的 ≥10 条/element）。\n\n---\n\n### 方法5：Implicit Fine-Grained Pipeline (ImFP) —— 跨 Warp Group 指令混合\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Implicit Fine-Grained Pipeline (ImFP).md` (score: 1737.9), `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/CUDA Cores vs Tensor Cores (Compute Unit Heterogeneity on GPU).md` (score: 333.4)\n\n**方法细节**:\n\nLiquidGEMM 提出 ImFP（Implicit Fine-Grained Pipeline），将 traditional explicit coarse pipeline (ExCP) 的 Load→Dequant→MMA 三阶段流水线改为 single-producer multiple-consumer 模型：\n\n```\n// ImFP 执行流程（每 thread block = 3 WGs: 1 Load + 2 Compute）\n// Load WG (4 warps, 仅操作 TMA):\nfor each K_tile iteration:\n    TMA: GMEM → SMEM[pong]           // async weight load (Dual-MMA packed)\n    cp.async.bulk.wait_group\n    for each MMA fragment in tile:\n        smem_task_queue.push({frag_addr, frag_meta})  // metadata only\n    swap(ping, pong)\n\n// Compute WG_0 & WG_1 (各 4 warps, CUDA + Tensor Cores):\nwhile true:\n    task = smem_task_queue.try_pop()  // atomic 竞争, 无 barrier\n    if !task: break\n    LDS.128: RF = SMEM[task.addr]     // 32 UINT4, single instruction\n    unpack_4bit(RF)                   // CUDA Core\n    dequant_LQQ(RF)                   // IMAD + XOR, CUDA Core (2 条指令)\n    WGMMA(C_frag, A_frag, RF)         // INT8 MMA, Tensor Core 异步\n    // WG_0 和 WG_1 处理不同 tasks\n    // → WG_0 做 dequant 时 WG_1 做 MMA → 跨 WG 重叠\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **消除 SMEM↔RF round-trip**: ExCP 需要 Load→Dequant（SMEM→RF→SMEM）→MMA（SMEM→RF），ImFP 中 Compute WG 直接从 SMEM 读取并一站式完成 dequant+MMA，消除中间 SMEM 写回。\n- **跨 WG 异构重叠**: WG_0 在 CUDA Core 上做 dequant 时，WG_1 在 Tensor Core 上做 MMA。这种重叠是天然的——不需要软件 barrier，由硬件 atomic 竞争自动调度。\n- **Dual-MMA packed layout**: 两个连续 MMA 操作的元素打包存储，LDS.128 单条指令加载 32 个 UINT4 元素，充分利用 shared memory 带宽。\n- **dequant 指令最小化**: LiquidQuant (LQQ) 仅需 IMAD + XOR 两条 32-bit 硬件指令处理四个元素，α=0.875 指令/element，远低于 QServe 的 α≥10。确保 CUDA Core 不成为 pipeline 瓶颈。\n\n---\n\n### 方法6：Multi-stage Register Pipeline（多级寄存器流水线）\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Multi-stage Register Pipeline (for SpMV on Tensor Cores).md` (score: 3576.4)\n\n**方法细节**:\n\nDrawloom 为解决 SpMV 中 memory-compute 串行化导致的 warp stall，将四大操作步骤重构为 5 阶段流水线：\n\n```\n// Pipeline 参数\ndelaySMEM = 1  // double buffering: 2 组 SMEM buffer 交替\ndelayREG = 2   // 3 组 REG set 轮流使用\n\n// 5 阶段流水线\n// Stage 1: FillSMEM — async-copy 填充 SMEM buffer\n// Stage 2: FillREG — SMEM→REG + LDG 加载 vector X\n// Stage 3: Comp — TC MMA 计算（使用前一阶段的 REG 数据）\n// Stage 4: EmptySMEM — 完成剩余 SMEM→REG 搬移\n// Stage 5: EmptyREG — 完成剩余计算\n\n// 关键控制: pipeline_wait_prior(N) 确保 N 阶段前的数据就绪\n//           pipeline_commit() 提交当前 async-copy 批次\n\n// delaySMEM=1, delayREG=2 时，最多 3 个 REG set 同时 in-flight:\n//   REG set [0]: 正在被 MMA 消费\n//   REG set [1]: 正在被 LDG 填充\n//   REG set [2]: 正在等待 SMEM 数据就绪\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **delaySMEM** 控制 GMEM→SMEM 的 double buffering 阶段数（Ampere 上通过 cp.async 实现）\n- **delayREG** 控制 SMEM→REG + computation 的重叠阶段数。多级 REG pipeline 进一步解耦 SMEM→REG 和计算，消除 data dependency stall\n- **消融实验**: v4（+Multi-stage Pipeline）相比 v3 平均提速 1.46×（mip1 达 5.68×），warp stall 改善 3.02×-3.13×，memory throughput 提升 2.61×-2.75×\n- **适用前提**: 每次 memory access 只触发一个 TC 操作（SpMV 的稀疏特性），因此需要多级 REG pipeline 进一步重叠 short-latency TC computation 与 irregular X vector access\n\n---\n\n## 二、实验环境（主内容）\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_2026/37-RoMeo.../3-Algorithm...md` (score: 975.4), `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Multi-stage Register Pipeline (for SpMV on Tensor Cores).md` (score: 3576.4)\n\n### 硬件平台\n\n| 平台 | GPU 型号 | SM 数量 | SMEM/SM | HBM 带宽 | Tensor Core 代数 | 关键特性 |\n|------|----------|---------|---------|----------|------------------|----------|\n| NVIDIA H100 (Hopper) | H100 SXM | 132 | 256KB | 3.35 TB/s (HBM3) | 4th Gen | TMA + WGMMA + mbarrier + FP8 |\n| NVIDIA A100 (Ampere) | A100 SXM | 108 | 164KB | 2.0 TB/s (HBM2e) | 3rd Gen | cp.async + mma.sp + structured sparsity |\n| NVIDIA RTX 4090 (Ada) | RTX 4090 | 128 | 128KB | 1.0 TB/s (GDDR6X) | 4th Gen | 无 TMA（Ada 不支持 Hopper 特性）|\n| AMD MI300X (CDNA3) | MI300X | 304 CU | 64KB LDS/CU | 5.3 TB/s (HBM3) | Matrix Core | s_waitcnt + buffer_load_dword |\n\n**注解**: 笔记显示 Ampere (A100) pipeline 依赖 cp.async + software barrier，Hopper (H100) pipeline 升级为 TMA 硬件 + mbarrier + warp specialization。AMD CDNA 路径使用 s_waitcnt lgkmcnt + buffer_load_dword lds 指令。NPU 昇腾和 TPU 的实验环境数据笔记未明确覆盖。\n\n### 关键评估指标\n\n- **Warp occupancy**: SM 上同时 resident 的 warp 数。更高 occupancy → 更多 warp 可隐藏延迟，但每 warp 寄存器减少 → ILP 降低\n- **Pipeline stage utilization**: 各流水线阶段的利用率。理想状态 producer load 与 consumer compute 100% 重叠\n- **Vector interval ratio**: Tensor Core idle 时间占比（越小越好）。FlashAttention-T Hopper TLP 降至 2.7%\n- **指令级效率**: dequant 指令数/element（LiquidQuant α=0.875 vs QServe α≥10）\n- **Memory bandwidth 利用率**: TMA 在 2KB 消息达 74% NVLink 峰值带宽\n\n---\n\n## 三、实现（辅助说明）\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Actor-Based Warp Specialization for In-Kernel Scheduling.md` (score: 3179.7), `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Software Pipeline (T.Pipelined).md` (score: 359.6)\n\n### FlashMoE Actor-Based Warp Specialization\n\nFlashMoE 的纯软件 actor 模型（可在 SM70+ GPU 运行，不依赖 Hopper TMA）：\n\n```\n// 三种 Actor 角色（同一 kernel 内，无 barrier 同步）\n// Processor (N-1 blocks): 执行 GEMM + combine + dispatch\n// Subscriber (OS block 内 3 warps): 解码远端 tile packet → task descriptor\n// Scheduler (OS block 内 1 warp): work-conserving 调度\n\n// Actor 交互（event-driven, polling-based）:\nSubscriber: poll NVSHMEM flag → atomic retrieve → decode →\n            write task queue (GMEM) → atomicAdd doorbell (SMEM) →\n            notify Scheduler\n\nScheduler:  sweep all doorbells → WarpInclusiveSum →\n            signal idle Processor (GMEM)\n\nProcessor:  await_scheduler_signal → warp broadcast task →\n            switch(type):\n              GEMM0: fGET fused CUTLASS GEMM+GELU\n              GEMM1: fGET + NVSHMEM put result → combine (Hadamard)\n```\n\n### TileLang T.Pipelined 实现\n\n用户仅需添加 `T.Pipelined(K // block_K, num_stages=N)` annotation，编译器自动：(1) 分析 loop body 中各 buffer 的读/写关系确定 prod/cons 角色；(2) 插入对应架构的异步指令序列（Ampere→cp.async、Hopper→TMA、CDNA→buffer_load_dword）；(3) Live Variable Analysis 确定同步点→插入 barrier；(4) Hopper 架构上自动应用 warp specialization。TileLang 的 FlashAttention 实现（~70 行 Python）达到 FlashAttention-3（手写 CUDA）98% 的性能。\n\n---\n\n## 四、是什么？（辅助说明）\n\n### 核心概念关系\n\n多算子/微算子并发的指令编排与软件流水线设计的本质是**通过指令级和 warp 级的时间重叠，最大化 GPU 异构计算单元的利用率**。四个概念构成层次化调度体系：\n\n1. **ILP (指令级并行)**: 单 warp 内的指令交错——利用 GPU dual-issue 能力，将 Tensor Core MMA 的 issue bubble 填充 CUDA Core vector 指令\n2. **Warp 级调度**: SM 级——Warp Scheduler 通过零成本 warp 切换隐藏 memory latency\n3. **Software Pipelining**: Kernel 级——通过 producer-consumer 流水线将 HBM→SMEM 数据搬运与 Tensor Core 计算重叠\n4. **指令混合**: 计算单元级——将 GEMM/attention MMA 指令与 element-wise ALU 指令混合调度，提升异构计算单元利用率\n\n### 跨平台差异\n\n| 特性 | NVIDIA GPU (SIMT) | AMD GPU (CDNA) | NPU 昇腾 (达芬奇) | TPU (XLA) |\n|------|-------------------|----------------|-------------------|-----------|\n| 指令并行模式 | Dual-issue (ILP) + warp 交错 | Wavefront 交错 | VLIW 超长指令字（笔记未详述） | VLIW / XLA 编译调度（笔记未详述） |\n| 异步拷贝 | Ampere: cp.async (PTX LDGSTS)、Hopper: TMA | s_waitcnt lgkmcnt + buffer_load_dword | Cube Unit / Vector Unit（笔记未详述） | MXU systolic array（笔记未详述） |\n| 同步原语 | Ampere: __pipeline_wait_prior、Hopper: mbarrier | s_waitcnt | 笔记未明确说明 | 笔记未明确说明 |\n| 寄存器压力管理 | setmaxnreg + occupancy trade-off | VGPR pressure | 笔记未明确说明 | 笔记未明确说明 |\n| 流水线深度 | 2-5 stages（取决于 SMEM/REG 资源） | 笔记未明确说明 | 笔记未明确说明 | 笔记未明确说明 |\n\n**笔记明确覆盖**: NVIDIA GPU (Ampere/Hopper/Ada) 和 AMD CDNA 的 pipeline 差异（TileLang T.Pipelined 伪代码）。NPU 昇腾达芬奇 VLIW 指令编排和 TPU XLA VLIW 指令编排的细节，当前 vault 笔记未明确覆盖。\n\n---\n\n## 五、方法对比表\n\n| 方法 | 核心机制 | 实现框架 | 硬件平台 | 关键指标 | 笔记证据 |\n|------|----------|----------|----------|----------|----------|\n| Warp Scheduler 延迟隐藏 | 零成本 warp 切换，greedy-then-oldest 策略 | GPU 硬件固件（闭源） | NVIDIA Ampere/Hopper/Ada | 4 warp schedulers/SM，每 2 周期/warp 指令 | knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Warp Scheduler (NVIDIA GPU).md (3339.9) |\n| Software Pipelining (cp.async) | double buffering + async copy→SMEM + mma overlap | CUDA cp.async / CUTLASS / Triton num_stages | NVIDIA Ampere (A100) | num_stages=2-4，SMEM 占用 = stages×tile_size | knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Software Pipelining for GPU Attention Kernels.md (3306.4) |\n| Hopper TMA + Warp Specialization | TMA 硬件异步拷贝 + wgmma.mma_async + mbarrier + warp 角色分工 | CUTLASS 3.x + CuTe / TileLang T.Pipelined | NVIDIA Hopper (H100) | TMA 2KB 达 74% NVLink 峰值，PIPE=2-3 | knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Tensor Memory Accelerator (TMA).md (5104.2) |\n| ILP Tensor-Vector Parallelism | 同 warp 内交错 tensor MMA 和 vector ALU 指令 | 手写 CUDA PTX inline assembly | Ampere (ILP) / Hopper (TLP) | Hopper TLP vector interval ratio 2.7% | knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Tensor-Vector Parallelism Scheduling (ILP_TLP for Softmax).md (2455.4) |\n| ImFP (Implicit Fine-Grained Pipeline) | Single-producer multiple-consumer，跨 WG dequant+MMA 自然重叠 | CUTLASS/CuTe warp-specialized kernel | Hopper (H100/H800) | α=0.875 指令/element，消除 SMEM↔RF round-trip | knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Implicit Fine-Grained Pipeline (ImFP).md (1737.9) |\n| Multi-stage Register Pipeline | 5 阶段流水线：FillSMEM→FillREG→Comp→EmptySMEM→EmptyREG | Drawloom CUDA：cp.async + LDG + TC MMA | Ampere (A100) | warp stall 改善 3.02×-3.13×，memory throughput +2.61×-2.75× | knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Multi-stage Register Pipeline (for SpMV on Tensor Cores).md (3576.4) |\n| Actor-Based Warp Specialization | 纯软件 event-driven actor 模型：Processor/Subscriber/Scheduler | FlashMoE CUDA（NVSHMEM + atomic + doorbell） | SM70+ GPU（无 TMA 要求） | N-1 blocks Processor + 1 block admin | knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Actor-Based Warp Specialization for In-Kernel Scheduling.md (3179.7) |\n| RoMeo Separate-Kernels + Async | 不同精度独立 kernel + CUDA Stream 异步并发 | CUTLASS + CUDA Graph + Triton | NVIDIA RTX 4090 (Ada) | up to 4.68× vs BF16 GEMM，up to 2.10× end-to-end | paper_secs/secs_2026/37-RoMeo.../3-Algorithm...md (975.4) |\n| TileLang T.Pipelined | 编译器自动分析 buffer 依赖→生成架构特定 pipeline | TileLang JIT Compiler | Ampere/Hopper/AMD CDNA | 自动 warp specialization，70 行 Python = 98% FA-3 性能 | knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Software Pipeline (T.Pipelined).md (359.6) |\n\n---\n\n## 不确定性\n\n1. **NPU 昇腾达芬奇 VLIW 指令编排**: 当前 vault 笔记未明确覆盖华为昇腾 910B/310P 的 VLIW 指令 bundle 编排细节、Cube Unit 指令与 Vector Unit 指令的并行发射策略、TBE/TIK 编程框架中的 software pipelining 实现方式。此部分在 S5（平台差异）中缺失证据。\n\n2. **TPU XLA VLIW 指令编排**: 当前 vault 笔记未明确覆盖 Google TPU v5e/v5p 的 VLIW 指令编排、XLA compiler 的指令调度策略、MXU systolic array 的 pipeline depth 和 instruction issue 模式。此部分在 S5（平台差异）中缺失证据。\n\n3. **Groq LPU 指令调度**: 当前 vault 笔记未覆盖 Groq Tensor Streaming Processor 的 deterministic instruction scheduling 实现细节。\n\n4. **Dual-issue 精确语义**: NVIDIA GPU 的 dual-issue 能力（如一条 FP32 + 一条 INT32 指令同时发射）和 Tensor Core MMA + CUDA Core 指令的并行发射约束，NVIDIA 未正式文档化。笔记中的 ILP interleaving 描述基于逆向工程和论文实证。\n\n5. **Warp Scheduler 调度策略**: NVIDIA 未公开文档化 warp scheduler 的精确调度算法。笔记中 \"greedy-then-oldest\" 和 \"loose round-robin\" 策略基于 Olmedo et al. (2020) 的微 benchmark 逆向推断，可能在不同 GPU 代数间存在差异。\n\n[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] Q4.2\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":4,"oldLines":210,"newStart":4,"newLines":85,"lines":[" "," | 路径 | 分数 | 关键信息 |"," |------|------|----------|","-| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Tensor-Vector Parallelism Scheduling (ILP_TLP for Softmax).md | 5050 | FlashAttention-T 的 ILP/TLP 调度：Ampere ILP interleaving、Hopper TLP overlap |","-| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/SM Occupancy.md | 4398 | SM Occupancy 定义与延迟隐藏机理 |","-| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Asynchronous Memory Copy (async-copy).md | 3872 | Ampere cp.async 硬件机制与 pipeline 流程 |","-| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Warp _ Warp Scheduler.md | 3846 | Warp Scheduler 硬件单元结构与调度策略 |","-| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/ILP_TLP_Arithmetic Intensity Trade-off in DNN Kernels.md | 3460 | ILP/TLP/Arithmetic Intensity 三维 trade-off 形式化分析 |","-| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Software Pipelining for GPU Attention Kernels.md | 3306 | GPU attention kernel 软件流水线：producer-consumer + ping-pong buffer |","-| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Warp-Group Specialization (Hopper GPU).md | 2796 | Hopper Warp-Group Specialization：mbarrier 同步、producer/consumer 分工 |","-| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Warp Scheduler (NVIDIA GPU).md | 2701 | Warp Scheduler issue 决策逻辑（推测模型）与调度策略 |","-| paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/FlashAttention-3/3-FlashAttention-3-Algorithm.md | 1588 | FA-3 warp-specialization + pingpong scheduling + GEMM-softmax overlap |","-| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Tensor Memory Accelerator (TMA).md | 1575 | Hopper TMA 硬件架构、运转流程、与 cp.async 对比 |","-| paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/FlashAttention-T/1-Introduction.md | 1610 | FlashAttention-T ILP horizontal/vertical split + Hopper TLP scheduling |","-| paper_secs/secs_moe/Samoyeds/span-idpage-4-2span4.1-Dual-sided-Sparse-Data-Format-and-Kernel-Scheme.md | 936 | MMA.sp 指令与 element-wise ALU 混合 |","-| paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/Task-Based Tensor Computations on Modern GPUs | 823 | Cypress task-based model：warp-specialized kernel + producer-consumer pipeline |","-| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Hexagon NPU HVX+HMX Architecture.md | text | Qualcomm Hexagon NPU VLIW 架构：Scalar Cores + HVX + HMX |","-| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/RPU ISA _ CISC-style ISA for AI Accelerators.md | text | RPU CISC-style ISA：与 GPU SIMT / NPU VLIW 的对比 |","-| paper_secs/secs_2026/87-Automated End-to-End Model Serving | 516 | GPU warp scheduler ILP 与 TLP 的指令级分析 |","+| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Tensor Memory Accelerator (TMA).md | 5104.2 | TMA 硬件单元：单线程发起、无寄存器中转、异步 bulk transfer、mbarrier 同步 |","+| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Warp Specialization (Warp 专业化).md | 4004.5 | Warp Specialization 在 Hopper SM 内的 producer-consumer 执行流程 |","+| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Warp Scheduler (NVIDIA GPU).md | 3339.9 | Warp Scheduler 决策逻辑：greedy-then-oldest 策略、零成本 warp 切换 |","+| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Software Pipelining for GPU Attention Kernels.md | 3306.4 | GPU attention kernel 软件流水线：producer/consumer warp + ping-pong buffer |","+| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Actor-Based Warp Specialization for In-Kernel Scheduling.md | 3179.7 | FlashMoE 纯软件 actor 模型：Processor/Subscriber/Scheduler 三角色 |","+| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Multi-stage Register Pipeline (for SpMV on Tensor Cores).md | 3576.4 | 5 阶段 register pipeline：FillSMEM→FillREG→Comp→EmptySMEM→EmptyREG |","+| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Asynchronous Memory Copy (async-copy).md | 2924.1 | Ampere async-copy 机制：cp.async PTX → LDGSTS 硬件实现 |","+| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Wavefront Specialization（波前专业化）.md | 2782.4 | Wavefront 特化 + Operand Queue：producer push tiles → consumer peek/compute |","+| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Tensor-Vector Parallelism Scheduling (ILP_TLP for Softmax).md | 2455.4 | FlashAttention-T ILP/TLP：tensor MMA 与 vector ALU 指令交错调度 |","+| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Implicit Fine-Grained Pipeline (ImFP).md | 1737.9 | LiquidGEMM ImFP：single-producer multiple-consumer、跨 WG dequant+MMA 重叠 |","+| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Software Pipeline (T.Pipelined).md | 359.6 | TileLang T.Pipelined：Ampere/Hopper/AMD CDNA 三架构 pipeline 伪代码 |","+| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Named Barriers (Hopper).md | 895.4 | Hopper Named Barriers：TMA 硬件写入、单周期原子操作 |","+| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/CUDA Cores vs Tensor Cores.md | 333.4 | GPU 异构计算单元：CUDA Core vs Tensor Core 吞吐差距 16.5× |","+| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Fine-grained Pipelined Dataflow.md | 283.4 | HLX 4 级细粒度流水线：DPE#0→RVPE→DPE#1→UpE |","+| paper_secs/secs_2026/37-RoMeo.../3-Algorithm...md | 975.4 | RoMeo software pipeline + separate-kernels 实现 cross-precision GEMM |","+| paper_secs/secs_effAttn/Hardware-Efficient_Attention...md | 266.9 | GLA kernel：asynchronous software pipelining + warp specialization |","+| experiment_notes/.../MetaAttention...md | 433.9 | MetaAttention scheduling：two-layer policy (tile config + tile resource) |"," "," ---"," ","-## 1. 方法细节：指令编排与软件流水线的硬件体系结构设计","+## 检索上下文映射"," ","-### 1.1 指令级并行（ILP）—— 单 Warp 内多指令编排","+### S1: ILP — 单 warp/wavefront 内编排多条独立指令","+- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Tensor-Vector Parallelism Scheduling (ILP_TLP for Softmax).md` (score: 2455.4): FlashAttention-T Ampere ILP Scheduling —— warp 内均匀交叉 repurposed tensor MMA 和 vector 指令","+- `paper_secs/secs_2026/37-RoMeo.../3-Algorithm...md` (score: 975.4): 通过控制 shared memory 消耗→释放寄存器用于 instruction-level parallelism","+- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Multi-stage Register Pipeline (for SpMV on Tensor Cores).md` (score: 3576.4): delaySMEM/delayREG 控制多级寄存器流水线重叠"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Tensor-Vector Parallelism Scheduling (ILP_TLP for Softmax).md` (score: 5050), `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/ILP_TLP_Arithmetic Intensity Trade-off in DNN Kernels.md` (score: 3460)","+### S2: warp/wavefront 级调度 — stalls 时切换到其他 warp","+- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Warp Scheduler (NVIDIA GPU).md` (score: 3339.9): Warp Scheduler greedy-then-oldest 策略、零成本 warp 切换","+- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Wavefront Specialization（波前专业化）.md` (score: 2782.4): Producer wavefront 异步 ATT load → Consumer wavefronts 计算","+- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Actor-Based Warp Specialization for In-Kernel Scheduling.md` (score: 3179.7): FlashMoE 纯软件 event-driven actor 模型"," ","-#### 1.1.1 Ampere ILP Scheduling（FlashAttention-T）","+### S3: software pipelining — async copy/TMA/memcpy_async","+- `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Tensor Memory Accelerator (TMA).md` (score: 5104.2): TMA 硬件端到端完成、mbarrier 自动同步","+- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Software Pipelining for GPU Attention Kernels.md` (score: 3306.4): Producer warp TMA load || Consumer warp MMA","+- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Software Pipeline (T.Pipelined).md` (score: 359.6): Ampere cp.async / Hopper TMA / AMD CDNA 三架构 pipeline 伪代码","+- `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Asynchronous Memory Copy (async-copy).md` (score: 2924.1): cp.async PTX → LDGSTS 硬件实现","+- `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Named Barriers (Hopper).md` (score: 895.4): Named Barrier 硬件计数 → producer-consumer 零延迟同步","+- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Implicit Fine-Grained Pipeline (ImFP).md` (score: 1737.9): Load WG TMA → Compute WG 竞争 task → 跨 WG dequant+MMA 重叠","+- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Fine-grained Pipelined Dataflow.md` (score: 283.4): HLX 4 级流水线 DPE#0→RVPE→DPE#1→UpE"," ","-FlashAttention-T 在 Ampere GPU 上提出了 **Tensor-Vector Parallelism** 调度范式：将 softmax 计算拆分为 tensorized 部分（repurposed MMA 在 Tensor Core 上执行）和 vectorized 部分（CUDA Core 上执行），并通过 ILP interleaving 使两部分并行。","+### S4: 指令混合 — MMA 与 element-wise ALU 指令混合调度","+- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Tensor-Vector Parallelism Scheduling (ILP_TLP for Softmax).md` (score: 2455.4): ILP interleaving → tensor MMA 的 issue bubble 中执行 vector 指令","+- `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/CUDA Cores vs Tensor Cores (Compute Unit Heterogeneity on GPU).md` (score: 333.4): CUDA Core vs Tensor Core 吞吐差距模型","+- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Implicit Fine-Grained Pipeline (ImFP).md` (score: 1737.9): 跨 Compute WG 的 dequant(CUDA Core) + MMA(Tensor Core) 自然重叠"," ","-**ILP 指令编排伪代码（per warp, Ampere A100）**：","+### S5: 平台差异 — GPU SIMT / NPU VLIW / TPU XLA","+- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Software Pipeline (T.Pipelined).md` (score: 359.6): Ampere cp.async vs Hopper TMA vs AMD CDNA s_waitcnt","+- 笔记未明确覆盖 NPU 昇腾达芬奇 VLIW 指令编排细节和 TPU XLA VLIW 指令编排细节"," ","-```","-// ===== Ampere ILP Scheduling: Horizontal Split =====","-// 输入: S_block[Br, Bc] in registers (QK^T 结果)","-//       Br=32, Bc=64 (tile size 由 warp register capacity 决定)","-// 输出: P_tilde[Br, Bc] (softmax 归一化后的 attention weights)","-","-// Step 1: Horizontal Split — 同一 tile 内按行分割","-//   tensorized rows: [0, Br/2) → Tensor Core (repurposed MMA)","-//   vectorized rows: [Br/2, Br) → CUDA Core","-//   ratio ≈ 1:1, 经 autotuning 搜索确定","-","-// Step 2: ILP Interleaving — 在 warp 内均匀交叉 MMA 和 vector 指令","-for lane_id in 0..31:  // warp 内 32 个 thread","-    // === Tensorized 部分（上半行）===","-    // 使用 repurposed MMA 指令计算 scaling + FMA + rowsum:","-    //   MMA 指令: mma.sync.aligned.m16n8k16.row.col.f32.f16.f16.f32","-    //   将 row-sum 映射为 matrix-vector multiply: rowsum = S @ 1_vector","-    @p0 // predicate: lane 处理 tensorized rows","-    {","-        // Repurposed MMA: S * ones → rowsum (FMA accumulation)","-        // 利用 MMA 的 FMA pipeline 做 reduction","-        rowsum_partial_t = mma(S_tile[tensor_rows], ones_vector)","-    }","-","-    // === Vectorized 部分（下半行）===","-    @p1 // predicate: lane 处理 vectorized rows","-    {","-        // CUDA Core 指令序列:","-        max_local_v = redux_max(S_tile[vector_rows])     // REDUX.MAX","-        S_safe_v = sub(S_tile[vector_rows], max_local_v)  // FADD","-        exp_v = mufu_ex2(S_safe_v)                        // MUFU.EX2","-        rowsum_partial_v = redux_sum(exp_v)               // REDUX.SUM","-    }","-","-    // ILP 关键：@p0 和 @p1 的指令在同一 warp 内交替发射","-    // Tensor Core MMA 发射后不阻塞 CUDA Core 指令","-    // warp scheduler 在 MMA issue bubble 中发射 vector 指令","-```","-","-**注解**：","-- **ILP 原理**：Ampere SM 有 4 个 warp scheduler，每个每 2 周期发射 1 条 warp 指令。Tensor Core MMA 指令从发射到完成有多个周期的延迟（issue bubble），warp scheduler 可在此 bubble 中发射独立的 CUDA Core 指令（如 REDUX、MUFU.EX2），实现指令级并行。","-- **Split 策略**：Horizontal split（同一 tile 内按行分割，ratio≈1:1）vs Vertical split（跨 tile 分割，ratio 固定 1:1，因 warp register capacity 限 2 tiles）。Horizontal split 在 tile 级提供更均匀的 tensor/vector 负载分布。","-- **效果**：t'_softmax < t_vec（baseline 全 vector softmax 时间），vector interval ratio 有效降低。","-- **约束**：ILP 受限于 warp 内 register file 容量（A100 每 thread 最多 255 registers）。更高 ILP 需更多 register → 降低 occupancy（TLP）。","-- **数据依赖**：tensorized rowsum 和 vectorized rowsum 间有隐式同步（均需完成后才能计算 max reduction 和 rescaling），但 split 策略将依赖最小化。","-","-#### 1.1.2 Hopper TLP Scheduling（FlashAttention-T）","-","-Hopper GPU 通过更大 warpgroup（4 warps = 128 threads）和异步 WGMMA 指令实现更灵活的动态 tensor-vector overlap。","-","-```","-// ===== Hopper TLP Scheduling (2 warpgroups, per iteration) =====","-// WG1: Tensor-heavy warpgroup (WGMMA)","-// WG2: Vector-heavy warpgroup (softmax rescale)","-","-// Timeline（per iteration i）:","-// Tensor Unit: |████ WG1: QK^T WGMMA ████|████ WG1: PV WGMMA + rowsum WGMMA ████|","-// Vector Unit: |████ WG2: vec(S/O rescale from iter i-1) ████|████ WG2: next rescale ████|","-//              ← overlap: WG1 tensor 与 WG2 vector 完全并行 →","-","-// WG1 pseudocode (iteration i):","-wg1_mainloop():","-    wait(stage_barrier)                         // 等待 K/V tile 就绪","-    wgmma_commit_group(0)                       // 启动 QK^T WGMMA","-    S_tile = wgmma(Q_tile, K_tile)              // Tensor Core FP16 WGMMA","-    wgmma_wait_group(0)                         // 等待 QK^T 完成","-","-    // rowsum 也 tensorize 为 repurposed WGMMA","-    wgmma_commit_group(1)                       // PV WGMMA + rowsum WGMMA 同 batch","-    O_partial = wgmma(P_tilde, V_tile)           // Tensor Core WGMMA","-    rowsum_t = wgmma(S_tile, ones_vector)        // Repurposed WGMMA","-    wgmma_wait_group(1)","-","-    signal(WG2)                                 // 通知 WG2 做 vector rescale","-","-// WG2 pseudocode (iteration i-1 的结果):","-wg2_mainloop():","-    wait(WG1_signal)                            // WG1 完成 PV + rowsum","-    // CUDA Core vector operations:","-    max_new = redux_max(rowsum_t)               // REDUX","-    O_rescale = O_partial / max_new              // FDIV","-    S_rescale = S_tile / max_new                // FDIV","-    signal(WG1)                                 // 通知 WG1 下一轮","-```","-","-**注解**：","-- **TLP 优势**：WGMMA 允许灵活的 dynamic tensor-vector overlap，不受 static instruction ordering 约束。vector interval ratio 降至 2.7%，远优于 ILP。","-- **WGMMA 异步特性**：`wgmma.commit_group` 发射后不阻塞，`wgmma.wait_group` 显式同步。允许 producer warpgroup 连续发射多个 WGMMA 而不等待。","-- **仅 tensorize leaf stages**：因 nvcc compiler 约束，仅 tensorize P̃ row-summation（leaf-stage nature 最小化跨 stage register dependency，避免 WGMMA serialization）。","-"," ---"," ","-### 1.2 Warp/Wavefront 级调度 —— 延迟隐藏与并发粒度","+## 一、方法细节：指令编排与软件流水线（主内容）"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Warp _ Warp Scheduler.md` (score: 3846), `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Warp Scheduler (NVIDIA GPU).md` (score: 2701), `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/SM Occupancy.md` (score: 4398)","+### 方法1：Warp Scheduler 驱动的延迟隐藏 (Latency Hiding via Warp Scheduling)"," ","-#### 1.2.1 GPU Warp Scheduler 硬件结构","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Warp Scheduler (NVIDIA GPU).md` (score: 3339.9)"," ","-NVIDIA GPU Warp Scheduler 是每个 SM 内部的核心调度硬件。","+**方法细节**:"," ","-**Warp Scheduler 硬件架构数据流图**：","+NVIDIA GPU 的 Warp Scheduler 通过零成本 warp 切换实现延迟隐藏。每个 SM 内 4 个 warp scheduler units 独立管理 warp pool 中的 ready warps，当某 warp 因 global memory load 或 execution dependency 产生 stall 时，scheduler 立即切换到另一 ready warp 发射指令。"," ","-```mermaid","-flowchart TD","-    subgraph SM[\"Streaming Multiprocessor (SM)\"]","-        IB[\"Instruction Buffer (per-warp I-Cache)\"]","-        WS1[\"Warp Scheduler 1\"]","-        WS2[\"Warp Scheduler 2\"]","-        WS3[\"Warp Scheduler 3\"]","-        WS4[\"Warp Scheduler 4\"]","-        DU1[\"Dispatch Unit 1 (2 instr/cycle)\"]","-        DU2[\"Dispatch Unit 2\"]","-        DU3[\"Dispatch Unit 3\"]","-        DU4[\"Dispatch Unit 4\"]","-","-        subgraph EX[\"Execution Units\"]","-            CUDA_C[\"CUDA Cores (FP32/INT32 ALU)\"]","-            TC[\"Tensor Cores (MMA Units)\"]","-            LSU[\"Load/Store Units\"]","-            SFU[\"Special Function Units (MUFU.EX2)\"]","-        end","-","-        RF[\"Register File (per-warp, 32×255×4B)\"]","-        SMEM[\"Shared Memory (up to 228KB H100)\"]","-    end","-","-    HBM[\"HBM/GDDR (Global Memory)\"] -->|\"~400-800 cycles latency\"| LSU","-    WS1 --> DU1","-    WS2 --> DU2","-    WS3 --> DU3","-    WS4 --> DU4","-    DU1 --> CUDA_C","-    DU1 --> TC","-    DU2 --> CUDA_C","-    DU2 --> LSU","-    DU3 --> SFU","-    DU3 --> CUDA_C","-    DU4 --> LSU","-    DU4 --> TC","-    RF --> WS1","-    RF --> WS2","-    RF --> WS3","-    RF --> WS4"," ```","-","-**注解**：","-- **Warp Scheduler 数量**：Ampere (A100) 每 SM 4 个 Warp Scheduler，每个 scheduler 每 2 周期发射 1 条 warp 指令。峰值发射率: 4 × 0.5 × 1.41GHz ≈ 2.82 warp instr/clock/SM。","-- **零成本切换**：Warp 间切换零成本，因为 SM 有独立 per-warp register file（每个 warp 独占 32×N registers）和 per-warp program counter，无需 context switch。","-- **Dispatch Unit**：每个 Warp Scheduler 配备 1 个 Dispatch Unit，可同时发射 2 条独立指令（dual-issue），条件是两条指令无数据依赖、使用不同的执行单元。","-","-#### 1.2.2 Warp Scheduler 调度策略（推测模型）","-","-```","-// ===== Per-SM, Per-Cycle Warp Scheduling (推测模型) =====","+// Per-SM, per-cycle warp scheduling（推测模型）"," function warp_scheduler_cycle(sm):","     for each of 4 warp_scheduler_units in sm:","         eligible_warps = []","         for warp in scheduler.warp_pool:","-            if warp.is_ready():  // 检查三个条件:","-                // (1) 无 data hazard (operand 在 register file 中就绪)","-                // (2) 无 memory stall (无 pending global memory load)","-                // (3) 无 structural hazard (所需执行单元空闲)","+            if warp.is_ready():  // 无 data hazard, 无 memory stall","                 eligible_warps.append(warp)"," ","         if eligible_warps is empty:","-            issue NOP  // idle cycle — SM 计算单元闲置","+            issue NOP  // idle cycle","+            continue"," ","-        // 调度策略（逆向工程推测，NVIDIA 未文档化）:","-        if policy == \"greedy-then-oldest\":","-            // 优先: 上一周期发射过的 warp（保持 I-Cache warm）","+        // 调度策略（逆向工程推测，未文档化）:","+        if policy == \"greedy-then-oldest\":  // 多数文献认为","             if prev_warp in eligible_warps:","-                issue prev_warp","-            // 次选: 等待最久的 ready warp（LRU）","+                issue prev_warp       // 优先：保持 I-cache warm","             else:","                 issue oldest_ready_warp(eligible_warps)","         elif policy == \"loose round-robin\":"]},{"oldStart":217,"oldLines":405,"newStart":92,"newLines":387,"lines":["             issue next_warp"," ```"," ","-**注解**：","-- **greedy-then-oldest vs loose round-robin**：Olmedo et al. (2020) 通过微 benchmark 逆向工程推断两种策略共存。Greedy-then-oldest 优先复用上周期 warp（指令 cache 热），次选 LRU；Loose round-robin 按轮转顺序扫描直到找到 ready warp。","-- **Latency Hiding 量化**：Global memory 延迟 ~400-800 cycles (H100 HBM3)。若 SM 上有 64 active warps（A100 max），每个 warp 平均每 64 cycles 才被调度一次——足够隐藏大部分 memory latency。","-- **Fairness 问题**：Warp scheduler 不感知 CUDA stream priority。高优先级 stream 的 warp 和低优先级 stream 的 warp 在 SM 内被同等对待（greedy-then-oldest 策略下）。这导致优先级反转：高优先级 warp 可能被 \"de-prioritized\"。","-- **Occupancy 与 Latency Hiding 关系**：更高 occupancy → 更多 warp 供 scheduler 选择 → 更好的 latency hiding。但 occupancy 受 register 和 shared memory 约束（A100: max 2048 threads/SM = 64 warps/SM; per-thread register 使用增加 → max active warps 减少）。","+**注解**:","+- **零成本 warp 切换**: SM 有独立 per-warp register file 和 program counter，无需 context switch。每个 warp 独占 64-256 寄存器（取决于 setmaxnreg 和 occupancy）。","+- **Occupancy 与延迟隐藏的关系**: 更高 occupancy → scheduler 有更多 warp 可选 → 更有效隐藏 memory latency。但 register per warp 减少可能降低 ILP（trade-off）。","+- **调度粒度**: 每 warp scheduler 每 2 周期发射 1 条 warp 指令（Ampere）。峰值: 4 × 0.5 × 1.7GHz ≈ 3.4 warp instructions/clock/SM。","+- **Stream priority 盲区**: 笔记指出 warp scheduler 可能不感知 CUDA stream priority，两个应用的 warps 在 SM 内被同等对待。"," ","-#### 1.2.3 延迟隐藏的并发粒度模型","+**指令 Pipeline 时序图（Warp 交错隐藏延迟）**:"," ","-**SM Occupancy 与 Warp Stall 的关系**（笔记证据: `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/SM Occupancy.md`）:","-"," ```","-场景：memory-intensive kernel（如 MoE expert FFN 中 token dispatch 后的 GEMM）","-","-GPU Utilization = 100%（GPU 始终有 kernel 在运行）","-SM Occupancy < 10%（实际 active warp 极少）","-","-原因分析：","-  - 每个 kernel 因大量 memory access 无法维持高 warp occupancy","-  - Warp 因等待 global memory（~400-800 cycles）被 stall","-  - Warp scheduler 尝试切换 warp 但 kernel 本身并行度不足","-  - 仅少数 warp 处于 \"eligible for execution\" 状态","-","-后果：","-  - 即使 GPU \"100% busy\"，大部分 SM 计算核心闲置","-  - HuntKTm 利用这一观察，通过 hybrid scheduling 提升 SM occupancy 2.47×-3.76×","+时钟周期:    T0  T1  T2  T3  T4  T5  T6  T7  T8  T9  T10 T11","+Warp 0:     [LD][LD][--][--][--][--][MM][MM][--][--][--][--]","+Warp 1:     [--][--][LD][LD][--][--][--][--][MM][MM][--][--]","+Warp 2:     [MM][MM][--][--][LD][LD][--][--][--][--][MM][MM]","+Warp 3:     [--][--][MM][MM][--][--][LD][LD][--][--][--][--]","+Scheduler:   W0  W0  W1  W1  W2  W2  W0  W0  W1  W1  W2  W2","+             ^--- warp 间交错执行，隐藏 global memory latency ---^","+LD = global memory load (长延迟, ~200-800 cycles)","+MM = Tensor Core MMA (计算密集)","+-- = stall 等待数据就绪（被其他 warp 执行覆盖）"," ```"," ","-**注解**：","-- **并发粒度层次**：Thread-level (TLP) > Warp-level (warp scheduling) > Instruction-level (ILP) > Bit-level (SIMD/SIMT)。Warp 级并发是关键：通过 warp 间切换隐藏单 warp 的 memory latency。","-- **MoE 模型的特殊挑战**：MoE expert FFN 的 token dispatching 导致非连续的 expert weight 访存模式，memory divergence 加剧 warp stall。专家间 load imbalance 使某些 warp 的等待时间更长。","+**注解**:","+- 当 Warp 0 在 T2-T5 等待 global memory load 返回时，scheduler 切换到 Warp 1 和 Warp 2，Warp 0 的 latency 被完全隐藏。","+- 这要求 SM 上至少有 4 个 active warp（occupancy ≥ 4 warps/SM），否则部分 stall 周期无法被填充。","+- Ampere SM Warp Scheduler 资源参数: 4 warp schedulers / SM，每 scheduler 管理 subset of warps。"," "," ---"," ","-### 1.3 软件流水线（Software Pipelining）—— Async Copy / TMA 与 Producer-Consumer 流水线","+### 方法2：Software Pipelining —— Producer-Consumer 流水线"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Software Pipelining for GPU Attention Kernels.md` (score: 3306), `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Asynchronous Memory Copy (async-copy).md` (score: 3872), `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Tensor Memory Accelerator (TMA).md` (score: 1575)","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Software Pipelining for GPU Attention Kernels.md` (score: 3306.4), `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Software Pipeline (T.Pipelined).md` (score: 359.6), `paper_secs/secs_effAttn/Hardware-Efficient_Attention...md` (score: 266.9)"," ","-#### 1.3.1 Ampere: cp.async + Multi-Stage Pipeline","+**方法细节**:"," ","-**Async Copy 硬件机制**（Ampere A100, Compute Capability 8.0）:","+Software Pipelining 将内存加载 (HBM→SRAM) 与 Tensor Core 计算 (MMA) 组织为流水线阶段，使第 i+1 个 tile 的内存加载与第 i 个 tile 的计算在时间上重叠："," "," ```","-// ===== cp.async 硬件运转流程 (Ampere) =====","-// PTX 指令: cp.async.ca.shared.global [dst], [src], 16, 16","-// 硬件实现: LDGSTS (Load Global, Store Shared — 专用硬件路径)","+// === Ampere (A100) Pipeline: cp.async + double buffering ===","+// num_stages=2, 使用 2 组 shared memory buffer (ping-pong)"," ","-// Multi-Stage Pipeline 状态机:","-// 阶段: Fill → Steady → Drain","+// Prologue: 预取前 2 个 stage","+cp.async(A_tile[0], sA[0])       // async load tile 0 → SMEM buffer 0","+cp.async(B_tile[0], sB[0])","+cp.async.commit_group()","+cp.async(A_tile[1], sA[1])       // async load tile 1 → SMEM buffer 1","+cp.async(B_tile[1], sB[1])","+cp.async.commit_group()"," ","-// Stage 1: Fill（填充 pipeline）","-for stage in 0..NUM_STAGES-1:","-    // 发起 N 个异步 copy，填满 pipeline buffer","-    cp.async(smem_buf[stage], gmem_tile[stage])   // 发射后立即返回","-    __pipeline_commit()                            // 提交到 async-copy HW 队列","-// 此时 N 个 stage 的 copy 在后台并行执行","+// Main Loop: steady state 重叠执行","+for k in [2, K//block_K):","+    cp.async.wait_group<0>()      // 等待 stage (k-2) 的 copy 完成","+    __syncthreads()               // 确保所有线程看到完整 tile","+    mma(sA[(k-2)%2], sB[(k-2)%2], C_acc)  // compute stage (k-2)","+    cp.async(A_tile[k], sA[k%2])  // async load stage k（与 mma 重叠）","+    cp.async(B_tile[k], sB[k%2])","+    cp.async.commit_group()"," ","-// Stage 2: Steady State（稳态流水线）","-for tile_idx in NUM_STAGES..total_tiles:","-    __pipeline_wait_prior(NUM_STAGES-1)            // 等待 oldest copy 完成","+// Epilogue: 排空流水线","+cp.async.wait_group<0>(); __syncthreads()","+mma(sA[(K-2)%2], sB[(K-2)%2], C_acc)","+cp.async.wait_group<0>(); __syncthreads()","+mma(sA[(K-1)%2], sB[(K-1)%2], C_acc)","+```"," ","-    // === Compute on oldest completed tile ===","-    ldmatrix(reg_tile, smem_buf[tile_idx % NUM_STAGES])","-    mma_sync(acc, reg_tile_A, reg_tile_B)         // Tensor Core MMA","+**注解**:","+- **双缓冲**: 2 组 SMEM buffer 交替使用——一组被 cp.async 填充时另一组被 mma 消费，实现 compute 与 data movement 的完全重叠。","+- **阶段数选择**: num_stages 越大，延迟隐藏越深，但 SMEM 占用翻倍（每增加 1 stage 需额外 tile_size 的 SMEM）。H100 上 256KB SMEM/SM 可支持 num_stages=2-3（取决于 tile size）。","+- **cp.async 特性**: 16 字节粒度，绕过 L1 cache（L1 BYPASS），硬件自动完成而线程继续执行。","+- **与 RoMeo 论文对比**: RoMeo 采用 separate-kernels + software pipelining 策略。不同精度组合（INT4-INT4、INT4-INT8 等）使用独立 kernel 以最大化 per-kernel 的 register/occupancy 调优灵活性。"," ","-    // === 发射新 copy（下一 tile）===","-    cp.async(smem_buf[tile_idx % NUM_STAGES], gmem_tile[tile_idx])","-    __pipeline_commit()","+---"," ","-// Stage 3: Drain（排空 pipeline）","-for stage in 0..NUM_STAGES-1:","-    __pipeline_wait_prior(0)","-    // Compute on remaining tiles","-    ldmatrix(...)","-    mma_sync(...)","-```","+### 方法3：Hopper TMA + Warp Specialization 流水线"," ","-**注解**：","-- **cp.async 粒度**：支持 4/8/16 字节 copy。16 字节 copy 使用 L1 BYPASS 模式，数据直达 shared memory，不经过 L1 cache——避免污染 L1。","-- **硬件实现**：cp.async 由 SM 内的专用 LDGSTS 硬件路径执行，类似 SM 内的微型 DMA Engine。不占用 CUDA Core 计算资源。","-- **Pipeline Depth**：NUM_STAGES 通常 2-5。更深 pipeline  → 更好的 memory-compute overlap，但更多 shared memory 消耗 → 可能降低 occupancy。","-- **Double Buffering**：最小配置 NUM_STAGES=2（ping-pong），一个 buffer 被 async-copy 填充，另一 buffer 被计算消费。","-- **Memory-Bound Kernel 收益**：在 memory-bound kernel（如 MoE expert weight loading）中，软件流水线将计算隐藏在 memory 加载之后，使 kernel 接近 pure memory bandwidth bound，减少 warp stall。","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Tensor Memory Accelerator (TMA).md` (score: 5104.2), `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Warp Specialization (Warp 专业化).md` (score: 4004.5), `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Named Barriers (Hopper).md` (score: 895.4)"," ","-#### 1.3.2 Hopper: TMA + Warp Specialization","+**方法细节**:"," ","-**TMA 硬件架构与运转流程**（笔记证据: `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Tensor Memory Accelerator (TMA).md`）:","+Hopper 架构将 software pipelining 升级为硬件辅助的 warp-specialized pipeline。关键组件：TMA（硬件异步拷贝引擎）+ wgmma.mma_async（异步 Tensor Core 指令）+ Named Barriers（硬件同步原语）+ Warp Specialization（角色分工）。"," ","-```mermaid","-flowchart TD","-    subgraph SM_Hopper[\"SM (Hopper H100)\"]","-        DMA_WARP[\"DMA Warp (32 threads, only T0 active)\"]","-        TMA_UNIT[\"TMA Hardware Unit (per-SM fixed-function)\"]","-        MBAR[\"mbarrier (shared memory barrier)\"]","-        SMEM[\"Shared Memory (up to 228KB)\"]","-        COMP_WG[\"Compute Warpgroup (4 warps = 128 threads)\"]","-        TC_HOPPER[\"Tensor Core (WGMMA, FP8/FP16)\"]","-    end","+```","+// === Hopper (H100) Pipeline: TMA + Warp Specialization + mbarrier ===","+// SM 配置: 256 threads = 8 warps, 自动 warp specialization:","+//   Producer warps (1-2 warps): TMA load","+//   Consumer warps (6-7 warps, 1 warpgroup): wgmma compute"," ","-    L2[\"L2 Cache (50MB H100)\"] --> TMA_UNIT","-    HBM3[\"HBM3 (80GB, 3.35TB/s)\"] --> L2","+// Producer Threads (by threadIdx.x, 仅 thread 0 操作 TMA):","+for k in range(K // block_K):","+    cp.async.bulk.tensor.2d.shared::cluster.global.mbarrier(","+        sA[k % PIPE],            // dst: SMEM pipeline slot","+        &desc_A,                 // TMA descriptor (2D tensor map)","+        [by*block_M, k*block_K], // src coordinates in HBM","+        mbar_prod                // completion barrier","+    )","+    cp.async.bulk.tensor.2d.shared::cluster.global.mbarrier(","+        sB[k % PIPE], &desc_B,","+        [k*block_K, bx*block_N], mbar_prod","+    )","+    mbarrier.arrive(mbar_prod)   // 标记数据就绪"," ","-    DMA_WARP -->|\"TMA_load(descriptor, barrier)\"| TMA_UNIT","-    TMA_UNIT -->|\"burst copy 64-256KB tiles\"| SMEM","-    TMA_UNIT -->|\"auto-arrive(mbarrier)\"| MBAR","-    MBAR -->|\"wait(mbarrier)\"| COMP_WG","-    COMP_WG --> TC_HOPPER","-    SMEM --> COMP_WG","+// Consumer Warpgroup (128 threads):","+for k in range(K // block_K):","+    mbarrier.try_wait(mbar_prod)  // 等待 producer 完成（硬件阻塞）","+    wgmma.fence()                 // 保证 SMEM 可见性","+    wgmma.commit_group()","+    wgmma.mma_async(sA[k%PIPE], sB[k%PIPE], C_acc)","+    wgmma.wait_group<0>()","+    // Producer 已在后台加载下一 tile（完全重叠）"," ```"," ","-**注解**：","-- **TMA vs cp.async 关键差异**：(1) TMA 仅需 **1 个线程**发出指令（vs cp.async 需全 warp 参与），其余 31 线程可同时计算；(2) **无寄存器中转**：数据直接在 GMEM↔SMEM 移动（cp.async 经过寄存器）；(3) **硬件 barrier 集成**：TMA completion 自动写入 mbarrier，consumer 通过 `wait(mbarrier)` 高效同步，无需 spin-wait；(4) **Multicast**：TMA 可单次操作将同一 tile 广播到多个 SM 的 shared memory（FlashAttention 的关键优化）。","-- **带宽效率**：Hopper TMA 在仅 2KB 消息大小时就能达到 74% 峰值 NVLink 带宽（vs Copy Engine 需 256MB）。","-- **TMA 描述符**：存储在 constant memory 或寄存器（每描述符 128 字节），由 `cuTensorMapEncodeTiled` 创建，描述 2D/3D tile 形状、数据类型、layout。","+**指令 Pipeline 时序图（Hopper WGMMA + TMA 异步流水线）**:"," ","-#### 1.3.3 Producer-Consumer 流水线的指令级时序","-","-**FlashAttention-3 的 Pingpong Scheduling**（笔记证据: `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/FlashAttention-3/3-FlashAttention-3-Algorithm.md`）:","-"," ```","-// ===== FA-3 Producer-Consumer Pipeline: Instruction-Level Timeline =====","-// 2 warpgroups: Producer (1 WG) + Consumer (1 WG)","+时间 →"," ","-// T0: Producer issues TMA loads — 不阻塞","-T0:  PROD: TMA_load(Q_tile,     completion=bar_Q)","-T1:  PROD: TMA_load(K_tile[0],  completion=bar_K[0])","-T2:  PROD: TMA_load(V_tile[0],  completion=bar_V[0])","-     // Consumer 等待第一批数据","-T3:  CONS: wait(bar_Q, bar_K[0], bar_V[0])","-     // Consumer 开始计算，Producer 预取下一 tile","-T4:  CONS: wgmma_commit(Q_tile, K_tile[0])       // QK^T WGMMA 异步发射","-     PROD: TMA_load(K_tile[1], completion=bar_K[1])  // || 预取 K[1]","-T5:  CONS: wgmma_wait()  → S_tile                // QK^T 完成","-     PROD: TMA_load(V_tile[1], completion=bar_V[1])  // || 预取 V[1]","-T6:  CONS: softmax_warp(S_tile)                   // CUDA Core softmax","-     // Producer K[1],V[1] 已在后台传输完成","-T7:  CONS: wgmma_commit(P_tilde, V_tile[0])       // PV WGMMA","-     PROD: TMA_load(K_tile[2], completion=bar_K[2])  // || 预取 K[2]","-T8:  CONS: wgmma_wait() → O_partial","-     PROD: TMA_load(V_tile[2], completion=bar_V[2])  // || 预取 V[2]","-// 从 T4 开始：Producer load(K/V[j+1]) || Consumer compute(K/V[j])","-// 完全重叠 — 计算隐藏所有 memory latency","+Producer Warp (TMA):","+  T0-T3:  [TMA_load tile_0 → sA[0]]──┐","+  T4-T7:  [TMA_load tile_1 → sA[1]]  │ (overlapped)","+  T8-T11: [TMA_load tile_2 → sA[0]]  │","+                                      │","+Consumer Warpgroup (WGMMA):           │","+  T0-T2:  [mbarrier.wait prod[0]] ◄──┘","+  T3-T6:  [wgmma.mma_async(tile_0, C_acc)]──┐ Tensor Cores 后台执行","+  T7-T9:  [mbarrier.wait prod[1]] ◄──────────┘","+  T10-T13:[wgmma.mma_async(tile_1, C_acc)]","+  T14:    ..."," ","-// 硬件利用率时间线:","-// Tensor Core:   |_idle_|████ QK^T ████|_idle_|████ PV ████|...","-// CUDA Core:     |_idle_|_idle_|██ softmax ██|_idle_|...","-// TMA (memory):  |██ Q ██|██ K0 ██|██ V0 ██|██ K1 ██|██ V1 ██|██ K2 ██|...","-// Shared Memory: |-- fill buf[0] --|-- consume buf[0] --|-- fill buf[1] --|...","+TMA (硬件):                   Tensor Cores (硬件):","+  ████████████████████          ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░","+  tile_0 copy ──────────►       tile_0 compute","+  tile_1 copy ──────────►       tile_1 compute","+  tile_2 copy ──────────►       tile_2 compute"," ```"," ","-**注解**：","-- **关键瓶颈分析**：H100 SXM5 有 989 TFLOPS FP16 matmul 但仅 3.9 TFLOPS 特殊函数（如 exponential）。Attention forward pass (head dim 128): matmul FLOPS 是 exp 的 512×，但 exp 吞吐是 matmul 的 1/256×，导致 exp 可能占用 50% 的 cycle。Software pipelining 将 softmax(exp) 与 GEMM 重叠，缓解此瓶颈。","-- **Warp-Specialization 的硬件基础**：Hopper SM 支持在一个 cycle 内调度不同 warpgroup 的指令——producer warpgroup 发出 TMA 后立即 yield，consumer warpgroup 在同一 cycle 执行 WGMMA。","-- **Ping-Pong Buffer 大小**：需 ≥2 个 stage buffer，每个 buffer 大小为 tile_size（典型 64-256KB for attention）。","+**注解**:","+- **TMA 硬件独立执行**: TMA 从发出请求到数据到达 SMEM 全由硬件管理，不占用 CUDA Core。Producer warp 只需 1 个线程发出 TMA 指令，其余 31 线程可释放寄存器用于其他用途。","+- **无寄存器中转**: 数据直接在 HBM ↔ SMEM 之间移动，不经寄存器文件（vs A100 的 cp.async 需 register staging）。这一特性在 attention kernel 中尤为关键——减少 register pressure 允许更大的 tile size。","+- **mbarrier 硬件加速**: TMA completion 自动 arrive(mbar_prod)，consumer 的 wait 是单周期硬件操作。Pipeline 深度 PIPE=2-3，每组 barrier 复用。","+- **Multicast 能力**: TMA 可单次操作将相同 tile 广播到 cluster 内多个 SM 的 shared memory，用于 flash attention 中 Q 被多个 KV tile 消费的场景。","+- **带宽效率**: Hopper TMA 在仅 2KB 消息大小时就能达到 74% 峰值 NVLink 带宽（vs Copy Engine 需 256MB），这对 attention decode kernel 的小 tile 场景至关重要。"," "," ---"," ","-### 1.4 指令混合 —— MMA 与 ALU 指令的协同调度","+### 方法4：ILP 指令级并行 —— Tensor MMA + Vector ALU 交错调度"," ","-**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_moe/Samoyeds/span-idpage-4-2span4.1-Dual-sided-Sparse-Data-Format-and-Kernel-Scheme.md` (score: 936), `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Tensor-Vector Parallelism Scheduling (ILP_TLP for Softmax).md` (score: 5050)","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Tensor-Vector Parallelism Scheduling (ILP_TLP for Softmax).md` (score: 2455.4), `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/CUDA Cores vs Tensor Cores (Compute Unit Heterogeneity on GPU).md` (score: 333.4)"," ","-#### 1.4.1 GEMM Attention Kernel 中的 MMA-ALU 指令混合","+**方法细节**:"," ","+FlashAttention-T 提出 Tensor-Vector Parallelism：在 fused attention kernel 中将 softmax 拆分为 tensorized 部分（repurposed MMA on Tensor Core）和 vectorized 部分（CUDA Core），通过 ILP interleaving 使两部分在同一 warp 内并行。","+","+**Ampere ILP Scheduling 伪代码**:","+"," ```","-// ===== MMA + ALU 指令混合伪代码（MoE Expert FFN Kernel, H100）=====","-// 场景: MoE expert FFN 的 GEMM + SiLU activation 融合 kernel","-// 硬件: H100 Hopper, WGMMA for GEMM, CUDA Core for SiLU","+// FlashAttention-T: Ampere ILP interleaving","+// 在单个 warp 内，通过 PTX inline assembly 手工编排指令交错"," ","-// 指令混合编排（per warpgroup, consumer side）:","-for tile_k in 0..K_tiles:","-    // Step 1: 异步发射 WGMMA（不阻塞 ALU）","-    wgmma_commit_group(tile_k % 2)           // 发射 GEMM tile_k","-    // wgmma 在 Tensor Core 后台执行，下面指令立即在 CUDA Core 执行","+void softmax_ilp_warp(reg QK[BLOCK_M], reg PV[BLOCK_M], reg O[BLOCK_M]):","+    // Split: horizontal split（同 tile 内按行分割，ratio ≈ 1:1）","+    // tensorized 部分：scaling, FMA, rowsum (repurposed MMA)","+    // vectorized 部分：max (REDUX), exp (MUFU.EX2)"," ","-    // Step 2: 在 WGMMA issue bubble 中执行 element-wise ALU","-    // 对上一 tile 的结果做 SiLU activation","-    if tile_k > 0:","-        // SiLU(x) = x * sigmoid(x)","-        // 利用 CUDA Core FMA + MUFU 指令:","-        x = reg_out[tile_k - 1]              // 从 register file 加载","-        sig = mufu_sigmoid(x)                 // MUFU.SIG (SFU, ~8 cycles)","-        silu = fma(x, sig, 0.0f)             // FMA (CUDA Core, ~4 cycles)","+    // --- ILP interleaved instruction sequence ---","+    // iteration i, per warp:"," ","-    // Step 3: 加载下一 tile 的 weight（与 MMA + ALU 重叠）","-    cp.async.bulk(smem_weight[next_k], gmem_weight[next_k])  // TMA","+    // Step 1: QK^T MMA (Tensor Core)","+    mma.sync(Q_frag, K_frag, S_frag)     // S = QK^T"," ","-    // Step 4: 同步 WGMMA","-    wgmma_wait_group(tile_k % 2)","-    reg_out[tile_k] = wgmma_result           // WGMMA 结果进 register","+    // Step 2: ILP-interleaved softmax","+    //   tensor MMA:  scaling + FMA + rowsum","+    //   vector ALU:   max (REDUX) + exp (MUFU.EX2)","+    //   交错编排，使 vector 指令在 tensor MMA 的 issue bubble 中执行"," ","-// CUDA Core（ALU）利用率提升分析:","-// 传统串行: |-- WGMMA --|-- SiLU --|-- WGMMA --|-- SiLU --|","-// 指令混合: |-- WGMMA(tile_k) --|-- WGMMA(tile_k+1) --|","-//           |-- SiLU(tile_k-1) --|-- SiLU(tile_k) --|","-// ALU 利用率: 从 <50% 提升至接近 100%","-```","+    // Pseudo instruction sequence (手写 PTX):","+    mma.sync.aligned.m16n8k16.row.col.f32.f16.f16.f32  // tensor: scaling","+    redux.op.max.f32  R_max, S_row                       // vector: max (并行)","+    mma.sync.aligned.m16n8k16.row.col.f32.f16.f16.f32  // tensor: FMA","+    fma.rn.f32         S_sub, -R_max, 1.0               // vector: subtract max","+    mma.sync.aligned.m16n8k16.row.col.f32.f16.f16.f32  // tensor: rowsum","+    ex2.approx.f32     P_row, S_sub                      // vector: exp (并行)"," ","-**注解**：","-- **指令混合的硬件基础**：GPU SM 有独立的 Tensor Core 和 CUDA Core 执行管线。Tensor Core WGMMA 指令发射后（通过 `wgmma_commit_group`），不占用 CUDA Core 执行资源，CUDA Core 可同时执行 FMA、MUFU、REDUX 等 ALU 指令。","-- **Dual-Issue 能力**：Ampere/Hopper SM 的每个 Warp Scheduler 每周期最多发射 2 条指令——1 条发往 Tensor Core + 1 条发往 CUDA Core（需不同执行单元、无数据依赖）。指令混合编排的关键是将 MMA 和 ALU 指令在 warp 指令流中交替排列。","-- **MoE 的特殊机会**：MoE expert FFN 中有大量 element-wise activation（SiLU、GeLU、SwiGLU），这些操作通常是 compute-bound kernel 中的 \"bubble\"——指令混合使这些 bubble 被 GEMM 隐藏。","-- **寄存器压力**：指令混合需要同时保持 GEMM accumulator 和 activation 中间结果在 register file 中。若 register 不足 → spill to shared memory → 性能下降。","+    // 效果: t'_softmax < t_vec (baseline 全 vector softmax 时间)","+    //       t'_vec = t'_softmax - (t_vec - t'_softmax)"," ","-#### 1.4.2 MMA.sp 指令与 Sparse ALU 混合（Samoyeds, 辅助说明）","+    // Step 3: PV MMA (Tensor Core)","+    mma.sync(P_frag, V_frag, O_frag)     // O += PV","+```"," ","-Samoyeds 利用 Hopper 的 `mma.sp` 指令（sparse MMA）实现 MoE expert FFN 的 2:4 structured sparsity GEMM。指令混合策略将 MMA.sp 的 metadata 加载与 expert routing mask 的 element-wise ALU 操作重叠。笔记提供了 sparse MMA 与 ALU 混合的概念描述，具体实现细节（如 CUTLASS 3.x sparse GEMM kernel 的指令 pipeline 布局）笔记未完全展开。","+**注解**:","+- **ILP interleaving 原理**: GPU dual-issue 能力允许同时发射一条 Tensor Core 指令和一条 CUDA Core 指令（或相邻周期交错发射）。Tensor MMA 指令有 issue bubble——Tensor Core 后台执行时 CUDA Core 空闲，vector 指令填充这些 bubble。","+- **Split 策略**: Horizontal split（同 tile 按行分割 tensorized/vectorized，ratio≈1:1）平衡两种计算资源；Vertical split（跨 tile 分割，ratio 固定 1:1）受 warp register capacity 限制（最多 2 tiles）。","+- **Hopper TLP 对比**: Hopper 上使用 Thread-Level Parallelism 替代 ILP——将 repurposed WGMMA row-sum 加入下一 iteration 的 QK^T+PV WGMMA batch，与另一 warpgroup 的 vector S/O rescaling 并行。Vector interval ratio 降至 2.7%（远优于 ILP），因 WGMMA 支持更灵活的 dynamic tensor-vector overlap。","+- **CUDA Core vs Tensor Core 吞吐差距**: H100 上 CUDA Core FP32 ≈ 60 TFLOPS，Tensor Core INT8 ≈ 990 TFLOPS（16.5× 差距）。这是 dequantization 成为瓶颈的根本原因——LiquidGEMM 的 LiquidQuant 将 dequant 指令降至 0.875 条/element（vs QServe 的 ≥10 条/element）。"," "," ---"," ","-### 1.5 硬件平台差异 —— GPU SIMT vs NPU VLIW vs TPU XLA","+### 方法5：Implicit Fine-Grained Pipeline (ImFP) —— 跨 Warp Group 指令混合"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Hexagon NPU HVX+HMX Architecture.md` (text mode), `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/RPU ISA _ CISC-style ISA for AI Accelerators.md` (text mode), `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/LUT-based Dequantization and Softmax on NPU Vector Units.md` (text mode)","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Implicit Fine-Grained Pipeline (ImFP).md` (score: 1737.9), `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/CUDA Cores vs Tensor Cores (Compute Unit Heterogeneity on GPU).md` (score: 333.4)"," ","-#### 1.5.1 硬件平台指令编排对比表","+**方法细节**:"," ","-| 维度 | GPU SIMT (NVIDIA H100) | GPU SIMT (AMD MI300X) | NPU VLIW (Qualcomm Hexagon) | NPU (华为昇腾 910B) | TPU (Google v5p) |","-|------|------------------------|------------------------|-----------------------------|---------------------|------------------|","-| **指令模型** | SIMT (RISC-like) | SIMT (RISC-like) | VLIW (4 slots/thread) | 达芬奇架构 (Cube+Vector+Scalar) | VLIW/XLA (128×128 MXU) |","-| **调度方式** | HW warp scheduler (4/SM) | HW wavefront scheduler | 编译器静态调度 (VLIW slot 分配) | 编译器分派到 Cube/Vector/Scalar | XLA compiler 静态编排 |","-| **并发粒度** | Warp (32 threads) | Wavefront (64 threads) | VLIW thread (6-8 HW threads) | Cube/Vector/Scalar 三单元并行 | 128×128 systolic array |","-| **ILP 机制** | Dual-issue (TC+CUDA Core) | Dual-issue (MAC+ALU) | 4 VLIW slots/cycle | 指令级 Cube+Vector 并行 | VLIW bundle |","-| **延迟隐藏** | Warp 切换 (零成本) | Wavefront 切换 | 软件管理 (DMA double buffer) | 流水线并行 (Cube/Vector overlap) | XLA 静态 overlap |","-| **寄存器压力** | 255 registers/thread, occupancy 约束 | 256 registers/thread | 32×1024-bit vector regs/thread | 达芬奇 L0/L1 buffer | MXU 内部 accumulator |","-| **异步拷贝** | TMA (Hopper) / cp.async (Ampere) | ROCm async copy | DMA engine (DDR↔TCM) | 昇腾 DMA (HBM↔L1) | XLA 静态 data transfer schedule |","-| **流水线深度** | 2-5 stages (software) | 2-5 stages | 3-stage (LOADING/LOOPING/LAUNCHING) | 编译期确定 | XLA 静态确定 |","+LiquidGEMM 提出 ImFP（Implicit Fine-Grained Pipeline），将 traditional explicit coarse pipeline (ExCP) 的 Load→Dequant→MMA 三阶段流水线改为 single-producer multiple-consumer 模型："," ","-#### 1.5.2 NPU VLIW 指令编排（Qualcomm Hexagon）","+```","+// ImFP 执行流程（每 thread block = 3 WGs: 1 Load + 2 Compute）","+// Load WG (4 warps, 仅操作 TMA):","+for each K_tile iteration:","+    TMA: GMEM → SMEM[pong]           // async weight load (Dual-MMA packed)","+    cp.async.bulk.wait_group","+    for each MMA fragment in tile:","+        smem_task_queue.push({frag_addr, frag_meta})  // metadata only","+    swap(ping, pong)"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Hexagon NPU HVX+HMX Architecture.md`","-","-Hexagon NPU 的 VLIW 指令编排：","-","+// Compute WG_0 & WG_1 (各 4 warps, CUDA + Tensor Cores):","+while true:","+    task = smem_task_queue.try_pop()  // atomic 竞争, 无 barrier","+    if !task: break","+    LDS.128: RF = SMEM[task.addr]     // 32 UINT4, single instruction","+    unpack_4bit(RF)                   // CUDA Core","+    dequant_LQQ(RF)                   // IMAD + XOR, CUDA Core (2 条指令)","+    WGMMA(C_frag, A_frag, RF)         // INT8 MMA, Tensor Core 异步","+    // WG_0 和 WG_1 处理不同 tasks","+    // → WG_0 做 dequant 时 WG_1 做 MMA → 跨 WG 重叠"," ```","-// ===== Hexagon NPU VLIW Instruction Bundle =====","-// 每 cycle 发射 1 个 VLIW packet（4 slots）","-// Slot 分配由编译器静态完成"," ","-VLIW_Packet:","-    S0: scalar ALU op    // 地址计算、循环控制","-    S1: vector ALU op    // HVX: vadd, vmul, vrelu","-    S2: vector load      // HVX: vgather, vlut16","-    S3: matrix op        // HMX: tile-level GEMM (32×32 FP16)","+**注解**:","+- **消除 SMEM↔RF round-trip**: ExCP 需要 Load→Dequant（SMEM→RF→SMEM）→MMA（SMEM→RF），ImFP 中 Compute WG 直接从 SMEM 读取并一站式完成 dequant+MMA，消除中间 SMEM 写回。","+- **跨 WG 异构重叠**: WG_0 在 CUDA Core 上做 dequant 时，WG_1 在 Tensor Core 上做 MMA。这种重叠是天然的——不需要软件 barrier，由硬件 atomic 竞争自动调度。","+- **Dual-MMA packed layout**: 两个连续 MMA 操作的元素打包存储，LDS.128 单条指令加载 32 个 UINT4 元素，充分利用 shared memory 带宽。","+- **dequant 指令最小化**: LiquidQuant (LQQ) 仅需 IMAD + XOR 两条 32-bit 硬件指令处理四个元素，α=0.875 指令/element，远低于 QServe 的 α≥10。确保 CUDA Core 不成为 pipeline 瓶颈。"," ","-// 典型 decode GEMM 的 VLIW 编排（per cycle）:","-cycle_0:  S0: addr_calc(next_tile)  | S1: NOP        | S2: vgather(act)   | S3: HMX_mma(tile_0)","-cycle_1:  S0: loop_ctrl             | S1: vlut16(deq) | S2: vgather(wgt)   | S3: HMX_mma(tile_0) // HMX 多周期","-cycle_2:  S0: NOP                   | S1: vmul(scale) | S2: NOP            | S3: HMX_mma(tile_1)","-cycle_3:  S0: addr_calc(next_tile)  | S1: vrelu(act)  | S2: DMA_prefetch   | S3: HMX_mma(tile_1)","+---"," ","-// VLIW 约束:","-// - 4 slots 必须全部可填充（否则插入 NOP → 效率损失）","-// - S0-S3 间不能有数据依赖（编译器需提前调度）","-// - HMX (S3) 仅访问 TCM（Tightly Coupled Memory），不直接访问 DDR","-// - vgather 延迟: 24-48 VLIW packets on V75","-```","+### 方法6：Multi-stage Register Pipeline（多级寄存器流水线）"," ","-**注解**：","-- **VLIW vs SIMT 的根本差异**：GPU SIMT 依赖硬件 warp scheduler 动态调度——warp stall 时自动切换，程序员不感知调度细节。NPU VLIW 依赖编译器静态调度——编译器必须在编译期确定所有指令的 slot 分配和延迟，无运行时动态切换。","-- **VLIW 的 NOP 问题**：若编译器无法填满 4 slots（因数据依赖或资源冲突），插入 NOP → 执行单元闲置。GPU SIMT 通过 warp 切换避免此问题。","-- **软件管理内存**：Hexagon NPU 的 8MiB TCM 完全由软件管理（类似 scratchpad），编译器需显式编排 DMA 搬运。GPU 有硬件管理的 L1/L2 cache 层次。","-- **类似架构**：华为昇腾 Ascend NPU 的达芬奇架构也采用 Cube Unit + Vector Unit + Scalar Unit 的三单元设计，指令分派到不同单元并行执行。笔记未提供昇腾的具体 VLIW slot 细节。","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Multi-stage Register Pipeline (for SpMV on Tensor Cores).md` (score: 3576.4)"," ","-#### 1.5.3 CISC-style ISA（RPU）对比","+**方法细节**:"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/RPU ISA _ CISC-style ISA for AI Accelerators.md`","+Drawloom 为解决 SpMV 中 memory-compute 串行化导致的 warp stall，将四大操作步骤重构为 5 阶段流水线："," ","-RPU 提出第三种范式——CISC-style ISA：","-"," ```","-// ===== RPU CISC 指令 vs GPU RISC 指令对比 =====","+// Pipeline 参数","+delaySMEM = 1  // double buffering: 2 组 SMEM buffer 交替","+delayREG = 2   // 3 组 REG set 轮流使用"," ","-// GPU (RISC-like): 每指令 ~1 操作，依赖 warp scheduler 动态调度","-ld.shared r1, [sA_addr]        // 1 指令: 加载","-mma.sync r2, r1, r3            // 1 指令: MMA","-st.shared [sO_addr], r2        // 1 指令: 存储","+// 5 阶段流水线","+// Stage 1: FillSMEM — async-copy 填充 SMEM buffer","+// Stage 2: FillREG — SMEM→REG + LDG 加载 vector X","+// Stage 3: Comp — TC MMA 计算（使用前一阶段的 REG 数据）","+// Stage 4: EmptySMEM — 完成剩余 SMEM→REG 搬移","+// Stage 5: EmptyREG — 完成剩余计算"," ","-// RPU (CISC-style): 每指令封装 ~1000 MAC 操作，固定 streaming schedule","-// LOADING stage:","-MEM_DMA.load(HBM_addr, mem_buf_entry, valid_count=1)","-// LOOPING stage:","-for each stripe:","-    TMAC.compute()             // 1 指令: 完整 VMM stripe（~千 MAC）","-    tree_sum()                 // reduction","-// 无动态调度 — 硬件 pipeline 在 input ready 时自动前进","+// 关键控制: pipeline_wait_prior(N) 确保 N 阶段前的数据就绪","+//           pipeline_commit() 提交当前 async-copy 批次","+","+// delaySMEM=1, delayREG=2 时，最多 3 个 REG set 同时 in-flight:","+//   REG set [0]: 正在被 MMA 消费","+//   REG set [1]: 正在被 LDG 填充","+//   REG set [2]: 正在等待 SMEM 数据就绪"," ```"," ","-**注解**：","-- **RPU 的确定性调度**：消除 GPU 的 host-driven offload model 和 runtime kernel launch/scheduling overhead。RPU core 完全自主执行（autonomous execution）。","-- **Groq LPU 类似思想**：笔记未提供 Groq LPU 的详细资料，但从搜索结果的 StreamTensor 论文可推断 Groq 也采用 deterministic scheduling——编译器确定所有数据移动和计算的精确时序。","+**注解**:","+- **delaySMEM** 控制 GMEM→SMEM 的 double buffering 阶段数（Ampere 上通过 cp.async 实现）","+- **delayREG** 控制 SMEM→REG + computation 的重叠阶段数。多级 REG pipeline 进一步解耦 SMEM→REG 和计算，消除 data dependency stall","+- **消融实验**: v4（+Multi-stage Pipeline）相比 v3 平均提速 1.46×（mip1 达 5.68×），warp stall 改善 3.02×-3.13×，memory throughput 提升 2.61×-2.75×","+- **适用前提**: 每次 memory access 只触发一个 TC 操作（SpMV 的稀疏特性），因此需要多级 REG pipeline 进一步重叠 short-latency TC computation 与 irregular X vector access"," "," ---"," ","-## 2. 是什么？—— 指令编排与软件流水线的核心概念","+## 二、实验环境（主内容）"," ","-**笔记证据**: 综合上述所有笔记","+**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_2026/37-RoMeo.../3-Algorithm...md` (score: 975.4), `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Multi-stage Register Pipeline (for SpMV on Tensor Cores).md` (score: 3576.4)"," ","-### 核心概念层级","+### 硬件平台"," ","-| 概念 | 定义 | 硬件基础 |","-|------|------|----------|","-| **ILP** | 单 warp/wavefront 内多条独立指令并行发射 | GPU dual-issue、NPU VLIW slots |","-| **TLP** | 多 warp/wavefront 并发执行，warp scheduler 切换隐藏延迟 | 独立 per-warp register file + PC |","-| **Software Pipelining** | 将 memory load 与 compute 组织为流水线阶段，第 i+1 个 tile 的 load 与第 i 个 tile 的 compute 重叠 | TMA / cp.async / DMA engine |","-| **Warp Specialization** | 同一 block 内 warps 按功能分组（producer/consumer），各组执行不同任务 | Hopper warpgroup + mbarrier |","-| **Instruction Mix** | MMA 指令与 ALU 指令交替编排，利用 Tensor Core 与 CUDA Core 的独立执行管线 | 独立 TC + CUDA Core 执行单元 |","-| **Latency Hiding** | 当某 warp stall 时（memory/execution dependency），warp scheduler 立即切换到另一 ready warp | 零成本 warp 切换 |","+| 平台 | GPU 型号 | SM 数量 | SMEM/SM | HBM 带宽 | Tensor Core 代数 | 关键特性 |","+|------|----------|---------|---------|----------|------------------|----------|","+| NVIDIA H100 (Hopper) | H100 SXM | 132 | 256KB | 3.35 TB/s (HBM3) | 4th Gen | TMA + WGMMA + mbarrier + FP8 |","+| NVIDIA A100 (Ampere) | A100 SXM | 108 | 164KB | 2.0 TB/s (HBM2e) | 3rd Gen | cp.async + mma.sp + structured sparsity |","+| NVIDIA RTX 4090 (Ada) | RTX 4090 | 128 | 128KB | 1.0 TB/s (GDDR6X) | 4th Gen | 无 TMA（Ada 不支持 Hopper 特性）|","+| AMD MI300X (CDNA3) | MI300X | 304 CU | 64KB LDS/CU | 5.3 TB/s (HBM3) | Matrix Core | s_waitcnt + buffer_load_dword |"," ","----","+**注解**: 笔记显示 Ampere (A100) pipeline 依赖 cp.async + software barrier，Hopper (H100) pipeline 升级为 TMA 硬件 + mbarrier + warp specialization。AMD CDNA 路径使用 s_waitcnt lgkmcnt + buffer_load_dword lds 指令。NPU 昇腾和 TPU 的实验环境数据笔记未明确覆盖。"," ","-## 3. 实现 —— 典型框架中的指令编排实践 (辅助说明)","+### 关键评估指标"," ","-### 3.1 FlashAttention-3 的 Warp-Specialized Pipeline","+- **Warp occupancy**: SM 上同时 resident 的 warp 数。更高 occupancy → 更多 warp 可隐藏延迟，但每 warp 寄存器减少 → ILP 降低","+- **Pipeline stage utilization**: 各流水线阶段的利用率。理想状态 producer load 与 consumer compute 100% 重叠","+- **Vector interval ratio**: Tensor Core idle 时间占比（越小越好）。FlashAttention-T Hopper TLP 降至 2.7%","+- **指令级效率**: dequant 指令数/element（LiquidQuant α=0.875 vs QServe α≥10）","+- **Memory bandwidth 利用率**: TMA 在 2KB 消息达 74% NVLink 峰值带宽"," ","-**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/FlashAttention-3/3-FlashAttention-3-Algorithm.md` (score: 1588)","+---"," ","-FA-3 在 Hopper GPU 上的实现要点：","-- **2 Warpgroups**：Producer (1 WG) 通过 TMA 异步加载 K/V tiles → Consumer (1 WG) 执行 GEMM + softmax","-- **Pingpong Scheduling**：softmax (CUDA Core) 与 GEMM (Tensor Core) 在不同 warpgroup 间重叠","-- **setmaxnreg**：使用 `setmaxnreg` 指令动态 (de)alloc 寄存器，优化 warpgroup 间的 register 分配","-- **FP8 支持**：利用 Hopper FP8 WGMMA (2× throughput vs FP16)，但 softmax 仍在 FP32 精度","+## 三、实现（辅助说明）"," ","-### 3.2 CUTLASS 3.x 的 Software Pipelining","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Actor-Based Warp Specialization for In-Kernel Scheduling.md` (score: 3179.7), `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Software Pipeline (T.Pipelined).md` (score: 359.6)"," ","-CUTLASS 3.x 的 Hopper GEMM kernel 采用 warp-specialized pipeline：","-- Producer warpgroup: TMA load global→shared (A/B matrix tiles)","-- Consumer warpgroups: WGMMA computation","-- Multi-stage software pipeline (typically PIPE_STAGES=3-5)","-- 通过 CuTe 库的 `cute::copy` with TMA backend 封装 TMA 操作","+### FlashMoE Actor-Based Warp Specialization"," ","-(笔记 `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Warp-Group Specialization (Hopper GPU).md` 提供了 CUTLASS 3.x 的 warpgroup 概述但未展开具体 GEMM kernel 配置。)","+FlashMoE 的纯软件 actor 模型（可在 SM70+ GPU 运行，不依赖 Hopper TMA）："," ","-### 3.3 MoE Kernel 中的指令混合实践","+```","+// 三种 Actor 角色（同一 kernel 内，无 barrier 同步）","+// Processor (N-1 blocks): 执行 GEMM + combine + dispatch","+// Subscriber (OS block 内 3 warps): 解码远端 tile packet → task descriptor","+// Scheduler (OS block 内 1 warp): work-conserving 调度"," ","-MoE expert FFN kernel 的指令混合策略（综合多个笔记推断）：","-- GEMM tile 通过 WGMMA/TMA 流水线执行","-- Expert routing mask 的 element-wise multiply 与 GEMM 重叠","-- Activation (SiLU/GeLU) 在前一 tile 的 WGMMA issue bubble 中执行","-- Samoyeds 利用 mma.sp 指令实现 2:4 sparsity GEMM，sparse metadata 加载与 element-wise mask 混合","+// Actor 交互（event-driven, polling-based）:","+Subscriber: poll NVSHMEM flag → atomic retrieve → decode →","+            write task queue (GMEM) → atomicAdd doorbell (SMEM) →","+            notify Scheduler"," ","----","+Scheduler:  sweep all doorbells → WarpInclusiveSum →","+            signal idle Processor (GMEM)"," ","-## 4. 实验环境 (辅助说明)","+Processor:  await_scheduler_signal → warp broadcast task →","+            switch(type):","+              GEMM0: fGET fused CUTLASS GEMM+GELU","+              GEMM1: fGET + NVSHMEM put result → combine (Hadamard)","+```"," ","-**笔记证据**: 综合多个笔记的硬件规格描述","+### TileLang T.Pipelined 实现"," ","-### 4.1 关键评估指标","+用户仅需添加 `T.Pipelined(K // block_K, num_stages=N)` annotation，编译器自动：(1) 分析 loop body 中各 buffer 的读/写关系确定 prod/cons 角色；(2) 插入对应架构的异步指令序列（Ampere→cp.async、Hopper→TMA、CDNA→buffer_load_dword）；(3) Live Variable Analysis 确定同步点→插入 barrier；(4) Hopper 架构上自动应用 warp specialization。TileLang 的 FlashAttention 实现（~70 行 Python）达到 FlashAttention-3（手写 CUDA）98% 的性能。"," ","-| 指标 | 说明 | 典型值 / 来源 |","-|------|------|-------------|","-| **SM Occupancy** | Active warps / Max warps per SM | Memory-bound kernel 可 <10%（HuntKTm 测量） |","-| **MFU** | Actual FLOPS / Peak FLOPS | FA-3 H100 FP16 forward: 论文提及提升显著 |","-| **TMA 带宽利用率** | Achieved BW / Peak HBM BW | H100: 74% at 2KB message (TMA, 笔记来源) |","-| **Warp Stall Cycles** | Warp 因 memory/exec dependency 等待的 cycle 比例 | Memory-bound kernel 可 >80% |","-| **流水线 Efficiency** | T_compute / (T_compute + T_memory_stall) | Software pipelined: >90%（笔记推断） |","+---"," ","-### 4.2 硬件平台规格","+## 四、是什么？（辅助说明）"," ","-| 平台 | SM/CU 数量 | Shared Memory/SM | HBM 带宽 | 关键指令特性 |","-|------|-----------|------------------|----------|-------------|","-| H100 (Hopper) | 132 SM | 228KB | 3.35TB/s | TMA, WGMMA, FP8, mbarrier |","-| A100 (Ampere) | 108 SM | 164KB | 2.0TB/s | cp.async, MMA.sp (2:4), no TMA |","-| MI300X (CDNA3) | 304 CU | 64KB/CU | 5.3TB/s | ROCm wavefront (64 threads) |","-| 昇腾 910B | 达芬奇架构 | L0: 64KB, L1: 1MB | 1.6TB/s | Cube+Vector+Scalar 三单元 |","-| TPU v5p | 1 core = 1 MXU | VPU memory | — | MXU 128×128, XLA static schedule |","+### 核心概念关系"," ","----","+多算子/微算子并发的指令编排与软件流水线设计的本质是**通过指令级和 warp 级的时间重叠，最大化 GPU 异构计算单元的利用率**。四个概念构成层次化调度体系："," ","-## 5. 方法对比表","+1. **ILP (指令级并行)**: 单 warp 内的指令交错——利用 GPU dual-issue 能力，将 Tensor Core MMA 的 issue bubble 填充 CUDA Core vector 指令","+2. **Warp 级调度**: SM 级——Warp Scheduler 通过零成本 warp 切换隐藏 memory latency","+3. **Software Pipelining**: Kernel 级——通过 producer-consumer 流水线将 HBM→SMEM 数据搬运与 Tensor Core 计算重叠","+4. **指令混合**: 计算单元级——将 GEMM/attention MMA 指令与 element-wise ALU 指令混合调度，提升异构计算单元利用率"," ","-| 方法 | 核心机制 | ILP/TLP 策略 | 异步拷贝 | 适用模型 | 硬件平台 | 笔记证据 |","-|------|----------|-------------|----------|----------|----------|----------|","-| **FlashAttention-T ILP** | Tensor-Vector Parallelism: MMA+ALU interleaving | ILP (Ampere): MMA/vector 指令在 warp 内交替; TLP (Hopper): 2 warpgroups 并行 | Ampere: 无特殊 async copy; Hopper: TMA + WGMMA | DiT attention, 多模态 cross-attention | A100, H100 | ILP/TLP note (score:5050) |","-| **FlashAttention-3** | Warp specialization + pingpong scheduling | 2 warpgroups: GEMM-softmax overlap | TMA + WGMMA async | Video spatial-temporal attention, DiT | H100 (Hopper) | FA-3 note (score:1588) |","-| **GLA Kernel** | Warp specialization + software pipelining | Producer-consumer warps: TMA load // MMA compute | TMA (contiguous) / cp.async (paged) | 多模态, Video decode | H100, A100 | HW-Efficient Attn (score:392) |","-| **CUTLASS 3.x GEMM** | Multi-stage software pipeline + warp specialization | Producer WG (TMA) + Consumer WGs (WGMMA) | TMA bulk transfer | MoE expert FFN GEMM | H100 (Hopper) | TMA note (score:1575) |","-| **Samoyeds MoE** | MMA.sp + element-wise ALU 混合 | Sparse MMA + CUDA Core mask apply 并行 | cp.async (Ampere) | MoE sparse expert FFN | A100, H100 | Samoyeds note (score:936) |","-| **Hexagon NPU VLIW** | 4-slot VLIW: S0(scalar)+S1(vector)+S2(load)+S3(matrix) | 编译器静态 slot 分配, 6-8 HW threads | DMA engine DDR↔TCM | 多模态 mobile inference | Hexagon V73/V75/V79 | Hexagon NPU (text) |","-| **RPU CISC ISA** | CISC 指令封装千 MAC, 固定 streaming schedule | 无动态调度, pipeline arbiter 硬件同步 | MEM_DMA, NET_DMA | LLM decode | RPU (research) | RPU ISA note (text) |","-| **HuntKTm Hybrid** | Multi-kernel SM 空间共享提升 occupancy | SM occupancy 提升 2.47-3.76× | — | MoE, 多模态 (memory-bound) | A100 | SM Occupancy (score:4398) |","+### 跨平台差异"," ","----","+| 特性 | NVIDIA GPU (SIMT) | AMD GPU (CDNA) | NPU 昇腾 (达芬奇) | TPU (XLA) |","+|------|-------------------|----------------|-------------------|-----------|","+| 指令并行模式 | Dual-issue (ILP) + warp 交错 | Wavefront 交错 | VLIW 超长指令字（笔记未详述） | VLIW / XLA 编译调度（笔记未详述） |","+| 异步拷贝 | Ampere: cp.async (PTX LDGSTS)、Hopper: TMA | s_waitcnt lgkmcnt + buffer_load_dword | Cube Unit / Vector Unit（笔记未详述） | MXU systolic array（笔记未详述） |","+| 同步原语 | Ampere: __pipeline_wait_prior、Hopper: mbarrier | s_waitcnt | 笔记未明确说明 | 笔记未明确说明 |","+| 寄存器压力管理 | setmaxnreg + occupancy trade-off | VGPR pressure | 笔记未明确说明 | 笔记未明确说明 |","+| 流水线深度 | 2-5 stages（取决于 SMEM/REG 资源） | 笔记未明确说明 | 笔记未明确说明 | 笔记未明确说明 |"," ","-## 6. 不确定性","+**笔记明确覆盖**: NVIDIA GPU (Ampere/Hopper/Ada) 和 AMD CDNA 的 pipeline 差异（TileLang T.Pipelined 伪代码）。NPU 昇腾达芬奇 VLIW 指令编排和 TPU XLA VLIW 指令编排的细节，当前 vault 笔记未明确覆盖。"," ","-以下方面笔记证据不足或缺失，标注为推断或缺失：","+---"," ","-1. **TPU XLA 指令编排细节**：笔记中未找到 Google TPU v5e/v5p 的 XLA 编译器指令编排、VLIW bundle 结构、MXU pipeline 深度的详细描述。上述 TPU 相关内容基于公开知识的推断，标注为「笔记未明确说明」。","+## 五、方法对比表"," ","-2. **AMD MI300X Wavefront 调度**：笔记中未找到 AMD CDNA3 架构 wavefront scheduler 的详细描述（wavefront 数量、调度策略、与 NVIDIA warp scheduler 的差异）。标注为「笔记未明确说明」。","+| 方法 | 核心机制 | 实现框架 | 硬件平台 | 关键指标 | 笔记证据 |","+|------|----------|----------|----------|----------|----------|","+| Warp Scheduler 延迟隐藏 | 零成本 warp 切换，greedy-then-oldest 策略 | GPU 硬件固件（闭源） | NVIDIA Ampere/Hopper/Ada | 4 warp schedulers/SM，每 2 周期/warp 指令 | knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Warp Scheduler (NVIDIA GPU).md (3339.9) |","+| Software Pipelining (cp.async) | double buffering + async copy→SMEM + mma overlap | CUDA cp.async / CUTLASS / Triton num_stages | NVIDIA Ampere (A100) | num_stages=2-4，SMEM 占用 = stages×tile_size | knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Software Pipelining for GPU Attention Kernels.md (3306.4) |","+| Hopper TMA + Warp Specialization | TMA 硬件异步拷贝 + wgmma.mma_async + mbarrier + warp 角色分工 | CUTLASS 3.x + CuTe / TileLang T.Pipelined | NVIDIA Hopper (H100) | TMA 2KB 达 74% NVLink 峰值，PIPE=2-3 | knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Tensor Memory Accelerator (TMA).md (5104.2) |","+| ILP Tensor-Vector Parallelism | 同 warp 内交错 tensor MMA 和 vector ALU 指令 | 手写 CUDA PTX inline assembly | Ampere (ILP) / Hopper (TLP) | Hopper TLP vector interval ratio 2.7% | knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Tensor-Vector Parallelism Scheduling (ILP_TLP for Softmax).md (2455.4) |","+| ImFP (Implicit Fine-Grained Pipeline) | Single-producer multiple-consumer，跨 WG dequant+MMA 自然重叠 | CUTLASS/CuTe warp-specialized kernel | Hopper (H100/H800) | α=0.875 指令/element，消除 SMEM↔RF round-trip | knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Implicit Fine-Grained Pipeline (ImFP).md (1737.9) |","+| Multi-stage Register Pipeline | 5 阶段流水线：FillSMEM→FillREG→Comp→EmptySMEM→EmptyREG | Drawloom CUDA：cp.async + LDG + TC MMA | Ampere (A100) | warp stall 改善 3.02×-3.13×，memory throughput +2.61×-2.75× | knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Multi-stage Register Pipeline (for SpMV on Tensor Cores).md (3576.4) |","+| Actor-Based Warp Specialization | 纯软件 event-driven actor 模型：Processor/Subscriber/Scheduler | FlashMoE CUDA（NVSHMEM + atomic + doorbell） | SM70+ GPU（无 TMA 要求） | N-1 blocks Processor + 1 block admin | knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Actor-Based Warp Specialization for In-Kernel Scheduling.md (3179.7) |","+| RoMeo Separate-Kernels + Async | 不同精度独立 kernel + CUDA Stream 异步并发 | CUTLASS + CUDA Graph + Triton | NVIDIA RTX 4090 (Ada) | up to 4.68× vs BF16 GEMM，up to 2.10× end-to-end | paper_secs/secs_2026/37-RoMeo.../3-Algorithm...md (975.4) |","+| TileLang T.Pipelined | 编译器自动分析 buffer 依赖→生成架构特定 pipeline | TileLang JIT Compiler | Ampere/Hopper/AMD CDNA | 自动 warp specialization，70 行 Python = 98% FA-3 性能 | knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Software Pipeline (T.Pipelined).md (359.6) |"," ","-3. **华为昇腾 Ascend 910B 指令编排**：笔记中未找到昇腾达芬奇架构 Cube Unit / Vector Unit / Scalar Unit 的具体指令格式、VLIW slot 分配、TBE/TIK 编译器指令调度的详细描述。Hexagon NPU 的 VLIW 描述可作为类似架构的参考。标注为「笔记未明确说明」。","+---"," ","-4. **Groq LPU 确定性调度**：搜索仅获得 StreamTensor 论文的间接引用（score: 261），缺少 Groq Compiler 确定性调度的具体指令 pipeline 时序描述。标注为「笔记未明确说明」。","+## 不确定性"," ","-5. **DiT/Video 特定 kernel 的指令编排**：笔记中主要覆盖了通用 attention kernel (FlashAttention-3) 和 MoE expert FFN kernel 的指令编排。DiT diffusion denoising 的特定 attention+MLP kernel、Video 的 spatial-temporal attention kernel 的具体指令编排未找到专门笔记。","+1. **NPU 昇腾达芬奇 VLIW 指令编排**: 当前 vault 笔记未明确覆盖华为昇腾 910B/310P 的 VLIW 指令 bundle 编排细节、Cube Unit 指令与 Vector Unit 指令的并行发射策略、TBE/TIK 编程框架中的 software pipelining 实现方式。此部分在 S5（平台差异）中缺失证据。"," ","-6. **Scoreboarding 硬件实现**：NVIDIA GPU 的 scoreboarding 机制（跟踪寄存器写后读/写后写依赖的硬件表）未在笔记中找到详细描述。Warp Scheduler 笔记有推断模型但未涉及 scoreboard 硬件结构。标注为「笔记未明确说明」。","+2. **TPU XLA VLIW 指令编排**: 当前 vault 笔记未明确覆盖 Google TPU v5e/v5p 的 VLIW 指令编排、XLA compiler 的指令调度策略、MXU systolic array 的 pipeline depth 和 instruction issue 模式。此部分在 S5（平台差异）中缺失证据。"," ","-7. **Multi-Instance GPU (MIG) 对指令编排的影响**：笔记未涉及 MIG 分区如何影响 warp scheduler 的行为和指令级并发。标注为「笔记未明确说明」。","+3. **Groq LPU 指令调度**: 当前 vault 笔记未覆盖 Groq Tensor Streaming Processor 的 deterministic instruction scheduling 实现细节。"," ","-8. **Dual-Issue 精确约束**：GPU 的 dual-issue（每周期 2 条指令）的具体约束条件（哪些指令对可 co-issue、哪些执行单元互斥）笔记中未提供精度描述。目前的 dual-issue 描述基于公开 NVIDIA 文档的推断。","+4. **Dual-issue 精确语义**: NVIDIA GPU 的 dual-issue 能力（如一条 FP32 + 一条 INT32 指令同时发射）和 Tensor Core MMA + CUDA Core 指令的并行发射约束，NVIDIA 未正式文档化。笔记中的 ILP interleaving 描述基于逆向工程和论文实证。"," ","-[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] L4-Q4.2","+5. **Warp Scheduler 调度策略**: NVIDIA 未公开文档化 warp scheduler 的精确调度算法。笔记中 \"greedy-then-oldest\" 和 \"loose round-robin\" 策略基于 Olmedo et al. (2020) 的微 benchmark 逆向推断，可能在不同 GPU 代数间存在差异。","+","+[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] Q4.2"]}],"originalFile":"# Q4.2 — 多算子/微算子并发的指令编排与软件流水线设计\n\n## 笔记证据概览\n\n| 路径 | 分数 | 关键信息 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Tensor-Vector Parallelism Scheduling (ILP_TLP for Softmax).md | 5050 | FlashAttention-T 的 ILP/TLP 调度：Ampere ILP interleaving、Hopper TLP overlap |\n| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/SM Occupancy.md | 4398 | SM Occupancy 定义与延迟隐藏机理 |\n| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Asynchronous Memory Copy (async-copy).md | 3872 | Ampere cp.async 硬件机制与 pipeline 流程 |\n| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Warp _ Warp Scheduler.md | 3846 | Warp Scheduler 硬件单元结构与调度策略 |\n| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/ILP_TLP_Arithmetic Intensity Trade-off in DNN Kernels.md | 3460 | ILP/TLP/Arithmetic Intensity 三维 trade-off 形式化分析 |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Software Pipelining for GPU Attention Kernels.md | 3306 | GPU attention kernel 软件流水线：producer-consumer + ping-pong buffer |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Warp-Group Specialization (Hopper GPU).md | 2796 | Hopper Warp-Group Specialization：mbarrier 同步、producer/consumer 分工 |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Warp Scheduler (NVIDIA GPU).md | 2701 | Warp Scheduler issue 决策逻辑（推测模型）与调度策略 |\n| paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/FlashAttention-3/3-FlashAttention-3-Algorithm.md | 1588 | FA-3 warp-specialization + pingpong scheduling + GEMM-softmax overlap |\n| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Tensor Memory Accelerator (TMA).md | 1575 | Hopper TMA 硬件架构、运转流程、与 cp.async 对比 |\n| paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/FlashAttention-T/1-Introduction.md | 1610 | FlashAttention-T ILP horizontal/vertical split + Hopper TLP scheduling |\n| paper_secs/secs_moe/Samoyeds/span-idpage-4-2span4.1-Dual-sided-Sparse-Data-Format-and-Kernel-Scheme.md | 936 | MMA.sp 指令与 element-wise ALU 混合 |\n| paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/Task-Based Tensor Computations on Modern GPUs | 823 | Cypress task-based model：warp-specialized kernel + producer-consumer pipeline |\n| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Hexagon NPU HVX+HMX Architecture.md | text | Qualcomm Hexagon NPU VLIW 架构：Scalar Cores + HVX + HMX |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/RPU ISA _ CISC-style ISA for AI Accelerators.md | text | RPU CISC-style ISA：与 GPU SIMT / NPU VLIW 的对比 |\n| paper_secs/secs_2026/87-Automated End-to-End Model Serving | 516 | GPU warp scheduler ILP 与 TLP 的指令级分析 |\n\n---\n\n## 1. 方法细节：指令编排与软件流水线的硬件体系结构设计\n\n### 1.1 指令级并行（ILP）—— 单 Warp 内多指令编排\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Tensor-Vector Parallelism Scheduling (ILP_TLP for Softmax).md` (score: 5050), `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/ILP_TLP_Arithmetic Intensity Trade-off in DNN Kernels.md` (score: 3460)\n\n#### 1.1.1 Ampere ILP Scheduling（FlashAttention-T）\n\nFlashAttention-T 在 Ampere GPU 上提出了 **Tensor-Vector Parallelism** 调度范式：将 softmax 计算拆分为 tensorized 部分（repurposed MMA 在 Tensor Core 上执行）和 vectorized 部分（CUDA Core 上执行），并通过 ILP interleaving 使两部分并行。\n\n**ILP 指令编排伪代码（per warp, Ampere A100）**：\n\n```\n// ===== Ampere ILP Scheduling: Horizontal Split =====\n// 输入: S_block[Br, Bc] in registers (QK^T 结果)\n//       Br=32, Bc=64 (tile size 由 warp register capacity 决定)\n// 输出: P_tilde[Br, Bc] (softmax 归一化后的 attention weights)\n\n// Step 1: Horizontal Split — 同一 tile 内按行分割\n//   tensorized rows: [0, Br/2) → Tensor Core (repurposed MMA)\n//   vectorized rows: [Br/2, Br) → CUDA Core\n//   ratio ≈ 1:1, 经 autotuning 搜索确定\n\n// Step 2: ILP Interleaving — 在 warp 内均匀交叉 MMA 和 vector 指令\nfor lane_id in 0..31:  // warp 内 32 个 thread\n    // === Tensorized 部分（上半行）===\n    // 使用 repurposed MMA 指令计算 scaling + FMA + rowsum:\n    //   MMA 指令: mma.sync.aligned.m16n8k16.row.col.f32.f16.f16.f32\n    //   将 row-sum 映射为 matrix-vector multiply: rowsum = S @ 1_vector\n    @p0 // predicate: lane 处理 tensorized rows\n    {\n        // Repurposed MMA: S * ones → rowsum (FMA accumulation)\n        // 利用 MMA 的 FMA pipeline 做 reduction\n        rowsum_partial_t = mma(S_tile[tensor_rows], ones_vector)\n    }\n\n    // === Vectorized 部分（下半行）===\n    @p1 // predicate: lane 处理 vectorized rows\n    {\n        // CUDA Core 指令序列:\n        max_local_v = redux_max(S_tile[vector_rows])     // REDUX.MAX\n        S_safe_v = sub(S_tile[vector_rows], max_local_v)  // FADD\n        exp_v = mufu_ex2(S_safe_v)                        // MUFU.EX2\n        rowsum_partial_v = redux_sum(exp_v)               // REDUX.SUM\n    }\n\n    // ILP 关键：@p0 和 @p1 的指令在同一 warp 内交替发射\n    // Tensor Core MMA 发射后不阻塞 CUDA Core 指令\n    // warp scheduler 在 MMA issue bubble 中发射 vector 指令\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **ILP 原理**：Ampere SM 有 4 个 warp scheduler，每个每 2 周期发射 1 条 warp 指令。Tensor Core MMA 指令从发射到完成有多个周期的延迟（issue bubble），warp scheduler 可在此 bubble 中发射独立的 CUDA Core 指令（如 REDUX、MUFU.EX2），实现指令级并行。\n- **Split 策略**：Horizontal split（同一 tile 内按行分割，ratio≈1:1）vs Vertical split（跨 tile 分割，ratio 固定 1:1，因 warp register capacity 限 2 tiles）。Horizontal split 在 tile 级提供更均匀的 tensor/vector 负载分布。\n- **效果**：t'_softmax < t_vec（baseline 全 vector softmax 时间），vector interval ratio 有效降低。\n- **约束**：ILP 受限于 warp 内 register file 容量（A100 每 thread 最多 255 registers）。更高 ILP 需更多 register → 降低 occupancy（TLP）。\n- **数据依赖**：tensorized rowsum 和 vectorized rowsum 间有隐式同步（均需完成后才能计算 max reduction 和 rescaling），但 split 策略将依赖最小化。\n\n#### 1.1.2 Hopper TLP Scheduling（FlashAttention-T）\n\nHopper GPU 通过更大 warpgroup（4 warps = 128 threads）和异步 WGMMA 指令实现更灵活的动态 tensor-vector overlap。\n\n```\n// ===== Hopper TLP Scheduling (2 warpgroups, per iteration) =====\n// WG1: Tensor-heavy warpgroup (WGMMA)\n// WG2: Vector-heavy warpgroup (softmax rescale)\n\n// Timeline（per iteration i）:\n// Tensor Unit: |████ WG1: QK^T WGMMA ████|████ WG1: PV WGMMA + rowsum WGMMA ████|\n// Vector Unit: |████ WG2: vec(S/O rescale from iter i-1) ████|████ WG2: next rescale ████|\n//              ← overlap: WG1 tensor 与 WG2 vector 完全并行 →\n\n// WG1 pseudocode (iteration i):\nwg1_mainloop():\n    wait(stage_barrier)                         // 等待 K/V tile 就绪\n    wgmma_commit_group(0)                       // 启动 QK^T WGMMA\n    S_tile = wgmma(Q_tile, K_tile)              // Tensor Core FP16 WGMMA\n    wgmma_wait_group(0)                         // 等待 QK^T 完成\n\n    // rowsum 也 tensorize 为 repurposed WGMMA\n    wgmma_commit_group(1)                       // PV WGMMA + rowsum WGMMA 同 batch\n    O_partial = wgmma(P_tilde, V_tile)           // Tensor Core WGMMA\n    rowsum_t = wgmma(S_tile, ones_vector)        // Repurposed WGMMA\n    wgmma_wait_group(1)\n\n    signal(WG2)                                 // 通知 WG2 做 vector rescale\n\n// WG2 pseudocode (iteration i-1 的结果):\nwg2_mainloop():\n    wait(WG1_signal)                            // WG1 完成 PV + rowsum\n    // CUDA Core vector operations:\n    max_new = redux_max(rowsum_t)               // REDUX\n    O_rescale = O_partial / max_new              // FDIV\n    S_rescale = S_tile / max_new                // FDIV\n    signal(WG1)                                 // 通知 WG1 下一轮\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **TLP 优势**：WGMMA 允许灵活的 dynamic tensor-vector overlap，不受 static instruction ordering 约束。vector interval ratio 降至 2.7%，远优于 ILP。\n- **WGMMA 异步特性**：`wgmma.commit_group` 发射后不阻塞，`wgmma.wait_group` 显式同步。允许 producer warpgroup 连续发射多个 WGMMA 而不等待。\n- **仅 tensorize leaf stages**：因 nvcc compiler 约束，仅 tensorize P̃ row-summation（leaf-stage nature 最小化跨 stage register dependency，避免 WGMMA serialization）。\n\n---\n\n### 1.2 Warp/Wavefront 级调度 —— 延迟隐藏与并发粒度\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Warp _ Warp Scheduler.md` (score: 3846), `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Warp Scheduler (NVIDIA GPU).md` (score: 2701), `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/SM Occupancy.md` (score: 4398)\n\n#### 1.2.1 GPU Warp Scheduler 硬件结构\n\nNVIDIA GPU Warp Scheduler 是每个 SM 内部的核心调度硬件。\n\n**Warp Scheduler 硬件架构数据流图**：\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    subgraph SM[\"Streaming Multiprocessor (SM)\"]\n        IB[\"Instruction Buffer (per-warp I-Cache)\"]\n        WS1[\"Warp Scheduler 1\"]\n        WS2[\"Warp Scheduler 2\"]\n        WS3[\"Warp Scheduler 3\"]\n        WS4[\"Warp Scheduler 4\"]\n        DU1[\"Dispatch Unit 1 (2 instr/cycle)\"]\n        DU2[\"Dispatch Unit 2\"]\n        DU3[\"Dispatch Unit 3\"]\n        DU4[\"Dispatch Unit 4\"]\n\n        subgraph EX[\"Execution Units\"]\n            CUDA_C[\"CUDA Cores (FP32/INT32 ALU)\"]\n            TC[\"Tensor Cores (MMA Units)\"]\n            LSU[\"Load/Store Units\"]\n            SFU[\"Special Function Units (MUFU.EX2)\"]\n        end\n\n        RF[\"Register File (per-warp, 32×255×4B)\"]\n        SMEM[\"Shared Memory (up to 228KB H100)\"]\n    end\n\n    HBM[\"HBM/GDDR (Global Memory)\"] -->|\"~400-800 cycles latency\"| LSU\n    WS1 --> DU1\n    WS2 --> DU2\n    WS3 --> DU3\n    WS4 --> DU4\n    DU1 --> CUDA_C\n    DU1 --> TC\n    DU2 --> CUDA_C\n    DU2 --> LSU\n    DU3 --> SFU\n    DU3 --> CUDA_C\n    DU4 --> LSU\n    DU4 --> TC\n    RF --> WS1\n    RF --> WS2\n    RF --> WS3\n    RF --> WS4\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **Warp Scheduler 数量**：Ampere (A100) 每 SM 4 个 Warp Scheduler，每个 scheduler 每 2 周期发射 1 条 warp 指令。峰值发射率: 4 × 0.5 × 1.41GHz ≈ 2.82 warp instr/clock/SM。\n- **零成本切换**：Warp 间切换零成本，因为 SM 有独立 per-warp register file（每个 warp 独占 32×N registers）和 per-warp program counter，无需 context switch。\n- **Dispatch Unit**：每个 Warp Scheduler 配备 1 个 Dispatch Unit，可同时发射 2 条独立指令（dual-issue），条件是两条指令无数据依赖、使用不同的执行单元。\n\n#### 1.2.2 Warp Scheduler 调度策略（推测模型）\n\n```\n// ===== Per-SM, Per-Cycle Warp Scheduling (推测模型) =====\nfunction warp_scheduler_cycle(sm):\n    for each of 4 warp_scheduler_units in sm:\n        eligible_warps = []\n        for warp in scheduler.warp_pool:\n            if warp.is_ready():  // 检查三个条件:\n                // (1) 无 data hazard (operand 在 register file 中就绪)\n                // (2) 无 memory stall (无 pending global memory load)\n                // (3) 无 structural hazard (所需执行单元空闲)\n                eligible_warps.append(warp)\n\n        if eligible_warps is empty:\n            issue NOP  // idle cycle — SM 计算单元闲置\n\n        // 调度策略（逆向工程推测，NVIDIA 未文档化）:\n        if policy == \"greedy-then-oldest\":\n            // 优先: 上一周期发射过的 warp（保持 I-Cache warm）\n            if prev_warp in eligible_warps:\n                issue prev_warp\n            // 次选: 等待最久的 ready warp（LRU）\n            else:\n                issue oldest_ready_warp(eligible_warps)\n        elif policy == \"loose round-robin\":\n            next_warp = round_robin_next(scheduler.warp_pool)\n            while not next_warp.is_ready():\n                next_warp = round_robin_next(scheduler.warp_pool)\n            issue next_warp\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **greedy-then-oldest vs loose round-robin**：Olmedo et al. (2020) 通过微 benchmark 逆向工程推断两种策略共存。Greedy-then-oldest 优先复用上周期 warp（指令 cache 热），次选 LRU；Loose round-robin 按轮转顺序扫描直到找到 ready warp。\n- **Latency Hiding 量化**：Global memory 延迟 ~400-800 cycles (H100 HBM3)。若 SM 上有 64 active warps（A100 max），每个 warp 平均每 64 cycles 才被调度一次——足够隐藏大部分 memory latency。\n- **Fairness 问题**：Warp scheduler 不感知 CUDA stream priority。高优先级 stream 的 warp 和低优先级 stream 的 warp 在 SM 内被同等对待（greedy-then-oldest 策略下）。这导致优先级反转：高优先级 warp 可能被 \"de-prioritized\"。\n- **Occupancy 与 Latency Hiding 关系**：更高 occupancy → 更多 warp 供 scheduler 选择 → 更好的 latency hiding。但 occupancy 受 register 和 shared memory 约束（A100: max 2048 threads/SM = 64 warps/SM; per-thread register 使用增加 → max active warps 减少）。\n\n#### 1.2.3 延迟隐藏的并发粒度模型\n\n**SM Occupancy 与 Warp Stall 的关系**（笔记证据: `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/SM Occupancy.md`）:\n\n```\n场景：memory-intensive kernel（如 MoE expert FFN 中 token dispatch 后的 GEMM）\n\nGPU Utilization = 100%（GPU 始终有 kernel 在运行）\nSM Occupancy < 10%（实际 active warp 极少）\n\n原因分析：\n  - 每个 kernel 因大量 memory access 无法维持高 warp occupancy\n  - Warp 因等待 global memory（~400-800 cycles）被 stall\n  - Warp scheduler 尝试切换 warp 但 kernel 本身并行度不足\n  - 仅少数 warp 处于 \"eligible for execution\" 状态\n\n后果：\n  - 即使 GPU \"100% busy\"，大部分 SM 计算核心闲置\n  - HuntKTm 利用这一观察，通过 hybrid scheduling 提升 SM occupancy 2.47×-3.76×\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **并发粒度层次**：Thread-level (TLP) > Warp-level (warp scheduling) > Instruction-level (ILP) > Bit-level (SIMD/SIMT)。Warp 级并发是关键：通过 warp 间切换隐藏单 warp 的 memory latency。\n- **MoE 模型的特殊挑战**：MoE expert FFN 的 token dispatching 导致非连续的 expert weight 访存模式，memory divergence 加剧 warp stall。专家间 load imbalance 使某些 warp 的等待时间更长。\n\n---\n\n### 1.3 软件流水线（Software Pipelining）—— Async Copy / TMA 与 Producer-Consumer 流水线\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Software Pipelining for GPU Attention Kernels.md` (score: 3306), `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Asynchronous Memory Copy (async-copy).md` (score: 3872), `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Tensor Memory Accelerator (TMA).md` (score: 1575)\n\n#### 1.3.1 Ampere: cp.async + Multi-Stage Pipeline\n\n**Async Copy 硬件机制**（Ampere A100, Compute Capability 8.0）:\n\n```\n// ===== cp.async 硬件运转流程 (Ampere) =====\n// PTX 指令: cp.async.ca.shared.global [dst], [src], 16, 16\n// 硬件实现: LDGSTS (Load Global, Store Shared — 专用硬件路径)\n\n// Multi-Stage Pipeline 状态机:\n// 阶段: Fill → Steady → Drain\n\n// Stage 1: Fill（填充 pipeline）\nfor stage in 0..NUM_STAGES-1:\n    // 发起 N 个异步 copy，填满 pipeline buffer\n    cp.async(smem_buf[stage], gmem_tile[stage])   // 发射后立即返回\n    __pipeline_commit()                            // 提交到 async-copy HW 队列\n// 此时 N 个 stage 的 copy 在后台并行执行\n\n// Stage 2: Steady State（稳态流水线）\nfor tile_idx in NUM_STAGES..total_tiles:\n    __pipeline_wait_prior(NUM_STAGES-1)            // 等待 oldest copy 完成\n\n    // === Compute on oldest completed tile ===\n    ldmatrix(reg_tile, smem_buf[tile_idx % NUM_STAGES])\n    mma_sync(acc, reg_tile_A, reg_tile_B)         // Tensor Core MMA\n\n    // === 发射新 copy（下一 tile）===\n    cp.async(smem_buf[tile_idx % NUM_STAGES], gmem_tile[tile_idx])\n    __pipeline_commit()\n\n// Stage 3: Drain（排空 pipeline）\nfor stage in 0..NUM_STAGES-1:\n    __pipeline_wait_prior(0)\n    // Compute on remaining tiles\n    ldmatrix(...)\n    mma_sync(...)\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **cp.async 粒度**：支持 4/8/16 字节 copy。16 字节 copy 使用 L1 BYPASS 模式，数据直达 shared memory，不经过 L1 cache——避免污染 L1。\n- **硬件实现**：cp.async 由 SM 内的专用 LDGSTS 硬件路径执行，类似 SM 内的微型 DMA Engine。不占用 CUDA Core 计算资源。\n- **Pipeline Depth**：NUM_STAGES 通常 2-5。更深 pipeline  → 更好的 memory-compute overlap，但更多 shared memory 消耗 → 可能降低 occupancy。\n- **Double Buffering**：最小配置 NUM_STAGES=2（ping-pong），一个 buffer 被 async-copy 填充，另一 buffer 被计算消费。\n- **Memory-Bound Kernel 收益**：在 memory-bound kernel（如 MoE expert weight loading）中，软件流水线将计算隐藏在 memory 加载之后，使 kernel 接近 pure memory bandwidth bound，减少 warp stall。\n\n#### 1.3.2 Hopper: TMA + Warp Specialization\n\n**TMA 硬件架构与运转流程**（笔记证据: `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Tensor Memory Accelerator (TMA).md`）:\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    subgraph SM_Hopper[\"SM (Hopper H100)\"]\n        DMA_WARP[\"DMA Warp (32 threads, only T0 active)\"]\n        TMA_UNIT[\"TMA Hardware Unit (per-SM fixed-function)\"]\n        MBAR[\"mbarrier (shared memory barrier)\"]\n        SMEM[\"Shared Memory (up to 228KB)\"]\n        COMP_WG[\"Compute Warpgroup (4 warps = 128 threads)\"]\n        TC_HOPPER[\"Tensor Core (WGMMA, FP8/FP16)\"]\n    end\n\n    L2[\"L2 Cache (50MB H100)\"] --> TMA_UNIT\n    HBM3[\"HBM3 (80GB, 3.35TB/s)\"] --> L2\n\n    DMA_WARP -->|\"TMA_load(descriptor, barrier)\"| TMA_UNIT\n    TMA_UNIT -->|\"burst copy 64-256KB tiles\"| SMEM\n    TMA_UNIT -->|\"auto-arrive(mbarrier)\"| MBAR\n    MBAR -->|\"wait(mbarrier)\"| COMP_WG\n    COMP_WG --> TC_HOPPER\n    SMEM --> COMP_WG\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **TMA vs cp.async 关键差异**：(1) TMA 仅需 **1 个线程**发出指令（vs cp.async 需全 warp 参与），其余 31 线程可同时计算；(2) **无寄存器中转**：数据直接在 GMEM↔SMEM 移动（cp.async 经过寄存器）；(3) **硬件 barrier 集成**：TMA completion 自动写入 mbarrier，consumer 通过 `wait(mbarrier)` 高效同步，无需 spin-wait；(4) **Multicast**：TMA 可单次操作将同一 tile 广播到多个 SM 的 shared memory（FlashAttention 的关键优化）。\n- **带宽效率**：Hopper TMA 在仅 2KB 消息大小时就能达到 74% 峰值 NVLink 带宽（vs Copy Engine 需 256MB）。\n- **TMA 描述符**：存储在 constant memory 或寄存器（每描述符 128 字节），由 `cuTensorMapEncodeTiled` 创建，描述 2D/3D tile 形状、数据类型、layout。\n\n#### 1.3.3 Producer-Consumer 流水线的指令级时序\n\n**FlashAttention-3 的 Pingpong Scheduling**（笔记证据: `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/FlashAttention-3/3-FlashAttention-3-Algorithm.md`）:\n\n```\n// ===== FA-3 Producer-Consumer Pipeline: Instruction-Level Timeline =====\n// 2 warpgroups: Producer (1 WG) + Consumer (1 WG)\n\n// T0: Producer issues TMA loads — 不阻塞\nT0:  PROD: TMA_load(Q_tile,     completion=bar_Q)\nT1:  PROD: TMA_load(K_tile[0],  completion=bar_K[0])\nT2:  PROD: TMA_load(V_tile[0],  completion=bar_V[0])\n     // Consumer 等待第一批数据\nT3:  CONS: wait(bar_Q, bar_K[0], bar_V[0])\n     // Consumer 开始计算，Producer 预取下一 tile\nT4:  CONS: wgmma_commit(Q_tile, K_tile[0])       // QK^T WGMMA 异步发射\n     PROD: TMA_load(K_tile[1], completion=bar_K[1])  // || 预取 K[1]\nT5:  CONS: wgmma_wait()  → S_tile                // QK^T 完成\n     PROD: TMA_load(V_tile[1], completion=bar_V[1])  // || 预取 V[1]\nT6:  CONS: softmax_warp(S_tile)                   // CUDA Core softmax\n     // Producer K[1],V[1] 已在后台传输完成\nT7:  CONS: wgmma_commit(P_tilde, V_tile[0])       // PV WGMMA\n     PROD: TMA_load(K_tile[2], completion=bar_K[2])  // || 预取 K[2]\nT8:  CONS: wgmma_wait() → O_partial\n     PROD: TMA_load(V_tile[2], completion=bar_V[2])  // || 预取 V[2]\n// 从 T4 开始：Producer load(K/V[j+1]) || Consumer compute(K/V[j])\n// 完全重叠 — 计算隐藏所有 memory latency\n\n// 硬件利用率时间线:\n// Tensor Core:   |_idle_|████ QK^T ████|_idle_|████ PV ████|...\n// CUDA Core:     |_idle_|_idle_|██ softmax ██|_idle_|...\n// TMA (memory):  |██ Q ██|██ K0 ██|██ V0 ██|██ K1 ██|██ V1 ██|██ K2 ██|...\n// Shared Memory: |-- fill buf[0] --|-- consume buf[0] --|-- fill buf[1] --|...\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **关键瓶颈分析**：H100 SXM5 有 989 TFLOPS FP16 matmul 但仅 3.9 TFLOPS 特殊函数（如 exponential）。Attention forward pass (head dim 128): matmul FLOPS 是 exp 的 512×，但 exp 吞吐是 matmul 的 1/256×，导致 exp 可能占用 50% 的 cycle。Software pipelining 将 softmax(exp) 与 GEMM 重叠，缓解此瓶颈。\n- **Warp-Specialization 的硬件基础**：Hopper SM 支持在一个 cycle 内调度不同 warpgroup 的指令——producer warpgroup 发出 TMA 后立即 yield，consumer warpgroup 在同一 cycle 执行 WGMMA。\n- **Ping-Pong Buffer 大小**：需 ≥2 个 stage buffer，每个 buffer 大小为 tile_size（典型 64-256KB for attention）。\n\n---\n\n### 1.4 指令混合 —— MMA 与 ALU 指令的协同调度\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_moe/Samoyeds/span-idpage-4-2span4.1-Dual-sided-Sparse-Data-Format-and-Kernel-Scheme.md` (score: 936), `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Tensor-Vector Parallelism Scheduling (ILP_TLP for Softmax).md` (score: 5050)\n\n#### 1.4.1 GEMM Attention Kernel 中的 MMA-ALU 指令混合\n\n```\n// ===== MMA + ALU 指令混合伪代码（MoE Expert FFN Kernel, H100）=====\n// 场景: MoE expert FFN 的 GEMM + SiLU activation 融合 kernel\n// 硬件: H100 Hopper, WGMMA for GEMM, CUDA Core for SiLU\n\n// 指令混合编排（per warpgroup, consumer side）:\nfor tile_k in 0..K_tiles:\n    // Step 1: 异步发射 WGMMA（不阻塞 ALU）\n    wgmma_commit_group(tile_k % 2)           // 发射 GEMM tile_k\n    // wgmma 在 Tensor Core 后台执行，下面指令立即在 CUDA Core 执行\n\n    // Step 2: 在 WGMMA issue bubble 中执行 element-wise ALU\n    // 对上一 tile 的结果做 SiLU activation\n    if tile_k > 0:\n        // SiLU(x) = x * sigmoid(x)\n        // 利用 CUDA Core FMA + MUFU 指令:\n        x = reg_out[tile_k - 1]              // 从 register file 加载\n        sig = mufu_sigmoid(x)                 // MUFU.SIG (SFU, ~8 cycles)\n        silu = fma(x, sig, 0.0f)             // FMA (CUDA Core, ~4 cycles)\n\n    // Step 3: 加载下一 tile 的 weight（与 MMA + ALU 重叠）\n    cp.async.bulk(smem_weight[next_k], gmem_weight[next_k])  // TMA\n\n    // Step 4: 同步 WGMMA\n    wgmma_wait_group(tile_k % 2)\n    reg_out[tile_k] = wgmma_result           // WGMMA 结果进 register\n\n// CUDA Core（ALU）利用率提升分析:\n// 传统串行: |-- WGMMA --|-- SiLU --|-- WGMMA --|-- SiLU --|\n// 指令混合: |-- WGMMA(tile_k) --|-- WGMMA(tile_k+1) --|\n//           |-- SiLU(tile_k-1) --|-- SiLU(tile_k) --|\n// ALU 利用率: 从 <50% 提升至接近 100%\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **指令混合的硬件基础**：GPU SM 有独立的 Tensor Core 和 CUDA Core 执行管线。Tensor Core WGMMA 指令发射后（通过 `wgmma_commit_group`），不占用 CUDA Core 执行资源，CUDA Core 可同时执行 FMA、MUFU、REDUX 等 ALU 指令。\n- **Dual-Issue 能力**：Ampere/Hopper SM 的每个 Warp Scheduler 每周期最多发射 2 条指令——1 条发往 Tensor Core + 1 条发往 CUDA Core（需不同执行单元、无数据依赖）。指令混合编排的关键是将 MMA 和 ALU 指令在 warp 指令流中交替排列。\n- **MoE 的特殊机会**：MoE expert FFN 中有大量 element-wise activation（SiLU、GeLU、SwiGLU），这些操作通常是 compute-bound kernel 中的 \"bubble\"——指令混合使这些 bubble 被 GEMM 隐藏。\n- **寄存器压力**：指令混合需要同时保持 GEMM accumulator 和 activation 中间结果在 register file 中。若 register 不足 → spill to shared memory → 性能下降。\n\n#### 1.4.2 MMA.sp 指令与 Sparse ALU 混合（Samoyeds, 辅助说明）\n\nSamoyeds 利用 Hopper 的 `mma.sp` 指令（sparse MMA）实现 MoE expert FFN 的 2:4 structured sparsity GEMM。指令混合策略将 MMA.sp 的 metadata 加载与 expert routing mask 的 element-wise ALU 操作重叠。笔记提供了 sparse MMA 与 ALU 混合的概念描述，具体实现细节（如 CUTLASS 3.x sparse GEMM kernel 的指令 pipeline 布局）笔记未完全展开。\n\n---\n\n### 1.5 硬件平台差异 —— GPU SIMT vs NPU VLIW vs TPU XLA\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Hexagon NPU HVX+HMX Architecture.md` (text mode), `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/RPU ISA _ CISC-style ISA for AI Accelerators.md` (text mode), `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/LUT-based Dequantization and Softmax on NPU Vector Units.md` (text mode)\n\n#### 1.5.1 硬件平台指令编排对比表\n\n| 维度 | GPU SIMT (NVIDIA H100) | GPU SIMT (AMD MI300X) | NPU VLIW (Qualcomm Hexagon) | NPU (华为昇腾 910B) | TPU (Google v5p) |\n|------|------------------------|------------------------|-----------------------------|---------------------|------------------|\n| **指令模型** | SIMT (RISC-like) | SIMT (RISC-like) | VLIW (4 slots/thread) | 达芬奇架构 (Cube+Vector+Scalar) | VLIW/XLA (128×128 MXU) |\n| **调度方式** | HW warp scheduler (4/SM) | HW wavefront scheduler | 编译器静态调度 (VLIW slot 分配) | 编译器分派到 Cube/Vector/Scalar | XLA compiler 静态编排 |\n| **并发粒度** | Warp (32 threads) | Wavefront (64 threads) | VLIW thread (6-8 HW threads) | Cube/Vector/Scalar 三单元并行 | 128×128 systolic array |\n| **ILP 机制** | Dual-issue (TC+CUDA Core) | Dual-issue (MAC+ALU) | 4 VLIW slots/cycle | 指令级 Cube+Vector 并行 | VLIW bundle |\n| **延迟隐藏** | Warp 切换 (零成本) | Wavefront 切换 | 软件管理 (DMA double buffer) | 流水线并行 (Cube/Vector overlap) | XLA 静态 overlap |\n| **寄存器压力** | 255 registers/thread, occupancy 约束 | 256 registers/thread | 32×1024-bit vector regs/thread | 达芬奇 L0/L1 buffer | MXU 内部 accumulator |\n| **异步拷贝** | TMA (Hopper) / cp.async (Ampere) | ROCm async copy | DMA engine (DDR↔TCM) | 昇腾 DMA (HBM↔L1) | XLA 静态 data transfer schedule |\n| **流水线深度** | 2-5 stages (software) | 2-5 stages | 3-stage (LOADING/LOOPING/LAUNCHING) | 编译期确定 | XLA 静态确定 |\n\n#### 1.5.2 NPU VLIW 指令编排（Qualcomm Hexagon）\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Hexagon NPU HVX+HMX Architecture.md`\n\nHexagon NPU 的 VLIW 指令编排：\n\n```\n// ===== Hexagon NPU VLIW Instruction Bundle =====\n// 每 cycle 发射 1 个 VLIW packet（4 slots）\n// Slot 分配由编译器静态完成\n\nVLIW_Packet:\n    S0: scalar ALU op    // 地址计算、循环控制\n    S1: vector ALU op    // HVX: vadd, vmul, vrelu\n    S2: vector load      // HVX: vgather, vlut16\n    S3: matrix op        // HMX: tile-level GEMM (32×32 FP16)\n\n// 典型 decode GEMM 的 VLIW 编排（per cycle）:\ncycle_0:  S0: addr_calc(next_tile)  | S1: NOP        | S2: vgather(act)   | S3: HMX_mma(tile_0)\ncycle_1:  S0: loop_ctrl             | S1: vlut16(deq) | S2: vgather(wgt)   | S3: HMX_mma(tile_0) // HMX 多周期\ncycle_2:  S0: NOP                   | S1: vmul(scale) | S2: NOP            | S3: HMX_mma(tile_1)\ncycle_3:  S0: addr_calc(next_tile)  | S1: vrelu(act)  | S2: DMA_prefetch   | S3: HMX_mma(tile_1)\n\n// VLIW 约束:\n// - 4 slots 必须全部可填充（否则插入 NOP → 效率损失）\n// - S0-S3 间不能有数据依赖（编译器需提前调度）\n// - HMX (S3) 仅访问 TCM（Tightly Coupled Memory），不直接访问 DDR\n// - vgather 延迟: 24-48 VLIW packets on V75\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **VLIW vs SIMT 的根本差异**：GPU SIMT 依赖硬件 warp scheduler 动态调度——warp stall 时自动切换，程序员不感知调度细节。NPU VLIW 依赖编译器静态调度——编译器必须在编译期确定所有指令的 slot 分配和延迟，无运行时动态切换。\n- **VLIW 的 NOP 问题**：若编译器无法填满 4 slots（因数据依赖或资源冲突），插入 NOP → 执行单元闲置。GPU SIMT 通过 warp 切换避免此问题。\n- **软件管理内存**：Hexagon NPU 的 8MiB TCM 完全由软件管理（类似 scratchpad），编译器需显式编排 DMA 搬运。GPU 有硬件管理的 L1/L2 cache 层次。\n- **类似架构**：华为昇腾 Ascend NPU 的达芬奇架构也采用 Cube Unit + Vector Unit + Scalar Unit 的三单元设计，指令分派到不同单元并行执行。笔记未提供昇腾的具体 VLIW slot 细节。\n\n#### 1.5.3 CISC-style ISA（RPU）对比\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/RPU ISA _ CISC-style ISA for AI Accelerators.md`\n\nRPU 提出第三种范式——CISC-style ISA：\n\n```\n// ===== RPU CISC 指令 vs GPU RISC 指令对比 =====\n\n// GPU (RISC-like): 每指令 ~1 操作，依赖 warp scheduler 动态调度\nld.shared r1, [sA_addr]        // 1 指令: 加载\nmma.sync r2, r1, r3            // 1 指令: MMA\nst.shared [sO_addr], r2        // 1 指令: 存储\n\n// RPU (CISC-style): 每指令封装 ~1000 MAC 操作，固定 streaming schedule\n// LOADING stage:\nMEM_DMA.load(HBM_addr, mem_buf_entry, valid_count=1)\n// LOOPING stage:\nfor each stripe:\n    TMAC.compute()             // 1 指令: 完整 VMM stripe（~千 MAC）\n    tree_sum()                 // reduction\n// 无动态调度 — 硬件 pipeline 在 input ready 时自动前进\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **RPU 的确定性调度**：消除 GPU 的 host-driven offload model 和 runtime kernel launch/scheduling overhead。RPU core 完全自主执行（autonomous execution）。\n- **Groq LPU 类似思想**：笔记未提供 Groq LPU 的详细资料，但从搜索结果的 StreamTensor 论文可推断 Groq 也采用 deterministic scheduling——编译器确定所有数据移动和计算的精确时序。\n\n---\n\n## 2. 是什么？—— 指令编排与软件流水线的核心概念\n\n**笔记证据**: 综合上述所有笔记\n\n### 核心概念层级\n\n| 概念 | 定义 | 硬件基础 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| **ILP** | 单 warp/wavefront 内多条独立指令并行发射 | GPU dual-issue、NPU VLIW slots |\n| **TLP** | 多 warp/wavefront 并发执行，warp scheduler 切换隐藏延迟 | 独立 per-warp register file + PC |\n| **Software Pipelining** | 将 memory load 与 compute 组织为流水线阶段，第 i+1 个 tile 的 load 与第 i 个 tile 的 compute 重叠 | TMA / cp.async / DMA engine |\n| **Warp Specialization** | 同一 block 内 warps 按功能分组（producer/consumer），各组执行不同任务 | Hopper warpgroup + mbarrier |\n| **Instruction Mix** | MMA 指令与 ALU 指令交替编排，利用 Tensor Core 与 CUDA Core 的独立执行管线 | 独立 TC + CUDA Core 执行单元 |\n| **Latency Hiding** | 当某 warp stall 时（memory/execution dependency），warp scheduler 立即切换到另一 ready warp | 零成本 warp 切换 |\n\n---\n\n## 3. 实现 —— 典型框架中的指令编排实践 (辅助说明)\n\n### 3.1 FlashAttention-3 的 Warp-Specialized Pipeline\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/FlashAttention-3/3-FlashAttention-3-Algorithm.md` (score: 1588)\n\nFA-3 在 Hopper GPU 上的实现要点：\n- **2 Warpgroups**：Producer (1 WG) 通过 TMA 异步加载 K/V tiles → Consumer (1 WG) 执行 GEMM + softmax\n- **Pingpong Scheduling**：softmax (CUDA Core) 与 GEMM (Tensor Core) 在不同 warpgroup 间重叠\n- **setmaxnreg**：使用 `setmaxnreg` 指令动态 (de)alloc 寄存器，优化 warpgroup 间的 register 分配\n- **FP8 支持**：利用 Hopper FP8 WGMMA (2× throughput vs FP16)，但 softmax 仍在 FP32 精度\n\n### 3.2 CUTLASS 3.x 的 Software Pipelining\n\nCUTLASS 3.x 的 Hopper GEMM kernel 采用 warp-specialized pipeline：\n- Producer warpgroup: TMA load global→shared (A/B matrix tiles)\n- Consumer warpgroups: WGMMA computation\n- Multi-stage software pipeline (typically PIPE_STAGES=3-5)\n- 通过 CuTe 库的 `cute::copy` with TMA backend 封装 TMA 操作\n\n(笔记 `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Warp-Group Specialization (Hopper GPU).md` 提供了 CUTLASS 3.x 的 warpgroup 概述但未展开具体 GEMM kernel 配置。)\n\n### 3.3 MoE Kernel 中的指令混合实践\n\nMoE expert FFN kernel 的指令混合策略（综合多个笔记推断）：\n- GEMM tile 通过 WGMMA/TMA 流水线执行\n- Expert routing mask 的 element-wise multiply 与 GEMM 重叠\n- Activation (SiLU/GeLU) 在前一 tile 的 WGMMA issue bubble 中执行\n- Samoyeds 利用 mma.sp 指令实现 2:4 sparsity GEMM，sparse metadata 加载与 element-wise mask 混合\n\n---\n\n## 4. 实验环境 (辅助说明)\n\n**笔记证据**: 综合多个笔记的硬件规格描述\n\n### 4.1 关键评估指标\n\n| 指标 | 说明 | 典型值 / 来源 |\n|------|------|-------------|\n| **SM Occupancy** | Active warps / Max warps per SM | Memory-bound kernel 可 <10%（HuntKTm 测量） |\n| **MFU** | Actual FLOPS / Peak FLOPS | FA-3 H100 FP16 forward: 论文提及提升显著 |\n| **TMA 带宽利用率** | Achieved BW / Peak HBM BW | H100: 74% at 2KB message (TMA, 笔记来源) |\n| **Warp Stall Cycles** | Warp 因 memory/exec dependency 等待的 cycle 比例 | Memory-bound kernel 可 >80% |\n| **流水线 Efficiency** | T_compute / (T_compute + T_memory_stall) | Software pipelined: >90%（笔记推断） |\n\n### 4.2 硬件平台规格\n\n| 平台 | SM/CU 数量 | Shared Memory/SM | HBM 带宽 | 关键指令特性 |\n|------|-----------|------------------|----------|-------------|\n| H100 (Hopper) | 132 SM | 228KB | 3.35TB/s | TMA, WGMMA, FP8, mbarrier |\n| A100 (Ampere) | 108 SM | 164KB | 2.0TB/s | cp.async, MMA.sp (2:4), no TMA |\n| MI300X (CDNA3) | 304 CU | 64KB/CU | 5.3TB/s | ROCm wavefront (64 threads) |\n| 昇腾 910B | 达芬奇架构 | L0: 64KB, L1: 1MB | 1.6TB/s | Cube+Vector+Scalar 三单元 |\n| TPU v5p | 1 core = 1 MXU | VPU memory | — | MXU 128×128, XLA static schedule |\n\n---\n\n## 5. 方法对比表\n\n| 方法 | 核心机制 | ILP/TLP 策略 | 异步拷贝 | 适用模型 | 硬件平台 | 笔记证据 |\n|------|----------|-------------|----------|----------|----------|----------|\n| **FlashAttention-T ILP** | Tensor-Vector Parallelism: MMA+ALU interleaving | ILP (Ampere): MMA/vector 指令在 warp 内交替; TLP (Hopper): 2 warpgroups 并行 | Ampere: 无特殊 async copy; Hopper: TMA + WGMMA | DiT attention, 多模态 cross-attention | A100, H100 | ILP/TLP note (score:5050) |\n| **FlashAttention-3** | Warp specialization + pingpong scheduling | 2 warpgroups: GEMM-softmax overlap | TMA + WGMMA async | Video spatial-temporal attention, DiT | H100 (Hopper) | FA-3 note (score:1588) |\n| **GLA Kernel** | Warp specialization + software pipelining | Producer-consumer warps: TMA load // MMA compute | TMA (contiguous) / cp.async (paged) | 多模态, Video decode | H100, A100 | HW-Efficient Attn (score:392) |\n| **CUTLASS 3.x GEMM** | Multi-stage software pipeline + warp specialization | Producer WG (TMA) + Consumer WGs (WGMMA) | TMA bulk transfer | MoE expert FFN GEMM | H100 (Hopper) | TMA note (score:1575) |\n| **Samoyeds MoE** | MMA.sp + element-wise ALU 混合 | Sparse MMA + CUDA Core mask apply 并行 | cp.async (Ampere) | MoE sparse expert FFN | A100, H100 | Samoyeds note (score:936) |\n| **Hexagon NPU VLIW** | 4-slot VLIW: S0(scalar)+S1(vector)+S2(load)+S3(matrix) | 编译器静态 slot 分配, 6-8 HW threads | DMA engine DDR↔TCM | 多模态 mobile inference | Hexagon V73/V75/V79 | Hexagon NPU (text) |\n| **RPU CISC ISA** | CISC 指令封装千 MAC, 固定 streaming schedule | 无动态调度, pipeline arbiter 硬件同步 | MEM_DMA, NET_DMA | LLM decode | RPU (research) | RPU ISA note (text) |\n| **HuntKTm Hybrid** | Multi-kernel SM 空间共享提升 occupancy | SM occupancy 提升 2.47-3.76× | — | MoE, 多模态 (memory-bound) | A100 | SM Occupancy (score:4398) |\n\n---\n\n## 6. 不确定性\n\n以下方面笔记证据不足或缺失，标注为推断或缺失：\n\n1. **TPU XLA 指令编排细节**：笔记中未找到 Google TPU v5e/v5p 的 XLA 编译器指令编排、VLIW bundle 结构、MXU pipeline 深度的详细描述。上述 TPU 相关内容基于公开知识的推断，标注为「笔记未明确说明」。\n\n2. **AMD MI300X Wavefront 调度**：笔记中未找到 AMD CDNA3 架构 wavefront scheduler 的详细描述（wavefront 数量、调度策略、与 NVIDIA warp scheduler 的差异）。标注为「笔记未明确说明」。\n\n3. **华为昇腾 Ascend 910B 指令编排**：笔记中未找到昇腾达芬奇架构 Cube Unit / Vector Unit / Scalar Unit 的具体指令格式、VLIW slot 分配、TBE/TIK 编译器指令调度的详细描述。Hexagon NPU 的 VLIW 描述可作为类似架构的参考。标注为「笔记未明确说明」。\n\n4. **Groq LPU 确定性调度**：搜索仅获得 StreamTensor 论文的间接引用（score: 261），缺少 Groq Compiler 确定性调度的具体指令 pipeline 时序描述。标注为「笔记未明确说明」。\n\n5. **DiT/Video 特定 kernel 的指令编排**：笔记中主要覆盖了通用 attention kernel (FlashAttention-3) 和 MoE expert FFN kernel 的指令编排。DiT diffusion denoising 的特定 attention+MLP kernel、Video 的 spatial-temporal attention kernel 的具体指令编排未找到专门笔记。\n\n6. **Scoreboarding 硬件实现**：NVIDIA GPU 的 scoreboarding 机制（跟踪寄存器写后读/写后写依赖的硬件表）未在笔记中找到详细描述。Warp Scheduler 笔记有推断模型但未涉及 scoreboard 硬件结构。标注为「笔记未明确说明」。\n\n7. **Multi-Instance GPU (MIG) 对指令编排的影响**：笔记未涉及 MIG 分区如何影响 warp scheduler 的行为和指令级并发。标注为「笔记未明确说明」。\n\n8. **Dual-Issue 精确约束**：GPU 的 dual-issue（每周期 2 条指令）的具体约束条件（哪些指令对可 co-issue、哪些执行单元互斥）笔记中未提供精度描述。目前的 dual-issue 描述基于公开 NVIDIA 文档的推断。\n\n[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] L4-Q4.2\n","userModified":false}}
